    voice "voice/anton/5day/021esh.ogg"
    Ant "Eat up."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_9c3cd7b1:


    "Newspapers with mom's crosswords acted as a makeshift oilcloth—I spread them around the floor so as not to get the floor dirty."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_ea067aa4:


    "Seems like my dad, who was constantly busy, forgot to sharpen our knives."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_6e9cc073:


    "I felt dizzy at the thought that I'd need to slaughter a writhing Zhulka like a pig."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_11db1bf5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/022.ch.ogg"
    Ant "How do I make it the least painful for you..."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_05359f7b:


    "Someone else smirked inside me."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_3e1698bc:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023Tieto.ogg"
    Ant "Listen... I need you to stay here for now."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_76aa69e8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023po.ogg"
    Ant "I'll go grab the axe and kill you, okay?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_4f9c4ab0:


    "With a look of resignation in its eyes, the dog started its last dinner."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a011756c:


    "My legs gained ten kilograms each as I shambled toward the attic."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_b451e4af:


    "As I peered into the darkness, I was scared that I would come face-to-face with a goat's maw, feel the stench of his dirty fur, and his cold fingers grasping my neck."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d10866c5:


    "The attic was empty."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_6bd95844:


    "The axe lay with its blade toward me, casting a sinister shadow."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d43b38eb:


    "My fingers locked around the handle."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_5e81563e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023.pom.ogg"
    Ant "Remember... It's either the dog or your sister."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_3a17c4f7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023.so.ogg"
    Ant "It's either the dog or yourself."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_3d8c89fb:


    "I felt unending hatred toward myself, toward that stupid, totally innocent dog, toward my parents, who had abandoned us and driven away in their car, and toward the beasts that had left me no choice..."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_ecfa8b48:


    "I hated the entire world."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_3fe29fef:


    "With that anger in my heart and my axe at the ready, I entered the kitchen to execute the last part of my plan."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d3f930ec:


    "Zhulka stood on its hind legs while Olya rubbed it at the scruff."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_75ff9d28:


    "My sister leaned against the table to stop herself from falling over."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a779352c:


    "I dropped the tool and rushed toward the exhausted Olya."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_bb751df3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/026.ti.ogg"
    Ant "Why did you get up?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_9d5cd8e5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/08 Us.ogg"
    Oly "I heard... the doggy barking."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_64d06d04:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/09 Mne.ogg"
    Oly "I feel better already."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a8ab68d3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/027.ne.ogg"
    Ant "Don't lie to me! Let's get you back in bed!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_22936750:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/10 Pr.ogg"
    Oly "But I do, honest."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_5d1f3ca1:


    "She let go of the tabletop's edge to prove that she wasn't going to fall unconscious on me."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_0240b449:


    "Her cheeks reddened."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_7c2cbc4d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/028.Ya.ogg"
    "I sighed after touching my sister's cold forehead."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_c1a77f11:


    "I realized that I'd kill anybody to ensure her safety."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_f9ff7081:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/11 Aot.ogg"
    Oly "Where did the doggy come from? Are we adopting it?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_c71ae78d:


    "I stood in front of the axe I dropped, ashamed."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_3d73a987:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/029.Za.ogg"
    Ant "I let it in because it was cold. It'll leave as soon as it warms up."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_4be77b97:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/030.un.ogg"
    Ant "It has puppies to take care of, we can't keep it."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_486afaa5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/12 Mi.ogg"
    Oly "We can take the puppies, too. It'll be so cool!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_4bc66adf:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/030.ne.ogg"
    Ant "I don't think Mom will like that idea."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d2fe6edc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/13 Am.ogg"
    Oly "We'll ask her super hard!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_09ddd1b6:


    "The stray rubbed against Olya's legs."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_4ee2fd40:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/031.da.ogg"
    Ant "It probably has lice. Zhulka, no!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_bd4b49e8:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/14 Ee.ogg"
    Oly "Is it a girl? Is her name Zhulka?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a3612b8e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/15 Zu.ogg"
    Oly "Zhulka! You're ours now."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_20e6d0a7:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/16 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "Don't worry, girl, nobody will harm you here."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_704f6290:


    "Olya took a sausage out of the fridge and threw it to the dog. {nw}"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_f5fb0317:


    extend "It chomped on the treat with enthusiasm, even though I had already fed an entire portion of beef bones to it."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_1a38b88a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/032.ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'd go take a nap if I were you."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d3235530:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/032.ma.ogg"
    Ant "Dad will bring the doctor soon, and Mom will get your meds."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_1ff4dbfe:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/17 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I don't want to sleep anymore. I had a nightmare."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_958c039c:


    "She spoke slowly, her eyes downcast."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_7176bf8c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/033.da.ogg"
    Ant "I know."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_103a3348:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/18 Av.ogg"
    Oly "No, you don't!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_6d52db11:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/19 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "You were in that dream, but how would you know?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_425ae92c:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/20 Aya.ogg"
    Oly "And I won't tell you."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_b13ed5e4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/21 Po.ogg"
    Oly "Because it was a very, very bad dream. But now..."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_bd84fa16:


    "Olya's face brightened up, her lips formed a smile."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_0dce5dd3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/22 Tep.ogg"
    Oly "I have Zhulka now, everything will be okay."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a7f2d217:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/23 Ona.ogg"
    Oly "She will bark if that scary owl comes, and we'll wake up and hide."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a36051ef:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/24 E.ogg"
    Oly "And then they won't find us."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_52ad5b71:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/034.ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, I doubt this mangy thing can protect us."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_f98de6cd:


    "Yet my sister had already made up her mind."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_c3cd3c89:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/25 Es.ogg"
    Oly "She can, she can!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_bd41e5ea:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/26 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "You'll protect us, right? Right, doggy!?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_50aa8006:


    "The stray barked in approval."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_c4815def:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/28 Um.ogg"
    Oly "I have something for you. Wait here!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_75d5bca4:


    "Olya ran toward the stairs. I heard them creak."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_76f88768:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/035.ost.ogg"
    Ant "Careful!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_372ec0bc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/29 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I'll be back! Look after Zhulka!"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_a08bc342:


    "I stared at the dog, stunned by how lively Olya was now, despite being delirious from a fever just minutes ago."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_2f111f60:


    "Zhulka finished her sausage and switched to licking the floor."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_dfc8a6f3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/036.vdr.ogg"
    Ant "Trying to cozy up to me, huh?"


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_37034086:


    "I was Olya's only friend."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_ebd22219:


    "I was her savior. I could at least try to save her."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_60ed276e:


    "But to do that..."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_8923f3f3:


    "I picked up the axe from the floor."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_399449b6:


    "Zhulka, as if sensing something, rushed after Olya. But I stood in the dog's way in front of the staircase."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_7ac512f7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/037.Un.ogg"
    Ant "We don't have much time. Olya will be back soon."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_d3f80f23:


    "I tightened my grip on the axe. It weighed a ton now."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_daf7f0d3:


    "The little dog followed all of my movements with its eyes."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_f3f68e1f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/038.ne.ogg"
    Ant "Don't be afraid..."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_6b429c3c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/038.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I know that all dogs go to Heaven."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_26c422af:


    "Its tail jumped back and forth."


translate english phase1_zhulka_devend_0b5ab561:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/039.Da.ogg"
    Ant "Stop being so cute, damn it!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_12e586a9:


    "What am I doing?"


translate english zhulka_mercy_e1d9b438:


    "How will I be different from the sadists from my school if I hurt an innocent dog? Especially when it looks at me with eyes this intelligent..."


translate english zhulka_mercy_c29b5b3f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/040.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "I can't!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_b4f0c4e2:


    "I dropped the axe, exhausted."


translate english zhulka_mercy_4127f68e:


    "Beads of sweat rolled down my body under my clothes, my breathing ragged. It felt like I just ran a one-hundred-meter sprint."


translate english zhulka_mercy_a4aa3b06:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/043.Yane.ogg"
    Ant "I'm not a killer."


translate english zhulka_mercy_b7200c39:


    "Zhulka yapped as if agreeing with me."


translate english zhulka_mercy_bca7ab6f:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/30 Y.ogg"
    Oly "I brought some toys for the doggy!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_c9f4542f:


    "Olya hopped down the stairs. She was clutching a bright ribbon in one of her hands, and a rubber ball in another."


translate english zhulka_mercy_4b7e1f01:


    "I pushed the axe under the phone table with my foot and, with a sad smirk on my face, watched my sister sigh in adoration."


translate english zhulka_mercy_31db493e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/31 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "You're safe now!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_4e612dc2:


    "But what about us?"


translate english zhulka_mercy_d6bd749d:


    "The windows seemed so fragile, the shadows outside—so alive."


translate english zhulka_mercy_a109a9d0:


    "Olya tied the ribbon around the dog's neck like an improvised collar."


translate english zhulka_mercy_1f36344e:


    "Then she made Zhulka chase the ball, baring its teeth in a bout of canine happiness, all to Olya's amusement."


translate english zhulka_mercy_cf1673e8:


    "My sister's laughter was priceless even at a moment like that."


translate english zhulka_mercy_d80f1dc5:


    "It felt like nothing bad had ever happened, and our parents were about to return, and her fever was about to subside..."


translate english zhulka_mercy_8b663e0e:


    "...and the Black Garage never existed."


translate english zhulka_mercy_c315e2f6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/33 Poc.ogg"
    Oly "Why can't we just turn into dogs?"


translate english zhulka_mercy_dbfbc337:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/34 El.ogg"
    Oly "Or some other animal. We'd run around, have fun!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_56e3ce73:


    "A foreboding feeling tugged at my heart."


translate english zhulka_mercy_b4a5fcee:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/044.Po.ogg"
    Ant "Because we're humans."


translate english zhulka_mercy_d0567841:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/36 Scu.ogg"
    Oly "That's boring!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_f69c0773:


    "Olya tapped the floor."


translate english zhulka_mercy_aa36408a:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/37 Sid.ogg"
    Oly "Sit!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_221a317f:


    "Zhulka yapped in confusion."


translate english zhulka_mercy_3a63f5dd:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/045.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Not cut out to work in the circus, huh?"


translate english zhulka_mercy_4be75f5b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/38 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I'll teach her lots of commands, you'll see!"


translate english zhulka_mercy_4151b1bc:


    "Olya yawned and lay on her side, there and then, on the floor. The ball rolled away from her, attracting the stupid dog."


translate english zhulka_mercy_16c41143:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/39 Kak.ogg"
    Oly "So... sleepy."


translate english zhulka_mercy_eb2b9cae:


    "Her eyelids closed, and she started snoring."


translate english zhulka_mercy_807a2ad6:


    "I leaned in and touched her forehead. It was hot again."


translate english zhulka_mercy_6679f1a9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/046.St.ogg"
    Ant "Guard your owner. You owe her your life."


translate english zhulka_mercy_f16cebfa:


    "My command was directed at Zhulka."


translate english zhulka_mercy_04827643:


    "The dog kept on sniffing my pants, oblivious to how close to death it was."


translate english zhulka_mercy_3c117547:


    "I ran to the second floor, brought a blanket and a pillow."


translate english zhulka_mercy_fe271b9e:


    "Olya should sleep here, under my watch."


translate english zhulka_mercy_6f1bd1c5:


    "Who knows what could knock on her bedroom door..."


translate english zhulka_mercy_4451b171:


    "I tucked my sister in. She smacked her lips in her sleep."


translate english zhulka_mercy_155e9f54:


    "I rubbed her delicate forearm."


translate english zhulka_mercy_be4bf7d0:


    "Zhulka rolled into a ball beside her and started snoring loudly."


translate english zhulka_mercy_551f6806:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/45 no.ogg"
    "My inner voice whispered: {i}\"This is going to be a long night.\"{/i}"


translate english zhulka_kill_6473e209:


    "I raised the axe."


translate english zhulka_kill_ad73f050:


    "I imagined a scale, with the stray on one side and the lives of my family on the other."


translate english zhulka_kill_ab0415f0:


    "My imagination drew a vivid picture: the blizzard cut us off from civilization, and now we need to survive on our own, like Robinzon Cruzo on the uninhabited island."


translate english zhulka_kill_ff66ffc9:


    "He'd kill an animal to feed himself without a second thought."


translate english zhulka_kill_519c454d:


    "Zhulka... is just food."


translate english zhulka_kill_54e4e715:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/048.Myaso.ogg"
    Ant "MEAT!"


translate english zhulka_kill_b4ad1ff2:


    "The axe drew an arc through the air."


translate english zhulka_kill_aff2c614:


    "And then a crunching sound."


translate english zhulka_kill_f3196286:


    "Hot droplets splattered into my face, and the dog didn't even have time to wail."


translate english zhulka_kill_b5deed44:


    "Olya wailed in its stead."


translate english zhulka_kill_675d8394:


    "She screamed in a scary, squeaky voice as she pressed her little fists into her cheeks."


translate english zhulka_kill_3edb3575:


    "She was clutching a bright ribbon in one of them–her improvised collar."


translate english zhulka_kill_808ed111:


    "A gift meant for the dog that she had no use for anymore."


translate english zhulka_kill_295e6b5c:


    "I felt a pang of shame in my heart."


translate english zhulka_kill_00229394:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/049.Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya!"


translate english zhulka_kill_30604f9e:


    "I stepped toward my sister, who saw everything from behind my back."


translate english zhulka_kill_191db680:


    "She saw my senseless killing of a man's best friend."


translate english zhulka_kill_76a515f6:


    "The ribbon fell out of her hand."


translate english zhulka_kill_266d065b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/44 Tie.ogg"
    Oly "You... her... with an axe."


translate english zhulka_kill_5c9edf3e:


    "She winced. Tears clouded her eyes."


translate english zhulka_kill_b25120bb:


    "Olya stared at me in surprise and horror. She was scared."


translate english zhulka_kill_5e7a7cd0:


    "She was afraid of me, as if I were a murderer, a psycho that killed animals for fun."


translate english zhulka_kill_3954d529:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/45 Za.ogg"
    Oly "Why?!"


translate english zhulka_kill_d0d9bb87:


    "I slid my hand across my sticky face."


translate english zhulka_kill_1bc34948:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/050.Da.ogg"
    Ant "You won't get it."


translate english zhulka_kill_37574d5d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/46 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "Stay away!"


translate english zhulka_kill_dffb685a:


    "She was almost choking on her tears."


translate english zhulka_kill_05518e7b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/051Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, please."


translate english zhulka_kill_2d410520:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/47 T.ogg"
    Oly "You're a monster! Just like those that will come at night!"


translate english zhulka_kill_241da6b2:


    "I reached for my sister, but she just shrieked even harder after noticing the blood on my hands."


translate english zhulka_kill_a2ef6abc:


    "I grabbed a towel that was hanging on a nearby hook and tried frantically to wipe off the scarlet splatter."


translate english zhulka_kill_19b278f0:


    "Then, Olya suddenly screamed and rushed toward the nasty puddle in the middle of the hallway."


translate english zhulka_kill_ced9b0de:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/49 Ziv.ogg"
    Oly "She's alive!"


translate english zhulka_kill_47c5fd13:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/49 Dok.ogg"
    Oly "The doctor will come and fix her up!"


translate english zhulka_kill_f8a20e6a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/052.ne.ogg"
    Ant "It can't be!"


translate english zhulka_kill_601e4fb0:


    "I stared at the dog."


translate english zhulka_kill_83ef0dd3:


    "Its red carcass trembled and bulged, something gray poured out of its flesh."


translate english zhulka_kill_fa7dd0c1:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/054.Na.ogg"
    Ant "Get back!"


translate english zhulka_kill_7f20acfb:


    "I shoved Olya toward the fridge."


translate english zhulka_kill_350085ff:


    "The dog's body was hollow, like a rotten fruit."


translate english zhulka_kill_c1d5433f:


    "That's why it was so easy to crack under the axe's blade."


translate english zhulka_kill_06484baa:


    "Something nasty festered inside he dog."


translate english zhulka_kill_25b58f6e:


    "It probably controlled the dog, led it to their house."


translate english zhulka_kill_4b91d8f2:


    "The slimy abomination emerged from the dog's corpse."


translate english zhulka_kill_6e94283e:


    "After just a moment, a giant insect was already writhing on the floor. Curved spider legs felt around the floor."


translate english zhulka_kill_d3f632ad:


    "Translucent wings spread out and fluttered, sprinkling red drops everywhere."


translate english zhulka_kill_877f091c:


    "The mutant, a mix of a centipede, a spider, and a butterfly, dragged its hairy body toward me."


translate english zhulka_kill_969766a5:


    "Its clawed legs clacked against the floor, and a thin line of syrup dripped from its tine maw."


translate english zhulka_kill_1c6ba7cf:


    "I screamed and hacked at it, slicing the parasite in half."


translate english zhulka_kill_d2e8229e:


    "Yellow pus burst out as the creature popped. Its legs shuddered and dropped to the floor."


translate english zhulka_kill_455c8bfa:


    "Followed by Olya falling unconscious at my feet."


translate english zhulka_kill_ba8bea3a:


    "My axe peeked out of the vile mess."


translate english zhulka_kill_48863e5e:


    "The insect hid inside the dog like a smaller {u}Matryoshka{/u} inside of a bigger one."


translate english zhulka_kill_50efdbe4:


    "I remembered how Alisa was feeding something to the dog the day we first met."


translate english zhulka_kill_ddbb4cdc:


    "I leaned against the wall and slid to the floor, my face buried in my hands."


translate english zhulka_kill_637e406e:


    "I felt an urge to vomit, but I took a deep breath, and it went away."


translate english zhulka_kill_a129a511:


    "Snow squeaked outside the window, as if somebody got closer to take a look at us."


translate english zhulka_kill_54d79312:


    "I strained my hearing so hard I became one giant ear."


translate english zhulka_kill_7ac8a6f4:


    "I guess I just imagined it."


translate english zhulka_kill_63ea7de2:


    "\"All nerves,\" as Dad used to say."


translate english zhulka_kill_c6bdc362:


    "And Mom would add that nerve cells don't recover."


translate english zhulka_kill_39b2f64d:


    "I need to stay strong until they come back."


translate english zhulka_kill_0f78f613:


    "Soon. Any moment now."


translate english zhulka_kill_22914c27:


    "I scanned the hallway that looked more like a slaughterhouse, pale Olya lying in the center of it, with my eyes."


translate english zhulka_kill_3b79a616:


    "I can't greet my parents with a \"gift\" like that."


translate english zhulka_kill_2d8539fd:


    "I brought a blanket and pillow from the bedroom."


translate english zhulka_kill_a74a676c:


    "I tucked Olya in and moved her toward the staircase, farther away from the butchered creature that used to nest inside a stray dog."


translate english zhulka_kill_8f52f764:


    "Olya should stay here, under my watch. Who knows what can knock on the window in her room..."


translate english zhulka_kill_f409970d:


    "Olya's cheeks were no longer pink. Her skin was ashen gray."


translate english zhulka_kill_dbcc7cd3:


    "I touched her forehead with my lips. I didn't need a thermometer to tell that she had a high fever again."


translate english zhulka_kill_362ce968:


    "The carcass of the disgusting bug, along with Zhulka's pelt, I wrapped in the sheets and put into the freezer."


translate english zhulka_kill_983ba487:


    "I had very low hopes that it wouldn't disappear by the time the adults return, but it was still worth a try."


translate english zhulka_kill_d197ee47:


    "I wish they'd believe me this time at least..."


translate english zhulka_kill_99bd531e:


    "I managed to wipe the dog's blood with a towel, but I had a harder time with the remaining sticky ooze."


translate english zhulka_kill_539fe5d3:


    "In the end, I scraped them off with a knife that I first wanted to use for the dog."


translate english zhulka_kill_c0cb2830:


    "A thick veil of snow fell from the sky outside."


translate english zhulka_kill_79a15a3e:


    "The house shook. It felt like a hurricane was trying to uproot it."


translate english zhulka_kill_acdb55a3:


    "Just like Dorothy's house before it flew to the land of Oz, but instead of a kind magician, the place they were going to was ruled by madness and death."


translate english zhulka_kill_af95b872:


    "Snow ghosts laughed and danced, holding hands outside."


translate english zhulka_kill_ef8d6126:


    "Then it got dark."


translate english zhulka_kill_33652477:


    "The night and the blizzard smeared ink all over the windows in the entire house."


translate english zhulka_kill_caf7f1f5:


    "Even if somebody was to watch us from the outside, their face pressed into the ledge, I wouldn't be able to see them."


translate english zhulka_kill_2cdc7a50:


    "How strong were the bolts on our doors?"


translate english zhulka_kill_5d454b6c:


    "How hungry was the creeping darkness?"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_839d3504:


    "I shrank after hearing an ear-rending scream in the surrounding darkness."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_a92498ab:


    "It was the wind. Or the agony of hunger."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_b63b1bd4:


    "The monstrous music of the hurricane poured into my ears."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_d85074e1:


    "It consisted of screeching, wailing, and my own quickened heartbeat."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_b0937d75:


    "The wind rammed the windows."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_4216a0e9:


    "An open window banged against its frame somewhere above us."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_a2bd0922:


    "As if it were a rabid beast clanging its maw."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_8599d439:


    "Had the guests arrived already? Were they walking all over the second floor? Were they running from one corner to the other in the hallway, giggling..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_49e89c9b:


    "I should've fed Zhulka to them."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_ee1fa077:


    "They're angry. Their wrath knows no bounds!"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_70120310:


    "I squeezed myself into the fridge, expecting the darkness of the doorframe to sink its claws into me at any moment."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_525fc63c:


    "I waited for toothy animal faces to emerge into the kitchen, their saliva splattering to the floor."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_d42dd0f9:


    "I need to calm down."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_a752d5de:


    "I need to take my meds..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_adaa5196:


    "I grabbed the package from one of the fridge's shelves, pushed out a pill onto my tongue, and washed it down with tap water."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_aa75c76b:


    "Then collected some more water and washed my face."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_104c13fb:


    "I felt like the blizzard was disappointed by my choice."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_df610b66:


    "It wailed and attacked the outer walls of the house even harder."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_0b74f5b6:


    "It felt the immense fear of the two small children inside this fragile house."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_3be709a2:


    "I realized that the shadows were creeping closer to Olya when I wasn't watching them."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_cdea5153:


    "A black lump that crawled from around the corner but melted from a direct look. A fuzzy silhouette under the table."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_86472306:


    "I turned my head like crazy, fending them off."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_7c4d51e5:


    "Then I noticed a pool of blood on the floorboards. Exactly like the one I just wiped off."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_04dbfb83:


    "A gut-wrenching squeak rang out, as if somebody scraped their claw against the window's glass."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_9ae29b57:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/04 net.ogg"
    Ant "No, no, no..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_84ed49a9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/05 V.ogg"    
    Ant "You're not real!"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_94a8f14c:


    "But if the shadows weren't real..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_13193d55:


    "If there was nobody inside the blizzard..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_3166d33f:


    "Does that mean I'm just insane...?"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_25fc782d:


    "A zoosadist... Serial killers always start out with small animals, right?"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_a75b9353:


    "I looked at the package in my hand."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_b5b7ce31:


    "What did I even take? The kids don't need to read the instructions for medication; they have moms for that."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_00590d59:


    "I pierced the tiny font with my eyes."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_7c3567e0:


    "\"Relieves fits of uncontrollable anger and anxiety.\""


translate english event_medication_afterdev_f51dfdb4:


    "\"Helps with behavioral abnormalities, manias, destructive behavior…\"."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_9bfd8282:


    "\"Can cause addiction!\"."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_382bb2e4:


    "\"Possible side effects include dizziness, heightened motor activity...\""


translate english event_medication_afterdev_bd12a271:


    "\"…disruption in thermoregulation, insomnia\"."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_3087e3de:


    "\"In high dosages can cause serious injury or death\"."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_9326c866:


    "I hesitated."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_07392d50:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Tabll.ogg"
    "Alisa's smarmy voice floated up in my memory... the pills inhibit me... they lead me away from the snowy path..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_7c5d708a:


    "But maybe I don't need that snowy path, after all?"


translate english event_medication_afterdev_5e8cb775:


    "It's time to stop..."


translate english event_medication_afterdev_2040e9c3:


    "What was the truth? How could I tell it apart from the nasty lies?"


translate english event_medicated_8352f16b:


    "I took a risk. Things would take a turn for the worse if I couldn't think clearly."


translate english event_medicated_d39027df:


    "I waited, but the medication didn't work."


translate english event_medicated_a1d2d918:


    "The ominous world outside didn't change one bit, didn't become any less hostile."


translate english event_medicated_76cfa358:


    "On the contrary, it felt like the silhouettes of trees turned into living carnivorous beasts, lurking in the dark, waiting for their prey."


translate english event_medicated_fc6731ff:


    "Crooked branches bent down to the ground one moment, seeking their prey on the snowy trails, only to then shoot up toward the sky, trying to grab an unsuspecting bird."


translate english event_medicated_35a03dc4:


    "However, as soon as you looked upon them, the masquerading creatures would freeze."


translate english event_medicated_6a74fd6b:


    "And they would again look like the many dead trees in the middle of the cursed taiga forest."


translate english event_medicated_282248c2:


    "But maybe it was all just the wind's fault... No, there's no way!"


translate english event_medicated_intro_d7691eee:


    "After gulping down a mouthful of water and closing the tap, I realized that the pool from before was gone without a trace."


translate english event_medicated_intro_994efaf8:


    "And the shadows around me were no longer acting like sentient beings."


translate english event_medicated_intro_e2749a7d:


    "The shadows around me gradually stopped acting like sentient beings. The squeaking sounds stopped."


translate english event_medicated_intro_29ed593d:


    "There was nothing threatening about the weather; we were inside, after all."


translate english event_medicated_intro_ec3e19f1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/01 Vi.ogg" 
    Mam "Are you home?"


translate english event_medicated_intro_7a745af0:



    voice "voice/father/day5/01 Na.ogg"
    Pap "The weather is atrocious."


translate english event_medicated_intro_cc392a1e:



    voice "voice/father/day5/02 Ant.ogg"
    Pap "Anton, get the kettle ready."


translate english event_medicated_intro_0a0fee4b:


    "Two pairs of shoes were stomping around in the hallway, throwing off snow."


translate english event_medicated_intro_0369fb4e:


    "My parents appeared in the doorway."


translate english event_medicated_intro_a7f20a01:


    "Olya shuddered weakly and opened her eyes."


translate english event_medicated_intro_1b1fc6a2:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/04 Ma.ogg"
    Oly "Mommy... daddy..."


translate english event_medicated_intro_6d33499f:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/02 Ti.ogg"
    Mam "What are you doing on the floor? You have a fever."


translate english event_medicated_intro_b8a091a9:


    "Dad looked over the mess that was our kitchen, and the longer he looked, the more grim was his expression."


translate english event_medicated_intro_01a3c5ad:


    "Mom scooped up Olya."


translate english event_medicated_intro_65fbbcc0:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/03 Go.ogg"
    Mam "Gosh, your forehead is so hot."


translate english event_medicated_intro_c5a76af1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/04 Ni.ogg" 
    Mam "It's okay, just hold on. We've brought you the medicine. You'll feel better in no time."


translate english event_medicated_intro_19803a28:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/05 Mne.ogg"
    Oly "I had a dream. The doggy got killed."


translate english event_medicated_intro_e0985cb2:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/06 Mnes.ogg"
    Oly "Anton became a monster in that dream."


translate english event_medicated_intro_268f9ae9:


    "Mom scalded me with an angry stare."


translate english event_medicated_intro_18f05953:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/05 Na.ogg"
    Mam "Can't leave you alone for even five minutes."


translate english event_medicated_intro_6456395a:


    "I felt my face grow red."


translate english event_medicated_intro_d3b4d645:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/06 Vs.ogg"
    Mam "It's okay, baby girl, let me carry you to your bed."


translate english event_medicated_intro_1acbd116:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/07 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "Anton..."


translate english event_medicated_intro_c0544272:


    "Our eyes met. Olya looked at me with desperation."


translate english event_medicated_intro_af1df198:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/08 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "Anton, please, stay with me."


translate english event_medicated_intro_3e1d592b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/07 Tv.ogg"
    Mam "Your brother needs to fix this mess."


translate english event_medicated_intro_f3bb5529:


    "Fix the mess? How? By going into the darkness?"


translate english event_medicated_intro_60cdbce2:


    "No, idiot, Mom is talking about the kitchen..."


translate english event_medicated_intro_d227f2e1:


    "Before letting them carry her away, Olya turned to me and gave me a look full of confusion."


translate english event_medicated_intro_089a1d48:


    "I wanted to grab her and hold her to my chest. But Mom carried her out into the corridor."


translate english event_medicated_intro_f12bd1d9:


    "The kitchen felt even nastier without her, and the wind's howls became even louder and more desperate."


translate english event_medicated_intro_a3a7a680:



    voice "voice/father/day5/03 Da.ogg"
    Pap "This is not good... not good at all, Anton."


translate english event_medicated_intro_ce5e9a37:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/06 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I can explain this."


translate english event_medicated_intro_463b7639:


    "Dad interrupted me with a gesture."


translate english event_medicated_intro_226873c9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/04 Ne.ogg"
    Pap "Not now."


translate english event_medicated_intro_483dfc83:



    voice "voice/father/day5/05 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "I'm hungry as a wolf..."


translate english event_medicated_meat_268f91bc:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/07 pod.ogg"
    Ant "Wait!"


translate english event_medicated_meat_be5baa92:


    "But it was too late."


translate english event_medicated_meat_d9794f5a:


    "Dad opened the freezer. Deathly electric light illuminated his stretching face."


translate english event_medicated_meat_65ab057e:


    "I breathlessly watched him get the bed sheets out of the freezer, and my world tilted."


translate english event_medicated_meat_13b0374a:



    voice "voice/father/day5/06 Vot.ogg"
    Pap "I see."


translate english event_medicated_meat_b7abe5dc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/07 Mne.ogg"
    Pap "They told me something like this might happen."


translate english event_medicated_meat_d97ad776:


    "Dad didn't shout at me. I wish he did!"


translate english event_medicated_meat_d3f86028:


    "He looked extremely exhausted and depressed."


translate english event_medicated_meat_9416f376:


    Ant "I was trying to protect Olya."


translate english event_medicated_meat_75af61e6:



    voice "voice/father/day5/08 hor.ogg"
    Pap "Okay. Just don't talk, please. Don't talk and listen to me."


translate english event_medicated_meat_2258ef4f:


    "He took a peek into the bed sheets that became a corpse bag, and his face twisted in disgust."


translate english event_medicated_meat_232bfdd1:



    voice "voice/father/day5/10 Tv.ogg"
    Pap "Your mom must not learn about this. Got it?"


translate english event_medicated_meat_71e470a7:


    "I gulped."


translate english event_medicated_meat_37d56fae:



    voice "voice/father/day5/11 Po.ogg"
    Pap "Got it?"


translate english event_medicated_meat_b0f41e99:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 Da.ogg"
    Ant "Y-Yes."


translate english event_medicated_meat_587f0d4e:



    voice "voice/father/day5/12 Un.ogg"
    Pap "She already has her hands full..."


translate english event_medicated_meat_3d19fa73:



    voice "voice/father/day5/13 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "Just, please, get rid of this nasty thing."


translate english event_medicated_meat_c535ed0a:



    voice "voice/father/day5/14 Tak.ogg"
    Pap "And make sure Olya doesn't see it."


translate english event_medicated_meat_1d740679:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 No.ogg"
    Ant "But..."


translate english event_medicated_meat_6154a2cb:



    voice "voice/father/day5/15 Se.ogg"
    Pap "Immediately."


translate english event_medicated_meat_9b8ad5ec:



    voice "voice/father/day5/16 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "And I'll clean up this place and get rid of the evidence."


translate english event_medicated_meat_36094adb:


    "I replied with a resigned nod, took the bed sheets from him, and exited to the hallway."


translate english event_medicated_meat_5fda604d:


    "Throw it out? But it's not some garbage. It's a living being that's now dead because of me..."


translate english event_medicated_meat_d631353b:


    "I suppressed a sob and grabbed the shovel from the corner of the room."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_40d237b9:


    "Dad bent down to pick up the axe. Zhulka whimpered from under the table."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_12330c08:



    voice "voice/father/day5/20 Cha.ogg"
    Pap "What's this now? Where did you get that thing?"


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_e7a50994:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/14 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "It's a girl. Her name..."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_c697269e:


    "Dad interrupted me with a gesture."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_cb1981bf:



    voice "voice/father/day5/21 Tak.ogg"
    Pap "So it's responsible for the mess here?"


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_552f3f8c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/15 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Not exactly, but..."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_4b835b90:



    voice "voice/father/day5/22 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "I don't want to argue with you. Just chase it away."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_4dc924b5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/16 Pa.ogg"
    Ant "But Dad...!"


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_010e8c1c:



    voice "voice/father/day5/23 To.ogg"
    Pap "Tosha, your mom is at her wits' end right now."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_e66ceb65:



    voice "voice/father/day5/24 Um.ogg"
    Pap "Please, just get rid of this dog before she notices."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_3f07fb69:



    voice "voice/father/day5/25 Ti.ogg"
    Pap "You know how she is. She won't let us keep this doggy."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_5509c9bc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/26 Po.ogg"
    Pap "At least until Olya feels better. And then..."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_4b43e606:



    voice "voice/father/day5/27 Ch.ogg"
    Pap "...we'll think of something."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_0b4ccb3b:


    "I replied with a resigned sigh."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_f00338f0:


    "Dad showed me a sad smile and held out a couple of sausages from the fridge to me."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_dbd481dd:



    voice "voice/father/day5/28 Na.ogg"
    Pap "Here. You'll feed it outside."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_8f3cfbaf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/18 poi.ogg"
    Ant "Let's go, Zhulka."


translate english event_medicated_zhulka_3b0c8a8c:


    "I entered the hallway along with the happy dog that was munching on a cold sausage."


translate english event_medicated_story_d465e3b8:


    "I honed my hearing to try and listen in on the conversation in Olya's room, but the rampaging nature silenced the voices."


translate english event_medicated_story_9314fa0f:


    "I threw on my jacket, put on my boots, and carried Zhulka into the blizzard."


translate english event_medicated_story_f657e523:


    "I threw on my jacket, whistled to the dog, and we went out into the blizzard."


translate english event_medicated_story_c31751cf:


    "The only consolation I had was the fact that Zhulka was a stray, so she probably knows how to survive the winter."


translate english event_medicated_story_5322b1e0:


    "I fed her the last of my treats and started licking my hands in excitement."


translate english event_medicated_story_54f64e78:


    "The wind pushed me in the back, as if escorting me to the stockade of trees."


translate english event_medicated_story_ea75aac1:


    "They hunched over in the storm like ugly executioners that were about to kill me for my crime."


translate english event_medicated_story_30ddde9a:


    "Gatherings of elms looked like cliffs. In the crevices between them, the winds and the gray ghosts wandered."


translate english event_medicated_story_e140d865:


    "Those surely were the forest's previous victims."


translate english event_medicated_story_bb9ce639:


    "No. It's just snow..."


translate english event_medicated_story_6133023d:


    "But if the glade was so scary, then what's the thicket like?"


translate english event_medicated_story_0802e13e:


    "Don't think about it..."


translate english event_medicated_story_3d334354:


    "Do what you must and run back."


translate english event_medicated_story_2b3a59fe:


    "I walked, swallowed by the snow piles."


translate english event_medicated_story_1ac71267:


    "The closer I got to the pines, the darker my surroundings became."


translate english event_medicated_story_5d2eb265:


    "I looked back at the house."


translate english event_medicated_story_7f22d560:


    "The lights inside trembled like candle flames that were about to be put out by the wind."


translate english event_medicated_story_4fc22d77:


    "And, for some reason, I thought that nobody would come and re-ignite them."


translate english event_medicated_story_6312dd79:


    "I put the bed sheets on the snow and struck the icy crust with the shovel."


translate english event_medicated_story_36205ea7:


    "The soil underneath it was harder than stone."


translate english event_medicated_story_127783db:


    "I needed an excavator, not a shovel. I guess there won't be a proper burial, after all."


translate english event_medicated_story_8a232369:


    "I looked around in suspicion, like an undertaker that got stuck in the graveyard on the most devilish of nights."


translate english event_medicated_story_d0fa3900:


    "I stared at the wooden executioners and snow-made monsters."


translate english event_medicated_story_1cf85662:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Be.ogg"
    Ant "Run, Zhulka. You're not welcome here."


translate english event_medicated_story_a8e42407:


    "The dog perked its ears."


translate english event_medicated_story_bad91c65:


    "The bushes rustled, crackling in the cold."


translate english event_medicated_story_1eacac72:


    "The darkness hooted."


translate english event_medicated_story_9c3ce84c:


    "Branches cracked."


translate english event_medicated_story_8e43205e:


    "Somebody walked around the edge of the forest."


translate english event_medicated_story_6f5da817:


    "Zhulka barked a single time."


translate english event_medicated_story_594ee1bc:


    "I turned around in a panic, but my home was no longer there."


translate english event_medicated_story_8b115302:


    "The blizzard surrounded me with impenetrable chaos."


translate english event_medicated_story_c0fab469:


    "Whistling echoes among the trunks, snowflakes flying in my face."


translate english event_medicated_story_660991a4:


    "Crunch. Crunch. Crunch."


translate english event_medicated_story_760b5d1a:


    "A giant meat grinder crunching on bones; that's how the steps that approached me from the darkness sounded."


translate english event_medicated_story_4648938a:


    "I stepped back and stumbled over the corpse. Zhulka."


translate english event_medicated_story_379d1d9e:


    "Dad just probably took pity on me and decided to help me with the burial."


translate english event_medicated_story_16462eb1:


    "I stepped back. Zhulka barked."


translate english event_medicated_story_e65e0eb5:


    "Dad just probably took pity on the dog and decided to take it back to our warm house."


translate english event_medicated_story_c220626e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/20 Pap.ogg"
    Ant "Dad?"


translate english event_medicated_story_b37b48be:


    "Crunch. Crunch."


translate english event_medicated_story_9e5d42ef:


    "The footsteps stopped mere meters away from me."


translate english event_medicated_story_01228812:


    "I strained my vision."


translate english event_medicated_story_d781929e:


    "There was nobody there. It was just a brush that bent under the gusts of wind."


translate english event_medicated_story_ce6a29c9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/21 Vid.ogg"
    "I exhaled in relief."


translate english event_medicated_story_c0cd9ea4:


    "And then somebody's arms grabbed me from behind..."


translate english event_medicated_story_a68b46bf:


    "...tore me off the ground..."


translate english event_medicated_story_fb47d848:


    "And threw me into the darkness!"


translate english event_m_story_b88b1bd0:


    "Oblivion was like a well full of viscous syrup. I was slowly sliding to the bottom of it."


translate english event_m_story_e95af77c:


    "It was a somewhat pleasant feeling—I couldn't change anything, so I just relaxed inside the goo."


translate english event_m_story_29e4b2e4:


    "Like a diver that lets the current carry them."


translate english event_m_story_f6233667:


    "But even then, I knew that the well wasn't bottomless."


translate english event_m_story_bf02c759:


    "I wasn't likely to wake up in my bed, near my anxious parents."


translate english event_m_story_cb4af3e9:


    "First, the pain came."


translate english event_m_story_12a50854:


    "My hands hurt like they were run over by a car."


translate english event_m_story_f9391824:


    "Then, dim light squeezed through my fluttering eyelids."


translate english event_m_story_0f1f63c4:


    "I opened my eyes and emerged into a nightmare."


translate english event_m_story_542b8bd0:


    "Fragments of reality rushed me like a pack of rabid dogs."


translate english event_m_story_7f9a1c31:


    "Rows of shelves. Metal walls. The bulb, hanging on a wire. The riveted flooring."


translate english event_m_story_2251945c:


    "I woke up inside a garage."


translate english event_m_story_c794fd27:


    "Horror gripped me harder than the ropes that circled around my wrists."


translate english event_m_story_0561133f:


    "I thrashed around and moaned. A piece of duct tape stopped me from calling for help."


translate english event_m_story_7891b130:


    "I was hanging in the air, good two feet off the dirty flooring."


translate english event_m_story_5fce9896:


    "The ropes, fixed on a hook that was drilled into the ceiling, held me in a horizontal position."


translate english event_m_story_57ef63ee:


    "My feet were raised backwards."


translate english event_m_story_40104ed3:


    "My numb fingers clutched and unclutched. The cords ate into my skin."


translate english event_m_story_6a9909ef:


    "My throat was dry, my tongue was stuck to my palate."


translate english event_m_story_d900e741:


    "This is the end."


translate english event_m_story_bcefa486:


    "The beginning of the end, to be precise, because I won't be granted a quick death."


translate english event_m_story_1e6a2870:


    "The fragments of a scary reality fell into place like the pieces of a puzzle."


translate english event_m_story_a39116ad:


    "I tried to calm down and avoid hurting my arms even more."


translate english event_m_story_cb40bd65:


    "At least the one who captured me went somewhere else. I was the only person in the metal box."


translate english event_m_story_2228dd16:


    "Can I maybe free myself?"


translate english event_m_story_9b13d3eb:


    "But just after a moment, I was dangling again, like a fly inside a spider's web."


translate english event_m_story_874b901a:


    "In place of spanners and winches—pliers, scalpels, and bone saws."


translate english event_m_story_2d088057:


    "All dirty, covered in rust."


translate english event_m_story_c1f4a103:


    "The floor, smeared with red stains."


translate english event_m_story_46047a8d:


    "A pile of rags in the corner... When I realized what I was looking at, strength left me."


translate english event_m_story_14e7b7cc:


    "Those were kids' clothing and shoes."


translate english event_m_story_d82a799d:


    "The things that belonged to my predecessors, those who died at the hands of the serial killer inside his lair."


translate english event_m_story_fb37fe66:


    "I blinked away my heavy tears."


translate english event_m_story_eeec4065:


    "There was something big, covered by a tarp to the right of me."


translate english event_m_story_d7488b32:


    "And even more to the left of it, sat a kid."


translate english event_m_story_9fe6809e:


    "They were hunched over near that thing, which was probably the generator that powered the light bulb."


translate english event_m_story_1e224625:


    "I stopped crying and moaned, trying to attract his attention."


translate english event_m_story_1ae80075:


    "The kid turned his back toward me, his head, his hood."


translate english event_m_story_81b703b9:


    "I couldn't see if it was a boy or a girl."


translate english event_m_story_60a52934:


    "That kid... hugged their knees and swayed back-and-forth as if in a trance."


translate english event_m_story_08172496:


    "Their shadow slid across the metal in the silence that was only disturbed by the howling wind outside."


translate english event_m_story_a10629ab:


    "What if that's Olya?"


translate english event_m_story_7a7dc20f:


    "The thought that my sister also ended up in the Black Garage, scalded my mind."


translate english event_m_story_bf3c5a18:


    "I threw my head back and twisted my wrists, trying to reach the knots with my fingers."


translate english event_m_story_f745764c:


    "My attempts failed, to no one's surprise."


translate english event_m_story_eaf1e89c:


    "I looked at the generator again."


translate english event_m_story_17e37fb1:


    "The kid was gone. If they were even there in the first place."


translate english event_m_story_f3a2bc55:


    "I turned my head around, looking for the kid."


translate english event_m_story_020d8ce4:


    "I heard a stifled wheezing coming from under the tarp."


translate english event_m_story_81dd3e45:


    "Another hallucination?"


translate english event_m_story_2dec2bac:


    "I stared at the source of the barely audible sound."


translate english event_m_story_99baef2b:


    "And then the metal prison cell shook so hard that my body was thrown toward the shelves as if I was on a swing."


translate english event_m_story_2277fae8:


    "Torture tools clanged, the light bulb swayed, a bright spot it produced squirming on the horrifying floor."


translate english event_m_story_a049e7b4:


    "The black garage turned into a shadow theater."


translate english event_m_story_3117acff:


    "An earthquake?"


translate english event_m_story_ba8b5433:


    "No, more like {u}Baba Yaga{/u}'s hut growing chicken legs and going for a walk."


translate english event_m_story_4c814574:


    "The garage was moving. Yes, I was being transported."


translate english event_m_story_32f94101:


    "I could hear the hum of an engine outside through the roaring wind."


translate english event_m_story_97825cc7:


    "The light bulb flickered, going out and then turning back on the next instant."


translate english event_m_story_378a92fd:


    "What is that, a dog barking?"


translate english event_m_story_cdb20576:


    "I was thrown toward the generator."


translate english event_m_story_9f22070d:


    "The rope slipped from the hook, and I fell on my back, my eyes bulging out of their sockets from pain."


translate english event_m_story_627408c6:


    "The door flew open, confirming my hunch."


translate english event_m_story_416e3a5d:


    "Tree trunks flew by in the blizzard. We were moving, probably under tow."


translate english event_m_story_b4cd0c3f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/01 est.ogg"
    Rom "Anybody alive? Byasha!"


translate english event_m_story_4cc8e322:


    "Romka! Am I not hallucinating, after all?"


translate english event_m_story_932c0fb1:


    "I spun my legs."


translate english event_m_story_560066a5:


    "Romka jumped into the garage like a passenger who was late for his train."


translate english event_m_story_ac35b4c1:


    "He frowned for a second and rushed toward me, ripping off my gag."


translate english event_m_story_6db0662d:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/03 bra.ogg"
    Rom "Are you okay, bro?!"


translate english event_m_story_e6bd3c62:


    "I didn't have a concrete answer to this question."


translate english event_m_story_7d929641:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/04 Sha.ogg"
    Rom "Give me a moment..."


translate english event_m_story_43783d6e:


    "Roma pulled out his butterfly knife and sliced the ropes."


translate english event_m_story_165ecc75:


    "I moaned from the pain in my pinched wrists. Roma held out his hand, and I grabbed it."


translate english event_m_story_f0d67c4d:


    "The floor under us shook like crazy. We had to balance to avoid sliding toward the walls."


translate english event_m_story_3aa27fe4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/06 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I see you're one lucky fucker."


translate english event_m_story_a9fc512d:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/20 Petrov.ogg"
    Rom "Petrov? The fuck are you doing here?"


translate english event_m_story_c33e6734:


    "I didn't have an answer for that question."


translate english event_m_story_a1213ce8:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/21 Os.ogg"
    Rom "I'd love to leave you to die here, loser."


translate english event_m_story_7d9a2184:


    "His words made my whole body turn to stone."


translate english event_m_story_737ec566:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/22 Da.ogg"
    Rom "Relax, I'm kidding. What am I, some kind of monster? Just give me a moment."


translate english event_m_story_43783d6e_1:


    "Roma pulled out his butterfly knife and sliced the ropes."


translate english event_m_story_f2179d11:


    "I moaned from the pain in my stiff wrists. Roma looked at me with a smirk on his face as I stood up."


translate english event_m_story_e022346f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/24 bu.ogg"
    Rom "You'll owe me one, sucker."


translate english event_m_story_f0d67c4d_1:


    "The floor under us shook like crazy. We had to balance to avoid sliding toward the walls."


translate english event_m_story_67e8dfed:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/25 Poz.ogg"
    Rom "Congratulations, Petrov, you're not the killer."


translate english event_m_story_e0ad1769:


    "Well, thanks for nothing, I guess."


translate english event_m_story_85744e7f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/28 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "How did you end up here?"


translate english event_m_story_556876db:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/07 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "Just like in a damn action movie!"


translate english event_m_story_752cb646:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/08 By.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha went missing, see. The cops went to me since I'm his old pal and all."


translate english event_m_story_d500ac4a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/09 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "And Tikhonov was like: \"You're going with us.\""


translate english event_m_story_eeb25562:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/10 On.ogg"
    Rom "They put me in the car, and we drove around all over the neighborhood."


translate english event_m_story_84ada17e:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/11 Sch.ogg"
    Rom "We got lucky. The killer was moving his garage, and we got on his tail."


translate english event_m_story_3b9c18c4:


    "Shots were fired outside, dogs barked."


translate english event_m_story_1e8e4025:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/29 A.ogg"
    Ant "Who...? Who's the killer?"


translate english event_m_story_2534ae1e:


    "Roma was about to open his mouth when we heard another wheezing sound from under the tarp."


translate english event_m_story_05da2de7:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/12 B.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha!"


translate english event_m_story_6ebf4524:


    "We rushed toward the sound and pulled on the tarp with four hands."


translate english event_m_story_3b0a46f1:


    "My brain almost got fried from what I saw."


translate english event_m_story_7fc3c147:


    "There was an industrial meat grinder under the tarp."


translate english event_m_story_89c7a0e4:


    "In its bowl that stank of motor oil lay tied up Katya."


translate english event_m_story_f0c8b8a3:


    "Her eyes, full of desperation and tears, were directed at us."


translate english event_m_story_3b4d47bd:


    "Katya moaned into the gag."


translate english event_m_story_832faf49:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/30 mi.ogg"
    Ant "We'll get you out of here!"


translate english event_m_story_74c2cd6e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/31 ost.ogg"
    Ant "Careful, Roma!"


translate english event_m_story_bf219383:


    "Romka heard me plea, but there was already nothing he could do."


translate english event_m_story_b032e9d6:


    "The garage shook again, and the delinquent was thrown against the meat grinder's side, breaking the lever under the bowl."


translate english event_m_story_f14fc841:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/14 Bl.ogg"
    Rom "Fuck!"


translate english event_m_story_04b7e316:


    "The giant machine rumbled like an empty belly."


translate english event_m_story_1441b08d:


    "The knives came into motion inside its cast-iron mouth."


translate english event_m_story_9795596d:


    "Katya's eyes bulged out even more."


translate english event_m_story_32f7665d:


    "I realized that she was sliding into the meat grinder's throat. A couple more seconds, and the blades would slice off her feet."


translate english event_m_story_d5f4ba67:


    "Romka, still wincing from pain, tried to move what was left of the lever with his bare hands, but it was completely broken."


translate english event_m_story_5d90d149:


    "I shoved my hands into the bowl and grabbed Katyaa by the shoulders."


translate english event_m_story_bf873c1f:


    "My fingers slipped."


translate english event_m_story_0764ed5d:


    "The girl's feet touched the blades."


translate english event_m_story_7b1bb830:


    "The hellish spiral got painted red, and Katya's face turned crimson."


translate english event_m_story_d0722128:


    "She was probably about to lose consciousness."


translate english event_m_story_f449faa6:


    "I clutched the collar of Katya's coat and pulled the girl toward me as hard as I could."


translate english event_m_story_1e08bcc6:


    "Romka rushed to help, stopping our classmate from falling into the bowl."


translate english event_m_story_2697e7c4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/10 k.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Who's there?"


translate english event_m_story_28ef3c4f:


    "Tikhonov stumbled into the garage, completely out of breath. I didn't even notice how the garage stopped."


translate english event_m_story_6a787180:


    "Gunshots continued crackling outside."


translate english event_m_story_df0252ca:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/32 Let.ogg"
    Ant "Lieutenant! Help us!"


translate english event_m_story_b8761ce1:


    "The place where the ghost sat a minute ago caught my attention."


translate english event_m_story_c445ccaa:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/33 Ge.ogg"
    Ant "The generator!"


translate english event_m_story_96f92253:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/06 m.ogg"
    "Tikhonov acted without delay."


translate english event_m_story_00f0e230:


    "He dashed to the generator while we were holding Katya in place."


translate english event_m_story_99b2966f:


    "The policeman turned off the motor in a flash."


translate english event_m_story_78deb5bf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/07 m.ogg"
    "The giant machine rumbled with its cast-iron bowels for one last time and went silent."


translate english event_m_story_a413cf34:


    "The blades spun idly for a couple of seconds and stopped. Blood dripped down from them."


translate english event_m_story_047398a1:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/15 Toh .ogg"
    Rom "Toha, be a bro, don't tell them I pushed that lever."


translate english event_m_story_7e822078:


    "I replied with a curt nod, and he relaxed, seemingly believing me."


translate english event_m_story_d63d2e3a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/16 Sp.ogg"
    Rom "Thanks. You're a true friend."


translate english event_m_story_9b1d4449:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/26 Pe.ogg"
    Rom "Petrov, we're not buddies or anything, but I did free you."


translate english event_m_story_8513f8ae:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/27 A.ogg"
    Rom "That means you owe me..."


translate english event_m_story_8e796f7f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/28 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "Don't tell anybody about the lever."


translate english event_m_story_7e822078_1:


    "I replied with a curt nod, and he relaxed, seemingly believing me."


translate english event_m_story_cddff1c6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/29 Kv.ogg"
    Rom "We're even now."


translate english event_m_story_3caa5848:


    "We took Katya out of the meat grinder, and she went limp in Tikhonov's hands."


translate english event_m_story_1fe75970:


    "She lost consciousness, and that was probably the best outcome for her."


translate english event_m_story_27f9a84f:


    "The wind whistled into the open door."


translate english event_m_story_9d1eeabc:


    "The sight of my classmate's bloody foot was stomach-churning."


translate english event_m_story_a44a20c6:


    "She was missing a big toe, and the one next to it dangled in the air, still connected to the foot with a tiny patch of skin."


translate english event_m_story_5eefb965:


    "No longer will Katya be able to be the fastest girl in our P.E. class."


translate english event_m_story_52324cc8:


    "That thought almost brought me to tears, but I held on."


translate english event_m_story_e70881c7:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/17 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "Fuck... no... no way..."


translate english event_m_story_ce0e923b:


    "I turned to Roma. He was holding a sneaker that he excavated from the pile of shoes."


translate english event_m_story_0133ea37:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/32 By.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha, bro..."


translate english event_m_story_720fbf61:


    "I put my pal on Romka's shoulder."


translate english event_m_story_f548f298:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/34 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Is it his? Are you sure?"


translate english event_m_story_685ca273:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/18 Eg.ogg"
    Rom "It's his... but it was mine before... I always gave him my hand-me-downs..."


translate english event_m_story_29299eca:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/35 Mne.ogg"
    Ant "I'm sorry, friend."


translate english event_m_story_0e46a17f:


    "We weren't friends, quite the contrary."


translate english event_m_story_5ef76643:


    "But seeing Romka so distraught, so helpless, made me empathetic."


translate english event_m_story_27257ac7:


    "I could only imagine how tough it was to lose a friend."


translate english event_m_story_6595a624:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/12 Uho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Let's get out of here."


translate english event_m_story_d7cb8c72:


    "Romka let go of the sneaker."


translate english event_m_story_7b3ff4d8:


    "We went out into the raging snowstorm one after another."


translate english event_m_story_409f4a87:


    "Pines loomed over us. They reminded me of hollowed-out bones, with the burial winds howling inside them."


translate english event_m_story_54127452:


    "Snow piled over the cabin of an overturned tractor. The garage was stuck in a snow pile."


translate english event_m_story_cf82f2e3:


    "A police car was also parked nearby."


translate english event_m_story_d577f05c:


    "The flicker of police sirens, the horrifying trees, and the white wasteland... I'll never forget this sight."


translate english event_m_story_d1abd1fd:


    "More shots rang out in the distance."


translate english event_m_story_cedf20ac:


    "And then, an epiphany came."


translate english event_m_story_ecd0641e:


    "The tractor driver!"


translate english event_m_story_fecbd5da:


    "He transported the garage from one place to another. He was the serial killer!"


translate english event_m_story_ca82bac7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/13 Dor.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Doronin... and the others... went to chase the kidnapper."


translate english event_m_story_6051a29a:


    "Zhulka ran up to my legs, wagging her tail."


translate english event_m_story_8d5caa87:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/14 Agero.ogg"
    Tikhonov "There you are, our little hero."


translate english event_m_story_f8af5641:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/36 Ger.ogg"
    Ant "A hero?"


translate english event_m_story_177df244:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/15 Eto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "She brought us to the garage. Probably caught your scent."


translate english event_m_story_98ccb25e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/16 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Wanna work in the police, snifferhead?"


translate english event_m_story_8bb946af:


    "Zhulka barked in agreement."


translate english event_m_story_956588dc:


    "I rubbed the dog behind its back."


translate english event_m_story_d0da99e0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/37 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "How did you find me?"


translate english event_m_story_8fddf710:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/17 Slu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Our dogs barely managed to catch the sense."


translate english event_m_story_28ec03ea:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/18 Sch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "We got lucky, pretty much."


translate english event_m_story_863ba5fc:


    "A pack of dogs barked at the top of their lungs somewhere in the distance."


translate english event_m_story_1ce6d117:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/19 pog.ogg"
    Tikhonov "They went to chase that monster. I hope they bite him real good when they catch him."


translate english event_m_story_1d1f82c8:


    "The forest became unbearably cold."


translate english event_m_story_5596f627:


    "Tikhonov looked at Katya with fraternal tenderness and then turned to us."


translate english event_m_story_7d6f68a6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/20 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I have a first aid kit under the glovebox. You... Anton... bring us some bandages."


translate english event_m_story_7c9a41d2:


    "I completed his request in a flash."


translate english event_m_story_ac9e914a:


    "Tikhonov held Katya's foot. Large red drops fell to the snow."


translate english event_m_story_c63fe806:


    "I bandaged Katya's foot, stealing glances at the lieutenant as if to ask him with my facial expression if I was doing everything right."


translate english event_m_story_dabaa60b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/22 tep.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Now tie a knot here... good."


translate english event_m_story_9df7e50d:


    "A small rime-looking stain soaked through the white threads. it's just red rime doesn't exist."


translate english event_m_story_29d094ae:


    "I could barely take my eyes off of it."


translate english event_m_story_592fe227:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/23 Mu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Guys, stay with her in the car."


translate english event_m_story_2360b642:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/24 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I'll go find Doronin."


translate english event_m_story_7c9d47f9:


    "Tikhonov carried Katya to the car."


translate english event_m_story_85a3b1a1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/25 Sl.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Make sure her legs are always elevated."


translate english event_m_story_0964bed2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/26 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Or she might die from blood loss..."


translate english event_m_story_2cf6c772:


    "The policeman said that and left us."


translate english event_m_story_39bcd3a1:


    "Roma, lost in his own thoughts, sat on the front seat, leaning against the glass with his temple."


translate english event_m_story_c6db0554:


    "He wasn't in the mood to talk to me anymore."


translate english event_m_story_decc5576:


    "I sat on the back seat, beside Katya."


translate english event_m_story_9d622f45:


    "She looked weak, pale like gypsum, but also somehow breathtakingly beautiful."


translate english event_m_story_5b67de37:


    "She didn't look like a sly snake anymore, she was a swan dying in my hands now."


translate english event_m_story_dd3c9c31:


    "When I got warm, I started to come to the realization that I survided."


translate english event_m_story_cfbdcff5:


    "And a chapter of my life that was pure horror was now over."


translate english event_m_story_af26bc0a:


    "I tore my eyes off the blizzard raging outside and looked down in surprise."


translate english event_m_story_9afb16e1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/09 dih.ogg"
    "Katya's fingers clutched my hand."


translate english event_m_story_396c0539:


    "She looked at me from under her half-closed eyelids."


translate english event_m_story_08fafa8e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/010 eto.ogg"
    Kate "You... You saved me..."


translate english event_m_story_6c93cdcf:


    "I was about to say that Romka was with me, and that the police headed by Tikhonov were also nearby."


translate english event_m_story_5eb55148:


    "But I remained silent for whatever reason."


translate english event_m_story_3b62d865:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/011 spa.ogg"
    Kate "Thank you."


translate english event_m_story_0b97dece:


    "I replied with a tired smile."


translate english event_m_story_a9f102f9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/38 Otd.ogg"
    Ant "Get some rest. We all need to get some rest."


translate english event_m_story_1f1d83bd:


    "I turned to the window and continued to enjoy the sensation of Katya's fingers on my hand."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8f4ce4ee:


    "The bell rang. Throngs of schoolkids tumbled out of the classrooms."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f13a0cf2:


    "The wind covered the school yard with snow. It thawed on the boots and dirtied the floors inside."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_54c2358c:


    "It had been two weeks since we got out of the serial killer's den."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_22a29f9d:


    "Romka barely came to school so I had no chance of talking to him."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_842ca1ca:


    "The last time I saw Katya was when we sat in that police car."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_362bc2cb:


    "Lilia Pavlovna took a leave to care for her daughter so we had a substitute teacher for now."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_54e273bd:


    "If Dad didn't talk Mom out of locking me home, I wouldn't be here either."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7072f026:


    "My parents always had their eyes on me since that incident."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b560681e:


    "My classmates looked at me differently, too. As if they were looking at an alien from a distant planet."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2b0faab7:


    "I couldn't gauge who that alien was."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6d8d7587:


    "That friendly one from a Steven Spielberg movie or {i}the{/i} Alien?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_212b7c3f:


    "I stood near the window and stared at the white-veiled yard."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a94e04e8:


    "The world shrank to the school and its surroundings, walled off by the swirling darkness."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f72f1862:


    "The killer managed to escape..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9c74f4c5:


    "He's still at large..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ea96bdd0:


    "He's probably equipping a new garage, even blacker, even scarier than the previous one."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8ee64e0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/23 Pr.ogg" 
    Pol "Hey there, my hero."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3a5cf7a7:


    "Polina smiled at me, her hands behind her back."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_08452c95:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/24 kak.ogg" 
    Pol "We haven't talked for so long!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a6d0b0b0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/39 Po.ogg"
    Ant "We called just yesterday."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8be1c2fa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/25 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "That doesn't count."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_981277cb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/26 Av.ogg" 
    Pol "It's the real world interactions that matter!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c20532e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/27 kak.ogg" 
    Pol "How have you been?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b70014a2:


    "How have I been, really?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_00e7d791:


    "I've been a person who witnessed a pair of Katya's toes get sliced off by giant blades."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ad5a6a80:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/40 Vse.ogg"
    Ant "I'm fine...I think."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cafb2ce6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/28 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "You've changed. You look more mature."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5d021d0b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/29 Do.ogg" 
    Pol "I still can't believe this Anton Petrov had saved someone from a meat grinder."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5ae6061d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/41 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "Together with Romka..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_71341171:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/30 Ro.ogg" 
    Pol "Romka..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cb5ae6d4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/31 St.ogg" 
    Pol "I'm surprised he didn't kill anybody by accident. Considering his luck..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c825317a:


    "Polina's forehead puckered."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3c014ca5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/32 A.ogg" 
    Pol "You're different. I feel safe around you."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fbfc7cc0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/33 De.ogg" 
    Pol "Girls have the sixth sense for that kind of thing."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f108d335:


    "I was completely at a loss."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9f22d5df:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/43 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "I don't know..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0561646a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/34 ne.ogg" 
    Pol "No need to be humble! Although, your red face looks kind of cute!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a03dbc06:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/10 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "I wish there were more knights like you out there in the world."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_1f072daf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/11 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "That would've solved so many problems, don't you think?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_bcfe65b2:


    "Did she call me a knight?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a6de9f2a:


    "I grunted something unintelligeble, my face red as a beet, cursing my shyness in my mind."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_46c1bfc3:


    "Polina sneaked a glance at the window, at the white blankets of snow floating outside."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_37a32b82:


    "There was an impenetrable wall off darkness past the flower beds."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e06e297f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/12 Du.ogg" 
    Pol "Do you think that psycho it still i nthe village?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2f1f8d97:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/45 Na.ogg"
    Ant "I hope not."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ad2cbac8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/46 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "The police have scoured every corner around here."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7e9581be:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 U.ogg" 
    Pol "I have a favor to ask, Anton."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8cb6c5fe:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/14 De.ogg" 
    Pol "Grandpa is in the hospital right now."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3df6cb72:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/47 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "Is it serious"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_1c0513d3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/39 V.ogg" 
    Pol "Anything can be serious at his age..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_64b33a0b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/40 Zn.ogg" 
    Pol "You see...I feel scared even behind the closed doors..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_dfd0567d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/41 A.ogg" 
    Pol "And outside... in the blizzard... I broke out crying while walking home."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_319aa4ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/42 G.ogg" 
    Pol "That's so stupid, right?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_68957e96:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/48 Vo.ogg"
    Ant "it's not stupid at all."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_42b4acfd:


    "I felt like she was never this candid with me."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_78bb9c1a:


    "This straightforward attitude fit Polina well, it adorned her already beautiful face."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_11c996a7:


    "And her magical eyes... suspicious and trusting at the same time."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_62e31fe0:


    "Anyone would want to become a genuine knight under their watchful gaze."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_1698ceb1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/19 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "Can you escort me home after school?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fb799476:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/20 Dr.ogg" 
    Pol "Other boys have offered themselves, but what will they od if the killer appears?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_60782d60:


    "I was flattered, but still couldn't help but question myself: \"What would {i}I{/i} do\"?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8e8d43e1:


    "Whip out an Uzi, just like Chuck Norris?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_924aea35:


    "Polina looked at me as if she was sure I carried a gun like that in my school bag, and maybe even multiple of them."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b4685d32:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/21 Mi.ogg" 
    Pol "So, what do you say?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_80a2ac91:


    "I wanted to reply, but then I saw two people near the stairs."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_550ee75d:


    "Lilia Pavlovna and Katya, walking on crutches."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f196be23:


    "She lost weight and looked frail after weeks of absence."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_136b3986:


    "I remembered her tender gaze back when we sat in the police car."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_1e2f28b7:


    "That horrible day became just a tad bit brighter thanks to that bonding moment between two people who escaped certain death."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_973cebd9:


    "The bell rang. I shuddered."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3ddd0c9a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/22 Vs.ogg"
    Pol "I'll see you after school."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2c8c7034:


    "We entered the classroom."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5ee8214d:


    "The rumors of Lilia Pavlovna coming back spread faster than she could get here."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0957ca5f:


    "The kids were already standing at attention when she came in."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ed9e335b:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/02 sa.ogg"
    Lilia_P "You can sit down."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b132c251:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/03 ka.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Can you walk there by yourself, Katya, dear?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fbf66b84:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/08 smog.ogg"
    Kate "I can, Mom."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7cfa946f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/013 hod.ogg"
    "Katya hobbled her way along the desks and our classmates drilled holes in her with their eyes."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b6ce582c:


    "They were probably imagining themselves in her place, inside that psycho's garage."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0cc519c8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/014 hod.ogg"
    "Or maybe they wondered how it felt to move around without two toes on on of their legs?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6a0b8e02:


    "Katya skipped her usual place as if she forgot where she sat during her sick leave, and stopped at my desk."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f8419676:


    "She just stood there, her eyes downcast."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8f0584ec:


    "I was taken aback."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7208f390:


    "Doubly so because we were being watched by an anxious Polina, who was half-turned toward us."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6e6b94e4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/015 pod.ogg"
    Kate "Can you move?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_4543926f:


    "I didn't know what to do."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d69934d9:


    "\"stuck between a rock and a hard place,\" as Dad used to say."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_483c3113:


    "Polina squeezed the pencil in her hand. It seemed like it was about to break."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_58bf02e5:


    "That pressure transferred to my spine."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c32e634f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/015 mne.ogg"
    Kate "Well?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_610d45cf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/49 Ch2.ogg"
    Ant "What?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_45fad262:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/011 ti.ogg"
    Kate "Are you slow or what?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cdc1a2b3:


    "She finally looked at me. I didn't miss that thorny stare at all."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_306e60d6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/016 k.ogg"
    Kate "Move to the cabinet, four-eyes."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a82f4a02:


    "I lost my breath for a moment from anger."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e9be34a6:


    "Four-eyes, really?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8179914a:


    "After everything that happened?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cb11dc04:


    "My cheeks burning, I obeyed her order."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_697dcc81:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/017 na.ogg"
    Kate "On the floor."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_80164e43:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/49 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "What?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ce1aa1ec:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/018 na.ogg"
    Kate "There's dirt on the floor."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ae021562:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/50 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm not on cleaning duty today."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9187fde8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/019 eto.ogg"
    Kate "That dirt is from your hooves. Clean it!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d1ff0359:


    "I gulped without looking at my classmates, in hopes they weren't looking at us at that moment."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c0e179e7:


    "I hoped they weren't enjoying this humiliating spectacle."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d700fa59:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/52 Hor.ogg"
    Ant "Alright."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_66e693d0:


    "With my eyes locked on Katya, I wiped off a small puddle under the desk with the sole of my shoe."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_246464d4:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/04 ti.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Why are you standing there, Katya?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_34472f65:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/020 Lil.ogg"
    Kate "Lilia Pavlovna, Lilia Pavlovna, Petrov made a mess here!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d5f8911c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/021 da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a772766d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/022 vot.ogg"
    Kate "I'm waiting for him to clean up."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_325398e2:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/05 pe.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Petrov, hurry up, please. We need to start the lesson."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b9f37c04:


    "I felt like my whole head was burning."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_73a3cada:


    "And the words that left my mouth were little fireballs."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_83113041:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/53 Ser.ogg"
    Ant "Really now? \"Clean it up\"?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ee6d168a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/54 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "Is that your gratitude?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2fa398fa:


    "Katya's face reddened but she continued her arrogant staring contest nonetheless."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c22959f7:


    "I couldn't stop anymore, I raced down a proverbial hill. I burst out."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_79d6bb50:


    "Or was it the fear that I bottled up inside me for a month that burst out?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_44472747:


    "I pushed away the chair beside me, hunched down, and started wiping the floor with the sleeve of my shirt."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_99e32ae8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/55 Chis.ogg"
    Ant "Is that good enough? Can her Highness finally sit down now?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_012d5afb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/023 pf.ogg"
    "Katya let out an insolent snort."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_95dd6adc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/023 cto.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, good job."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5f8ab9a4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/56 Ks.ogg"
    Ant "By the way..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cd3ee2e5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/57 Sama.ogg"
    Ant "Next time, I won't come to your rescue! Idiot!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_acce1f81:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/06 pet.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Petrov!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9fa69d80:


    "Lilia Pavlovna's eyes widened. She saw red."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5472a0d0:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/07 Cht.ogg"
    Lilia_P "How dare you say that! Principal's office! Now!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3b9dbc13:


    "I jumped up in defiance."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7abbfaaa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/43 Ta.ogg" 
    Pol "He's right, though. The least she could do is thank him."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b0bdb47c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/44 on.ogg" 
    Pol "He saved her life."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5ad68ce4:


    "The class buzzed in agreement. They were clearly on my side."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6468c2c9:


    "Before I could let that thought sink in, fate presented me with a new surprise."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d7f5bf99:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/023pad.ogg"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e9a0a7dc:


    "Katya swayed, and I reflexively held her to stop her from falling over and then sat her on my chair."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_4be644d8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/06 pr.ogg"
    Kate "I'm sorry, Anton."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d3d3aaa1:


    "Her mask slipped."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_25f4013a:


    "I saw the Katya that clutched my hand at the back seat of a police car again."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9ee51ad9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/024 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I'm not angry at you, I'm angry at my foot."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5ca63b63:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/025 Pr.ogg"
    Kate "I'm sorry... I am an idiot."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0e741821:


    "I mumbled something unintelligible in reply, shook by her sudden confession."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_918f6c42:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/026 m.ogg"
    Kate "Will you sit down?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e58d406d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/58 No.ogg"
    Ant "But Lilia Pavlovna..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cab62222:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/08 Lad.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Fine, Petrov, you can sit."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9c44c71a:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/09 Da.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Let's start the class."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_d40067e5:


    "I took my seat. Katya's gaze was fixed on me. It felt ticklish."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_90b3cad9:


    "I turned around and caught Polina's stare."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_1e396f10:


    "She was trying her best to comprehend what was going on between me and Katya."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3fd02895:


    "But that was something I couldn't comprehend myself."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_862859e9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/027 z.ogg"
    Kate "You know, when I was in the hospital, I'd been thinking..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_59cf963d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/028 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I was always so unfair toward the others."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_85d1b6ec:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/029 a.ogg"
    Kate "And especially toward you."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a4b16879:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/59 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I've already forgotten about it..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_610bd101:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/030 A.ogg"
    Kate "Yeah, right. Liar."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3d91507e:


    "She accidentally pushed my black pencil case with a race car on it with her elbow off the desk."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_dca664bd:


    "I bent to pick it up."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7c112525:


    "For a moment, my gaze froze on Katya's bandaged foot. Then I straightened up."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_89300093:


    "Katya pushed a note toward me."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_148a518f:


    "\"Promise you won't lie anymore.\""


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_423e20e0:


    "I smiled at her, took my pencil and wrote one more line on the piece of paper."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_660aad47:


    "\"I'll do my best.\""


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8e9a116b:


    "Katya took out a red pen from her pencil case."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_4ff5d37d:


    "She did a meticulous check on all the letters, then squinted cunningly at me and put a \"B+\" under my line."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ef303ae1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/031 da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes! Your cursive is a bit too messy, so it's not an A."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b5a30c93:


    "I snorted in reply."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cc23e3c0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/032 o.ogg"
    Kate "But you can improve your grade."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8dd095e6:


    "I felt Polina's stare on the back of my head."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_baa84bbd:


    "It felt awkward, anxious, but also pleasant, a whole storm of emotions."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_90213b43:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/61 Dop.ogg"
    Ant "Let's say I want an A."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c5bafeed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/033 t.ogg"
    Kate "Then you can walk me home after school."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b7d93f90:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/034 to.ogg"
    Kate "No, I mean..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_05d70552:


    "She flashed me a guilty smile, chasing away the shadow of her former self."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_4ff794e5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/034 Ya .ogg"
    Kate "Can you walk me home, please? Pretty please."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_da950bf4:


    "That was... something I had to dwell on for a moment."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_98d65761:


    "Two of the prettiest girls in the class both asking me to walk them home?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_181f0891:


    "Am I being delusional? Should I take my meds?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3d64a051:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/62 Vd.ogg"
    "I opened my mouth but then noticed a child, clearly younger than us, sitting at Romka's and Byasha's desk."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8ca85787:


    "A hood that covered their entire face... "


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ed7e4aa5:


    "Horror flooded the empty space inside my soul. My throat squeezed shut, depriving me of oxygen."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cfa55fc2:


    "I'd seen that silhouette before. In the serial killer's garage, beside the generator!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_4c5509f9:


    "My jaw slacked even harder."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_8bc43730:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/63 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "Katya..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5cb9cb7e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/35 da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0bd3f6c9:


    "I tore my eyes off the strange silhouette, put my hand in my pocket, and pushed out a pill into my hand from the package."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_45f33762:


    "Then immediately chewed on it."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_46ab39ba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/65 K.ogg"
    Ant "Look, Roma's desk..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a2c8c894:


    "I looked back at the child, but they were gone. Just two empty chairs and a desk, heavily cut by a pocket knife."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2503f0bc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/36 E.ogg"
    Kate "Is there something wrong with it?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f58212c7:


    "Is there anything wrong with me?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3e9ca716:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/66 Nich.ogg"
    Ant "Nothing, forget it."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_87ac732d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/27 Pro.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Sorry to interrupt your class..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a7c2a81e:


    "Lieutenant Tikhonov entered the classroom and took off his hat."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_c0ce8c47:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/10 Nu.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Oh, no need to apologize. We're always happy to see you."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cedda014:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/28 M.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I want to talk to two of your students, Petrov and Pyatifanov."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6ce7709d:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/11 Pya.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Pyatifanov is at home sick right now, as far as I know."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b5fbd12c:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/12 A.ogg"
    Lilia_P "And Petrov is here. Being an eyesore."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_9c6c2553:


    "Tikhonov found me with his eyes before clearing his throat. He then took a diploma out of his folder and started reading."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_3c43fc1a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/30 Za.ogg"
    Tikhonov "For his bravery, upstanding attitude, and the courage he showed while saving another person's life..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2da06d83:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/37 Nu.ogg"
    Kate "Come on, stand up. It's for you."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0207ef18:


    "I followed her order, hypnotized by the diploma's official wording."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_cbeeda28:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/31 Ad.ogg"
    Tikhonov "...the village administration and the regional children's commissioner want to thank Anton Petrov!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e20beb3d:


    "The class broke out into a roaring applause."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_63446c93:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/38 Hi.ogg"
    "Katya beamed with joy. Polina looked at me with glittering eyes, smiling."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_14b5c249:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/39 Nash.ogg"
    Childs "To our Petrov!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_ba9599c4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/40 Ura.ogg"
    Childs "Hurrah!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_7a5b89da:


    "Lilia Pavolvna pulled up her glasses and put a handkerchief to her eyes."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_01d35ef1:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/13 St.ogg"
    Lilia_P "I'm so ashamed, everyone."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_673f7483:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/14 Sv.ogg"
    Lilia_P "I thought it was all just Katya's delusion... But I guess it's true..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6cd2e490:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/15 Pet.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Petrov here saved my child, and I wanted him to end up in the principal's office..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b28063c7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/32 Ot.ogg"
    Tikhonov "No principal's office for him! Hall of fame would be better."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_0f7868f4:


    "At that moment, I imagined my photo, but it wasn't hanging in the hall of fame, but on a notice board, neighboring all the other missing kids."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_504538b3:


    "That image sullied my otherwise perfect triumph."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5f096b94:


    "I helped Katya go down the stairs after class. I carried her crutches and held her by the elbow."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_6e734674:


    "We walked out to the school yard together."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fcc82b01:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/41 Zna.ogg"
    Kate "You know what the weirdest thing is?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fe99f1b4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/42 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I can still feel my toes."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_a80fb6db:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/42 Eh.ogg"
    Kate "They're not there, but I can still feel them..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_f5089fdf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/67 Bil.ogg"
    Ant "If only I acted quicker..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_640decaf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/43 B.ogg"
    Kate "Oh, stop it. Even the Superman couldn't have done it better."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_b3537bdf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/44 T.ogg"
    Kate "Tikhonov said I got super lucky, and he's right..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_41de0bee:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/45 s.ogg" 
    Pol "I'm glad you recovered, Katya."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_42a5ef55:


    "Polina walked out from around the corner, her stare directed at Katya."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_27735082:


    "She endured her classmate's scorching gaze with pride."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fb54b666:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/45 S.ogg"
    Kate "Thank you, Polina."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5560eaf7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/46 E.ogg"
    Kate "Both you and your boyfriend. He did well, too."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_5840f8da:


    "It felt like Katya wanted to once again remind me what kind of relationship Romka and Polina had."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_2e34c55d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/46 Es.ogg"
    Pol "If you mean Pyatifanov, he's not my boyfriend. He's a nice guy, but..."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_308adca2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/47 Vi.ogg" 
    Pol "Are you two...going somewhere?"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_fd5a34fb:


    "Katya didn't let me reply."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_16e9240a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/47 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I'm still a cripple. So I convinced our hero to walk me home."


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_37a65f7a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/48 Da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_53009b32:


    "This was so awkward... "


translate english event_m_story2_afterdev_e3823326:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/68 polin.ogg"
    Ant "Polina, look..."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_205e6eb6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/48 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I'm not an idiot. I understand."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_faceff7b:


    "Sadness splashed in Polina's eyes for a moment, but she smiled as if accepting her fate."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_dc82d5d8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/49 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "You're a true gentleman. A dying breed, as my grandpa would say."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_4807d004:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/50 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "Not every girl can get this lucky..."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_0abfeff8:


    "The blizzard was covering the school yard with snow."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_9256156a:


    "Polina turned around and stared anxiously at the darkness, completely lost."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_6173c80e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/49 Za.ogg"
    Kate "Stop acting like a victim, it makes me sick."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_49e6aa3a:


    "That last line, said in a whisper, was only meant for my ears."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_aba416d3:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/51 T.ogg"
    Kate "It seems like she'd happily swap places with me as long as everyone pitied her."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_2d4333e6:


    "Something rustled in the darkness and Zhulka ran out to the school yard."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_606dafe2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/52 oi.ogg"
    Kate "Oh, a doggy!"


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_7d018b82:


    "Zhulka noticed Polina and growled, ever so slightly."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_6b5a6fa7:


    "Polina blinked. Two tears ran down her cheeks and froze, glistening in the forest."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_ae039e0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/51 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "So you don't want to walk me home either, huh?"


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_0dc46ef8:


    "Zhulka barked in reply."


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_c24368ed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/53 nu.ogg"
    Kate "Well? Are we going?"


translate english d5_polkatya_dev_a5513a74:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/54 Pu.ogg"
    Kate "This wet blanket can get home by herself, it's not too dark yet."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_16fe57e4:


    "I fixed my gaze on Polina for a moment and then turned back to Katya."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_7fa5d009:


    "I was in a tight spot."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_d5215e28:


    "Not as tight as when I escaped the torture room, but I was still uncomfortable."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_88cea688:


    "I didn't want to upset Katya. Yet it was painful to admit that she didn't change after losing her toes."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_ff2dd467:


    "She was still the same skillful manipulator."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f3bbd593:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/69 Kat.ogg"
    Ant "Katya, you see, I've already promised Polina..."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_914bc47e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/54 no.ogg"
    Kate "But..."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_222c53a5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/70 mi.ogg"
    Ant "Don't worry, I know what to do."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_533c08c3:


    "I raised my head."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_9f9d94d6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/71 Liliya.ogg"
    Ant "Lilia Pavlovna!"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_9e2fdf12:


    "The teacher showed her face in the window."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_559231b0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/72 ya.ogg"
    Ant "I helped Katya get down. Can you pick her up from here?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_26ceccaa:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/16 Kon.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Of course! Wait for me, Katya, dear, I'll be right there."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_44cb4472:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/17 Sp.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Thank you for lending a hand, Anton."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f4cb8d92:


    "Katya just stood there, silent and pale. I got scared that she felt ill."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c6f73762:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/73 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Are you alright? Feeling dizzy?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_7e691b8e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/55 k.ogg"
    Kate "Yeah."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_b2f5541f:


    "There was anger in her voice now."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_042c15d5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/56 te.ogg"
    Kate "What do you care? Didn't you promise to tell the truth?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_62790fbc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/57 L.ogg"
    Kate "You liar."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f0cc53a7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/58 K.ogg"
    Kate "E minus, Petrov."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_8f58cb20:


    "Polina's face reddened in the cold, and I could easily imagine lightning bolts shooting out of her eyes."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_eb47e86b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/52 Pr.ogg" 
    Pol "Stop being psychotic, Katya."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_4ff784bd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/53 Mi.ogg" 
    Pol "Anton and I could walk you home and then go to my place."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_b93a17ca:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/59 kon.ogg"
    Kate "Right, of course!"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_79213504:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/60 Lu.ogg"
    Kate "Why don't you go to hell instead? Both of you!"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_07b02fa5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/61 S.ogg"
    Kate "Good riddance!"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_91206902:


    "I was taken aback by her sudden outburst, so I decided to avoid further conflict."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c0da4da0:


    "Fine, we'll go away."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_a97a5703:


    "I led Polina away across the school yard. Katya stood beside the stairs and scorched us with a hateful glare."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_7957799a:


    "I noticed Polina flashing her a triumphant smirk over her shoulder."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_fa0793e3:


    "Are all girls like that? Do they all value boys over their friends?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_d4ce4020:


    "Then again, Katya and Polina weren't exactly close..."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c34bf287:


    "I also turned around, but the white haze had already shrouded a lonely figure, supporting itself with the crutches."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_a603945a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/54 Da.ogg"
    Pol "That drama queen is just pleading for sympathy."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_5e6f1899:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/74 Ei.ogg"
    Ant "No, she is in a horrible state right now."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_10a37993:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/55 Vs.ogg" 
    Pol "Did you forget how she tried to ostracize you?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_4c2e57da:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/56 Ta.ogg" 
    Pol "People like her never change."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_8d57fc4a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/57 Ho.ogg" 
    Pol "Even though she didn't deserve what happened to her."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_acbbf943:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/75 N.ogg"
    Ant "Nobody can deserve that."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_08d4f21b:


    "I took Polina's schoolbag, and we started walking on the snow-laden path."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_75ab219e:


    "Polina giggled, dodging the snowflakes attacking her face."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_21d95bfa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/59 na.ogg" 
    Pol "Can you skate?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_fe6bbddf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/76 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "A little bit."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_b799303f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/60 sho.ogg" 
    Pol "How about we go to a skating rink later?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_3e172822:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/77 La.ogg"
    Ant "Okay... "


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c52bdf1a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/62 da.ogg"
    Pol "Let's walk turtle-style."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_178842e7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/61 hah.ogg" 
    "We turned our backs to the wind and started walking backwards."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_86e1d397:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/78 Pod.ogg"
    Ant "Watch your step, or you'll fall."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c5571182:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/63 ku.ogg" 
    Pol "I'll look wherever I want, thank you."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_a957b887:


    "She wanted to look at me, as it turned out. Her warm gaze contrasted with the weather."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_22c0dbd0:


    "Then Polina slipped and tumbled into a snow pile, laughing."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f6992674:


    "I came to the rescue, picked her up as she kept on giggling, and swept the snow off her overcoat."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_53ac929e:


    "Right at that moment, Romka slipped out from behind the corner."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_d03367be:


    "My heart squeezed."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_b836722e:


    "What will he think now?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_abcc14a6:


    "He untied my in the Garage, we'd been through so much together, and I'm flirting with his girl! Some friend I am!"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_16496c67:


    "I froze, expecting a scandal and the nastiest scuffle in my entire life."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_92098648:


    "Polina buried her head in her coat, like a real turtle."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_0b962542:


    "I stood there unmoving, flapping my eyelids. I wasn't ready for a fight, but it was inevitable."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_4d3298f8:


    "Just seeing us together was enough for Romka to lose his mind."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_a43e738a:


    "Judging by her stressed pose, Polina was afraid of the same thing."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_1242559f:


    "All of Romka's threats floated up in my memory."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_58d08279:


    "They gained even more weight, considering how bad Romka looked after his visit to the garage."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_262b4f23:


    "He was pale, slouched, walking around as if in a daydream..."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_270d2160:


    "I took a deep breath, but Romka interrupted me."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_08ddb9c4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/30 B.ogg"
    Rom "Going back from school?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_0c6d7506:


    "His question bore no threat at all. His voice was emotionless, almost robotic."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_7452d74b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/79 Aga.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_878ae9e8:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/31 B.ogg"
    Rom "Have you seen Byasha?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_ba2f83fb:


    "I shook my head, surprised."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_3b02b3bb:


    "We both saw that sneaker. Romka confirmed it was his friend's."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_10ef62ad:


    "It was unlikely that Byasha gifted his shoes to the serial killer of his own accord and was now wandering the village barefoot."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_070cce4d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/80 Rom.ogg"
    Ant "Roma, Byasha was in the garage."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_99491493:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/33 Bil.ogg"
    Rom "So what? We were there, too. And we're safe and sound."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_9230fad2:


    "He didn't look of sound mind to me at all."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_34c002fe:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/34 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I won't rest until I find out what happened to Byasha."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_3af65eee:


    "Roma's jaw cramped, and his cheeks were white as snow despite the freezing cold."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_4f56c0a6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/35 B.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha runs away from home all the time."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_6a36c310:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/36 Bi.ogg"
    Rom "He used to just throw a pebble into my window so I could open it and let him in... "


translate english event_m_polina_devend_5eed3294:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/37 Na.ogg"
    Rom "And I would make him a place to sleep on the floor, and he would toss and turn for the entire night, keeping me awake."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_575e1846:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/38 Za.ogg"
    Rom "But at least I know that if anything bad were to ever happen to me, he'd have my back."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_8cf4bd47:


    "Roma stared absent-mindedly at the falling snowflakes."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_d79741ed:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/39 Vs.ogg"
    Rom "I'm still waiting for him to throw the pebble."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_646cb257:


    "That last line Roma said so quietly I could barely hear them."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f3f6299b:


    "That confession turned into a puff of steam that left his pallid lips."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f6b026f9:


    "It evaporated in the frosty air of a short, winter day."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_32398a2b:


    "Roma pulled out a pack of posters from his coat, counted out several of them, and handed them to me."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_9cd46182:


    "It was a missing person note for Igor Budaev. Along with Byasha's photo and discerning features."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_a5ee074a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/40 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "Put them up along the road."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_60e7109d:


    "Without waiting for my reply, deep in his musings, like in quicksand, he walked past us."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_94211521:


    "Maybe he didn't even notice Polina, but maybe he no longer cared."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_26110a40:


    "His facial features were sharper, like he fought some disease for a long time, and his glassy eyes stared into space."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_fab3093b:


    "In the next moment, he disappeared into the blizzard, and we continued on our way."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_186a4f64:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/66 on.ogg"
    Pol "He's always like that now. I tried talking to him, but he doesn't even pretend to listen."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_7694c59a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/67 zn.ogg" 
    Pol "He's like a violin with torn strings."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_b50b7a04:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/68 e.ogg" 
    Pol "his melody is waning."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_6613ea4b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/81 on.ogg"
    Ant "He'd lost a friend."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_c62a7de3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/69 d.ogg" 
    Pol "Even that is not a good reason to turn into a zombie."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_9704f512:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/70 on.ogg" 
    Pol "He stopped going to school."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_bebbcaf5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/71 bo.ogg" 
    Pol "I'm afraid he will do something bad... "


translate english event_m_polina_devend_78967cef:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/82 ka.ogg"
    Ant "Everyone processes trauma in their own way."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_ac06c4ea:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/72 a.ogg" 
    Pol "And how do you process it?"


translate english event_m_polina_devend_f1bcb81e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/83 A.ogg"
    Ant "I haven't lost anyone that close to me."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_87f0932a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/73 an.ogg"
    Pol "You almost lost your own life, Anton. I always talk about that with the girls."


translate english event_m_polina_devend_40b3c881:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/84 O.ogg"
    Ant "About what?"


