    Dul "{u}Naere buzarlalga{/u}! Get home, I need to teach ya a lesson, eh."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_d209a371:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/05 s.ogg"
    Dul "No fear, eh? Have ya forgotten the taste of my belt?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_8a23d0d1:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/06 b.ogg"
    Dul "I'll show ya, ya hear me?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_c0d827f9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/118 S.ogg"
    Ant "I can hear you, yes…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_0959c96e:


    "I gritted my teeth, feeling just like Byasha—alone and abandoned."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_49171e04:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/119 T.ogg"
    Ant "But I'm not…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_a6cdc83e:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/07 a.ogg"
    Dul "And if ya don't come back…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_d1a2d2a6:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/08 h.ogg"
    Dul "Hubuun… How am I supposed to live without'cha?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_3a33fb15:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/09 s.ogg"
    Dul "Hey, sonny, I even saw a dream where I buried ya… with my own two hands."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_91637480:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/10 y.ogg"
    Dul "I've already lost family once. When your Mommy was… sent to the hospital."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_0986d575:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/11 ya.ogg"
    Dul "I didn't abandon ya, I came back to raise ya…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_8b74e5e4:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/12 t.ogg"
    Dul "So don't abandon yer old man…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_893cfd92:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/13 s.ogg"
    Dul "Don't do it, okay…?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_38a029b6:


    "The mumbling of drunk uncle Dulgar became totally unintelligible. I slowly hung up."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_bae116a1:


    "Poor, poor Byasha…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_0198b6a6:


    "His father is a drunkard, and his mother apparently is in a psych ward, and the whole village probably knows about that."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_a7917f37:


    "It's no wonder he ran away from home before. But not this time."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_4b1d2f77:


    "Why didn't I ask him how the search was going? Byasha's dad had been to the police station. What if he has some new info?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_ba2acd41:


    "I dialed the same five-digit number."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_c697f6c9:


    "Short beeps."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_aa80ac6d:


    "Uncle Dulgar probably hung up the phone incorrectly."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_c53c533c:


    "I stared at the Panasonic for a minute before trying for a third time."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_3a291ce3:



    voice "voice/Owl/24 Uh.ogg" 
    Owl "Hoot, hoot! Someone's calling."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_d4791fce:



    voice "voice/Owl/25 Ya.ogg" 
    Owl "I'm all ears, hoot."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_d95113c7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/120 K.ogg"
    Ant "Who's that?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_7cd8134b:


    "A long pause followed."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_9a9052ac:


    "I was about to hang up when a dreadful voice came from the depths of the speaker."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_083c107a:



    voice "voice/Owl/26 Raz.ogg" 
    Owl "One, don't fret. The flesh has long gone bad."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_4e68f141:



    voice "voice/Owl/27 Ti.ogg" 
    Owl "You're my pray, you're my treat."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_e216dd3f:



    voice "voice/Owl/28 Vi.ogg" 
    Owl "Find and snatch, your body I will fetch."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_9597e8af:



    voice "voice/Owl/29 Tr.ogg" 
    Owl "Three, four, five! You won't be found alive."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_b23e46a8:


    "I jumped up from horror and slammed the handset against the phone, cutting off the bird's evil laughter."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_byash_899d0922:


    "This is not real. I'm definitely not right in the head…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_c40fa729:


    "I couldn't get the image of Katya standing near the school stairs, her head and shoulders drooped, out of my head."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_b45e4c78:


    "After a moment of hesitation, I dialed her number."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_49ee3d0b:


    "She responded so fast I thought she was waiting for me to call."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_6e6f6982:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/07 nu.ogg"
    Kate "Well...?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_dad60a7d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/121 P.ogg"
    Ant "Hi. How are you feeling?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_4e0e856e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/08 te.ogg"
    Kate "What do you care? Are you Mother Therese or something?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_4165763c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/122 M.ogg"
    Ant "Polina and I are worried…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_0de41701:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/09 ah.ogg"
    Kate "Ah, you and Polina! Right, right!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_99f2e017:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/10 ot.ogg"
    Kate "Are you calling from her place?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_82616d43:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/11 A.ogg"
    Kate "Is she standing beside you, snickering into her fist?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_5b8a2242:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/123 O.ogg"
    Ant "Do you have to be such a meanie?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_ff79f8ed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/12 ya.ogg"
    Kate "I didn't even start, little buddy."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_13fb4049:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/13 no.ogg"
    Kate "But, oh, what a sweet life you have ahead of you."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_85015c33:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/14 ya.ogg"
    Kate "I'll tell so many things about you to Mom…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_c1271265:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/15 d.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes! You will never live that down."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_ed3f1873:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/16 ch.ogg"
    Kate "Ciao cacao!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_65b39b78:


    "I could only hear short beeps after that."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_67009136:


    "They told me that Katya hasn't changed a bit."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_b5f9794c:


    "She was still a pain in the ass."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_2f18160f:


    "Busy. I wonder who she is calling... and what kind of tall tales she is telling about me?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_36a3f552:


    "After three beeps, Katya's voice, hoarse from crying, resounded from the speaker."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_32963254:


    "I squeezed the plastic handset harder."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_3b4a469c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/17 Ant.ogg"
    Kate "Is that you, Antosha?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_816e870b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/18 sk.ogg"
    Kate "Please, come here and save me. Hurry up!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_4cb97242:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/124 Pro.ogg"
    Ant "What happened?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_40c680c5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/19 ya.ogg"
    Kate "I don't know… I don't know where I am…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_660e3724:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/125 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean, you don't know? I'm calling you, and that means you're home."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_f5672ce4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/20 et.ogg"
    Kate "This isn't my home… There are metal walls here… and some things, covered with black cloth."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_af790144:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/21 ya.ogg"
    Kate "I pulled the rag off one of the mirrors, but I couldn't see my reflection."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_3f200aad:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/22 v.ogg"
    Kate "There's somebody lurking in the mirror."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_48d83064:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/23 m.ogg"
    Kate "I'm so scared, Antosha!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_efddc1bd:


    "I opened my mouth from sheer amazement. Is Katya out of her mind? Is she having an episode? Or is that another prank from her?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_9a2b866f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/24 oni.ogg"
    Kate "They kidnapped me. They tortured me, Anton! It hurt so much!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_bc27f513:


    "The handset screeched at me, as if some rusty mechanism came to life on the other side."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_18b15e70:


    "Katya's voice cut off."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_fef5b500:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/126 A.ogg"
    Ant "Hello? You're cutting out!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_9431c27e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/25 gd.ogg"
    Kate "Where are my legs?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_d85b3a28:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/26 ne.ogg"
    Kate "No! I don't want to disappear! Plea…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_45b013c3:


    "For some time, I listened to the screeching and the howling wind. Then came the short beeps."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_f0c30f12:


    "Katya's tortured mind played a sick joke on her."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_katya_a727f985:


    "And on me too, it seemed."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_46bc5052:


    "Busy."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_059f3771:


    "What else did I expect? You can't reach the number you are calling from."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_adfdc3c8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 K.ogg" 
    Alis "Who calls me so late at night?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_aff742fc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/02 Che.ogg" 
    Alis "Is that my lovely, shining knight?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_dda75c92:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/08 eto.ogg"
    Ant "It's me… calling myself…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_ae0acb89:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/03 Chto.ogg"
    Alis "What a sad little story!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_4e5a760c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/04 Tebe.ogg" 
    Alis "You probably felt so lonely you tried a loop call."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_47ddf35f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/05 Ko.ogg" 
    Alis "Loop, loop, loop, stick your feet in goop!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_9d838c17:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/06 Ha.ogg" 
    Alis "Ahahaha!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_629c8984:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/07 El.ogg"
    Alis "Or check this one out."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_dd19bed0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/08 To.ogg"
    Alis "A nice little rhyme."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_694f75a7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/09 Ra.ogg"
    Alis "One, two, magic comes to you!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_019f8a52:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/10 Go.ogg" 
    Alis "Welcome, be my guest, get your mind to rest."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_1c945f43:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Tr.ogg"
    Alis "Three, four, five, forget about your life."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_9b19910e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 Sta.ogg" 
    Alis "You'll become my nest, death will do the rest."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_6e7699a9:


    "Ringing laughter felt like shards of ice that clanged against the walls of my skull."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_4b0caba3:


    "I slammed my fist on the phone's hook and leaned against the wall, gasping."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_polina_a9bd8ecc:


    "What's wrong with me? Why do I keep hearing things that just can't be real?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_5248d4d5:


    "There was a coffee stain on top of Senya's number in the phonebook. I couldn't read the last digit, so I picked randomly."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_9bd7d99d:



    voice "voice/episod/02 Na.ogg"
    Noname "I'm listening."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_66e71195:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/127 z.ogg"
    Ant "Hello. I'm calling to talk about Ksenia…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_c044ea5a:



    voice "voice/episod/03 Ne.ogg"
    Noname "There's no Ksenia here."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bee003a7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/128 P.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, I must've gotten the wrong number."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_2481c4c6:



    voice "voice/episod/04 S.ogg"
    Noname "You probably did. I don't think the landlords even have any children."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_0efc0620:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/129 t.ogg"
    Ant "Talalaev family?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_1c085188:



    voice "voice/episod/05 Nu.ogg" 
    Noname "Yeah."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_0685c50a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/130 A.ogg"
    Ant "Are they home right now?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_fb49c48c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/Kash.ogg"
    Noname "No. They rented me this apartment and moved."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_e4c1249e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/131 E.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry for bothering you. Goodbye."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_97c48f84:


    "I hung up the call, thinking about where the desperate family, whose daughter disappeared without a trace, could've moved ."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_e274ebbe:


    "If that person was renting their property, he might know how to contact them. He needed to pay them every month, after all."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_01ea1729:


    "I dialed the same number again. Busy. The man was already talking to somebody."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bc171fbb:



    voice "voice/episod/12 Al.ogg"
    Ksenia "Hello! Mommy, is that you?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_6c798ae3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/132 Se.ogg"
    Ant "Senya?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4f59664f:



    voice "voice/episod/13 D.ogg" 
    Ksenia "Take me away from here, Mister! Are you from the police?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_d2e78f77:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/133 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "No..."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_37c8bf80:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/134 P.ogg"
    Ant "Wait, where are you? The whole village is looking for you, Senya."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_ca095975:



    voice "voice/episod/14 E.ogg" 
    Ksenia "They're looking… they're looking for me…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_40a92ceb:



    voice "voice/episod/15 t.ogg" 
    Ksenia "Dark people…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bf09e385:



    voice "voice/episod/16 ch.ogg" 
    Ksenia "Black beasts…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_a5210b0b:



    voice "voice/episod/17 v.ogg" 
    Ksenia "You won't let them eat me, right?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4cbad751:



    voice "voice/episod/18 Z.ogg"
    Ksenia "This place is so horrible. It's all sticky and old. I can't tell between the ceiling and the floor."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_8a3d5ff5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/135 A.ogg"
    Ant "Hello… You're cutting out…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_2a7c701e:



    voice "voice/episod/19 ne.ogg" 
    Ksenia "Don't let the cold beasts eat me!!!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4c9f5425:



    voice "voice/episod/20 on.ogg" 
    Ksenia "They want to play with me."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_5bab290b:



    voice "voice/episod/21 on.ogg" 
    Ksenia "They feed me."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_f302b29c:



    voice "voice/episod/22 za.ogg" 
    Ksenia "They make me eat bad things!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_fa2acfe3:



    voice "voice/episod/23 gde.ogg" 
    Ksenia "Where is the exit???"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_027b7971:


    "And then the call dropped."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_864f33ed:


    "Nonsense… If Senya did return home, that person who's renting the apartment would've called the police already…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_aa3327e2:


    "It's all just my imagination. There was no girl calling for help…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_12681e5c:


    "There was no voice rushing down the wires across the ancient forest…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_f3a468b8:


    "I absentmindedly leafed through the phonebook that lay beside the phone."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_9c058b2b:


    "It was issued in nineteen ninety-three."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_3351eba1:


    "I wonder how many of the users there are still alive, and how many of them won't answer any calls ever again?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_b752bd70:


    "Whether they are dead…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_4cca76fd:


    "...or missing…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_1492649d:


    "...like Semyon."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_300ce4f8:


    "I stared at my classmate's last name. Baburin."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_b3d12538:


    "One of my hands reached for the buttons on its own, while the other already pressed the handset against my ear."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_445433e4:


    "There's no way Semyon would answer, right?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_64003262:



    voice "voice/episod/01 n.ogg"
    Gran "I'm listening. Who's that?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_f92bfe7c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/136 A.ogg"
    Ant "Anton… Petrov, Syomas's classmate."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_33961477:



    voice "voice/episod/02 pe.ogg"
    Gran "Petrov? Right…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_b138ffa3:



    voice "voice/episod/03 ti.ogg"
    Gran "Have you seen my Syoma, Petrov?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_bd6139d2:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/137 N.ogg"
    Ant "No. But a policeman came to our school and…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_0ce974e4:



    voice "voice/episod/04 v.ogg"
    Gran "It's useless…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_584bc0e2:



    voice "voice/episod/05 y.ogg"
    Gran "I'm still waiting for him here… I've cried my eyes out already."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_780b210a:



    voice "voice/episod/06 b.ogg"
    Gran "God, why did you do this to me?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_86aa1b61:


    "The cries of an old woman tore at my heart."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_75de9e51:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/138 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Please, calm down. It's not your fault."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_3d096dce:



    voice "voice/episod/07 V.ogg"
    Gran "I'll be in a grave before I see him again."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_510cd882:



    voice "voice/episod/08 ne.ogg"
    Gran "I couldn't keep him safe… It's all my fault, all my fault!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_264d602f:


    "She was almost screaming."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_2b515efe:


    "I automatically pressed on the phone's hook, interrupting the old woman's lamentations with a beep as steady as a dead man's pulse."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_6b2a84be:


    "What's wrong with me? I should've calmed down Semyon's grandma. I should've picked the right words."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_65d24e1d:


    "Short beeps sounded like stifled whimpers of despair. Busy."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_d86ba3bf:


    "I dialed the number from the phone book for the third time."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_46d8bb26:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/01Kt.ogg"
    Bear "Who dares call my den?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_7ec5f9c6:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/02 ne.ogg"
    Bear "Have you no shame? It's the middle of winter…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_dc174bc3:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/03 na.ogg"
    Bear "I gotta sleep, and you've dragged me out of my bed."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_10d92b6f:


    "I froze from fear, unable to believe my own ears."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_b0992e9a:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/04 zvo.ogg"
    Bear "Why call… and just stay silent…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_2bee2bfa:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/139 K.ogg"
    Ant "Who am I talking to?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_1fbf06ee:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/05 Raz.ogg"
    Bear "One, two, three, four, five."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_7b3a23b3:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/06 mir.ogg"
    Bear "I will eat this world alive."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_3cb8db7b:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/07 sk.ogg"
    Bear "Through the hole to home I wade,"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_2235b76f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/08 bu.ogg"
    Bear "You I will in hell aiwait!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_e200c7c4:


    "I dropped the handset. The phone doubled in my eyes, and the floor started moving under my feet."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_2cff97e7:


    "What's happening to me? Why can I hear things that clearly don't exist?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_semen_85f2ed9e:


    "I must be going insane…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_36602668:


    "Anxious thoughts about Olya nudged me toward something much more surprisingly pragmatic."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_2c13710a:


    "There was a reward for catching the serial killer. Money could solve all of our problems… Mom and Dad would be happy again."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_65860a7c:


    "I concentrated, trying to reconstruct the number Tikhonov gave me from my scattered memories."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b14f1834:


    "Should be this. Two, zero, three…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_80979d6a:


    "The handset barked at me."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_1696dbac:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/33 Le.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Lieutenant Tikhonov on the phone."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b29f31f3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/34 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Come on, shush, you."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9d36d748:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/140 D.ogg"
    Ant "Good evening, officer."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_90462d1a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/35 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Ah, it's you! Petrov, was it? Nice to hear you, kid."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9211c229:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/36 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Will you pipe down already?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_992822b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/37 Ch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Did something happen?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b6dbae8c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/141 ne.ogg"
    Ant "Not really… I was just thinking… anybody who helps to catch the serial killer will be paid handsomely, right?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9ee3081a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/38 Nu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I don't know about that, kid…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_4b7af91b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/39 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Do you know how small our village budget is? We can't even buy new cars for the police station or get new bars for our windows…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_303e9e92:


    "Grating, hysterical barking attacked my ears."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_1b5aa492:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/40 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "What's wrong with you? Shush!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_062d413c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/41 Alo.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hello."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9cea0e54:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/42 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You know what… Life isn't just about the money."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_baae762b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/43 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I'd land you an appearance on TV. Yes, I'm serious. Regional network. Imagine that!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_73dd0460:


    "My shoulders drooped. I wanted to get on TV, sure, but how will that save my family?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_2d15eadc:


    "As if he read my mind, Tikhonov continued, his voice even more enthusiastic now."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_750222f1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/44 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Or want me to buy you a lottery ticket, huh, Petrov? {u}Sportlotto{/u}! I'm sure you can win a million there…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b562bea0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/142 p.ogg"
    Ant "I see…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9c9be800:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/143 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "I don't need any lottery tickets…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_f43c4fa0:


    "I didn't even hide my disappointment."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_677b4932:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/45 S.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Sit! Calm down, you mongrel!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_86924fdb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/46 Nu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Come on, Petrov, chin up! Don't let this get you down! You're fine, okay? And I need to run, I have work to do. Call me if you ever need anything, though. Okay?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_7e8ad837:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/144 D.ogg"
    Ant "Goodbye."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_728eb85b:


    "I hung up, but the barking still echoed in my head for a couple more seconds."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_af2cd08b:


    "I should try again. I'd rather get my time in the spotlight or a lottery ticket than nothing at all."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_f0bcd46f:


    "Short beeps. Who is Tikhonov talking to? Did something happen in the village? I cast a fearful glance at the window, but the darkness and the wind outside gave me no hints."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_c4c26fe9:


    "I should try my luck again. Maybe the officer had already ended his call."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_a8310c71:


    Dots "Woof! Woof! Grrrr!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_d777c1fa:


    "The dog barked right into my ear. The beast was probably huge and fearsome. Did it pick up the phone with its jaws?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_77b1aba7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/145 A.ogg"
    Ant "Hello! Officer, you there?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_21d58add:


    Dots "Grrrrrrr!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_a538fee7:


    "I was about to end the call, when..."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_628e24c1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/48 Chu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I sense! I feel!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_58ef1325:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/49 Sv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Fresh blood! Young, sweet blood!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_89dee088:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/50 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "You smell like a sacrifice!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_72c1dd50:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/51 Gd.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Where are you, kid? Don't hang up so we can trace you!"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_3d2ce402:


    "I slammed my fist on the Panasonic's plastic body."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_d50ba1c1:


    "Whoa, did I just really hear Tikhonov bark and growl, and repeat some scary gibberish?"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_99a3bad8:


    "No, that's probably just the noise in the wires playing tricks on me. Or worse, it's not the lines that were broken, but my brain…"


translate english event_m_polina_phone_fire_dep_bba71faf:



    voice "voice/episod/po.ogg"
    FDep "Fire department. State your emergency."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_fire_dep_f25ac71f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/146 Oi.ogg"
    Ant "Oh, I'm sorry, I wanted to call the gas safety department. I'm sorry."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_fire_dep_aa610650:


    "Our fire department consists of volunteers. I might get in trouble if I keep on nagging them."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_militia_d64d76f4:


    Militia "Police. State your emergency."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_militia_1ce245a8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/147 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "It's nothing, I'm sorry. Got the wrong number."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_militia_3ad87d47:


    "Phone pranks like that are punishable by law, with hefty fines involved."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ambulance_5aa79279:


    Ambu "Ambulance, speak."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ambulance_6d2ee7dd:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/148 Iz.ogg"
    Ant "I'm sorry, I dialed you by accident."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_ambulance_1b0e87ef:


    "I shouldn't disrupt the doctors' work."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_gas_8453cffc:


    Gas "Gas safety, speak."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_gas_8c1167c6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/149 oi.ogg"
    Ant "Oh, I'm sorry, false alarm. Good day to you."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_gas_037cccc9:


    Gas "Goddamn kids."


translate english event_m_polina_phone_gas_16ac2f73:


    "It's a stupid idea to play pranks on busy grown-ups."


