translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_b22299ea:


    "I gathered all my strength and dialed my home number."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_f3ff86f4:


    "Beeps."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_fac71b88:


    "Followed by a rustling sound and complete silence."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_692d0a4f:


    "If that was Dad, he'd say \"I'm listening.\""


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_f058719a:


    "But Mom always stayed silent after picking up, waiting for the person on the other end to speak up."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_bd5799f8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/150 M.ogg"
    Ant "Mom, it's me."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_47b0f501:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/08 Vas.ogg"
    Mam "Did you stay late at school?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_1f42348d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/151 Net.ogg"
    Ant "No... Look, Mom... "


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_70dedb53:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/152 T.ogg"
    Ant "Don't worry, I was given this diploma... for humanity and valor..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_802b6ff8:


    "I used the ace up my sleeve."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_5dc72b97:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/09 Me.ogg" 
    Mam "I'd settle for good grades. Without any diplomas."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_39fe5c24:


    "That Snow Queen once again!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_3c70cd9a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/153 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "It's just my classmates were so happy for me."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_2c1e5a87:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/154  E.ogg"
    Ant "That we decided to celebrate it with cake and soda..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_6e36358e:


    "It felt disgusting to lie. But what else could I say?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_c94e5a90:


    "That I didn't get into the garage voluntarily?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_f6752b4a:


    "That the only reason I left my home that accursed day was to get rid of Zhulka?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_500b0313:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/10 Ka.ogg" 
    Mam "A cake? Anton, a dinner is waiting for you at home!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_9d1524ca:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/11 T.ogg" 
    Mam "Do you want to get in trouble again?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_527fc259:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/155 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I thought... I thought it'd be better to stay in a crowd than go through the village alone."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_e106539e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/156 k.ogg"
    Ant "Besides, there's a blizzard out there, and it's getting stronger."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_5226ae3e:


    "My mom hesitated for a bit."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_4f9493a3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/12 U.ogg" 
    Mam "Dad's car won't start again. He'd drive you home otherwise..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_f7f69684:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/13 Ho.ogg"
    Mam "Okay, you can stay. But I want you home right after school tomorrow."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_47a417cb:


    "Yes! It worked!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_9b9e44c1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/14 T.ogg"
    Mam "At whose place will you be staying?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_83533a65:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/15 Ch.ogg" 
    Mam "So I could call them in case anything happens."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_8dfe377e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/U.ogg"
    Ant "I'm..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_d7c60c86:


    "I took the posters out of my pocket, and my gaze crossed with Nyasha's grainy photo."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_b9b82b63:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/157 U.ogg"
    Ant "I'm at Bya... Igor Budaev's place."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_41d7f9da:


    "Then I instinctively told her Polina's number."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_020c0d95:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/158 T.ogg"
    Ant "3-24-92"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_225f3d34:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/16 Pe.ogg" 
    Mam "Say hello to Igor. And don't forget about your meds."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_c887457f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/159 S.ogg"
    Ant "Thanks! I won't!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_bd6dd6be:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/160 Ma.ogg"
    Ant "Mom, how's Olya doing?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_253adcc6:


    "Mom dropped the call. She probably didn't hear my last question."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_7e69ecd3:


    "I put away the phone and looked into the doorway that Polina entered."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_13a56fd7:


    "The girl was stuffing her things into the closets."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_b008ddab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/83 Mo.ogg"
    Pol "You can come in."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_b5dca808:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/84 D.ogg" 
    Pol "Joanna hid in the closet, so you're safe for now."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_4047a253:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/85 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "Joanna is my cat. She doesn't like new people, so she can scratch you."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_8eb215f2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/86 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "What did your mom say?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_ed0914b5:


    "I sighed in reply."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_68fe26af:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/162 Che.ogg"
    Ant "To be honest, I thought it would be worse. She'd just scream at me when I get home."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_d330dda7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/87 ne.ogg"
    Pol "You're underestimating your mom, Petrov!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_82927640:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/88 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "So she let you stay?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_5f803bf4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/89 Ur.ogg"
    Pol "Hurrah, hurrah!"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_ce88997c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/90  Sl.ogg"
    Pol "Hear that?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_9d1963c6:


    "Polina raised her finger."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_8dfaf3f6:


    "The blizzard outside was ferocious. All of the streets would turn into one big snowpile come morning."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_ef64f202:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/91 ho.ogg" 
    Pol "It's good to have you here. I'm such a scaredy-cat."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_aae8e91e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/92 Da.ogg" 
    Pol "Let's watch TV before the power..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_279c876f:


    "The room descended into darkness. Evil winds howled outside."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_560ebd0d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/94 pro.ogg" 
    Pol "...goes out."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_a7d0139a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/95 S.ogg" 
    Pol "Jinxed it. This happens all the time."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_6c1166a1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/96 Po.ogg"
    Pol "Wait up, I should have..."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_c899c4ce:


    "Something rustled, then a match lit up, Illuminating Polina's face, and then that fire transferred to the candle."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_e503a4a2:


    "Despite the strong wind, the bedroom felt somewhat comfy now."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_8093bde6:


    "Like when it's stormy outside, but you're at home and know you're safe."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_fe15db26:


    "You can even fantasize about ghosts for the thrills."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_9170fe16:


    "But I didn't want to think about something like that."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_d6ec42fe:


    "Polina lit up several candles. I guess the power went out quite often in her house."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_4bc6a68f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/97 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "No TV for us, then. How about you play the guitar for me?"


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_c5e98ee4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/163 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "Who, me? I'm pretty much tone deaf."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_bd5fabae:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/98 Go.ogg" 
    Pol "You must be exaggerating. There's no way an artist as talented as you can be tone deaf."


translate english event_m_polina_afterphone_15c709c3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/99 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "Besides, this is so simple."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_57ac6a5b:


    "She brought the guitar and stood behind me."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_3c362fa0:


    "I pulled on the nylon strings to the sound of dissonant protests of the instrument."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_369a0e9d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/164 G.ogg"
    Ant "Told you."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_cae61caa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/100 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "You just need a tutor."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_bfdb2571:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/101 be.ogg"
    Pol "I charge a lot, but it's worth it."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_363b77c1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/102 Po.ogg" 
    Pol "You gotta turn like this. Don't smother her. Put your fingers here."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_aa465def:


    "Polina \"molded\" my hand like a sculptor working with clay, as she stood behind me."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_66cb66d9:


    "I felt the aroma of her shampoo. Warmth spread all over my body, and I stopped caring about the blizzard outside."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_c091aa90:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/103 p.ogg" 
    Pol "Then here... and here... Ем, Ам, D... G... C..."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_ea7dbddd:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/165 K.ogg"
    Ant "Is this Paganini or something?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_4f619b8d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/104 E.ogg" 
    Pol "You wish."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_8e034f10:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/105 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "I wrote this melody myself. You like it?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_70fe531a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/166 P.ogg"
    Ant "Really? To me, it sounded like a hit song from the radio."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_08f4b053:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/167 Me.ogg"
    Ant "This melody is so catchy... And so familiar at the same time."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_c003e98c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/106 S.ogg"
    Pol "Thank you. I'm kind of embarrassed now."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_fc9214aa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/107 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "I'm not a big fan of pop songs, but here I have to agree, it sounds similar."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_f534323e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/108 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Come on, your turn now."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_r_fail_f1741f6f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/115 Po.ogg" 
