translate english event_m_polina_guitar_r2_polina_before_2753e65c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/121 A.ogg"
    Pol "See? I told you you had guitarist fingers!"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_r3_polina_before_2b8c6b69:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/169 T.ogg"
    Ant "It's just you're a very good teacher!"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_r3_polina_before_83d187dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/122 Og.ogg" 
    Pol "Is that so? Then maybe you want to try the violin, too?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_bb2a0514:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/126 S.ogg" 
    Pol "Giving up already?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_def070c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/170 P.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, it's easier for me to draw music than to play it."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_0a54f0d3:


    "I was about to return the guitar to Polina, but she just clung to me even harder."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_ea596a6a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/127 Eh.ogg" 
    Pol "You visual artists are so... difficult sometimes."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_d74c8d72:


    "I went beet red from head to toe."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_59ddcfc2:


    "Without even looking at the fingerboard, she dragged her slim fingers across the strings, a smile on her face."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_02dfc28d:


    "The guitar answered with a melody."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_dffb4cc4:


    "Polina enjoyed the ease with which the chords submitted to her, and I was enthralled by the melody that carried me away, away from winter."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_477a5f04:


    "All of the old, cursed houses stayed in the past."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_929f7151:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/128 La.ogg"
    Pol "Fine, you don't have to be a rock star."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_abort_c2a631c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/129 Do.ogg" 
    Pol "It's already enough for you to be an artist. And a brave man."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_success_b6ae9952:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/171 S.ogg"
    Ant "Did you hear that? I can do it!"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_success_1fbfd4e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/124 Ok.ogg"
    Pol "Apparently, you're not only a prodigy artist, but also a rock star."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_success_43cd3332:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/125 U.ogg" 
    Pol "Your biography is already cooler than most, you brave guy."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_01_40d02bf0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/114 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "Well, maybe we should've started with something simpler, like {u}\"King and Jester\"{/u}."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_01_74748bb3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/172 T.ogg"
    Ant "Only if they have songs with just a single chord."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_02_7d4f1db3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/173 A.ogg"
    Ant "Is the guitar tuned properly?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_02_bf4e754b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/116 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "Don't blame your failures on the instrument!"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_03_0f4338a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/117 La.ogg" 
    Pol "Whatever, Salvador Dali wasn't a great guitarist either."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_03_92b1683a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/174 T.ogg"
    Ant "You sure know how to reassure, but I shouldn't have tried at all."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_04_3205ad7b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/175 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm hopeless."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_04_e627364b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/118 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "Don't beat yourself up over this."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_05_1f6a20b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/119 T.ogg" 
    Pol "Wait, are you trying to play a {u}\"Na-Na\"{/u} song?"


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_06_099fe814:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/176 Y.ogg"
    Ant "I just played the wrong chord."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_07_d69831f9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/120 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "You're too tense. Relax your wrist."


translate english event_m_polina_guitar_fail_08_daae8376:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/177 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm just making a fool of myself."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3d84d27b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/178 K.ogg"
    Ant "I'm not brave... I ran away from you back then, like a total moron."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_8e37c93c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/179 D.ogg"
    Ant "It's still so embarrassing..."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3f93529d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/130 Y.ogg" 
    Pol "I've already forgotten about that."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_620a01f2:


    "She looked me straight in the eye, and that stare made me feel cold and hot at the same time."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_59eec5ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/131 Mo.ogg" 
    Pol "Shall we move to the couch?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_4e3cc0f3:


    "I felt my throat close up at her suggestion, but I still moved without hesitation."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_f2631682:


    "Polina put away the guitar and sat next to me."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_af6603e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/132 Zn.ogg" 
    Pol "You know, I wanted to tell you something for a while."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_5b682665:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/133 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "I always liked you. From the first time we met. Or even before that..."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_0d30c173:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/180 k.ogg"
    Ant "Even before that?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_e8123553:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/134 Nu.ogg" 
    Pol "Well, you know. We girls always come up with our own prince."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_baae4259:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/135 mne.ogg" 
    Pol "I think I made you up. And then you became real."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3eb7d050:


    "I felt dizzy, as if I was in a Ferris wheel that carried me up into the sky."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_74405af4:


    "It turns out you can fly even without magic or technology."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_8a4bd25c:


    "No, what was happening in this room was the definition of magic."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_eb98600a:


    "And only that magic could fight the dark affliction that poisoned our village."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_192e313c:


    "Polina was waiting for something. And she wasn't the only one waiting."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3de324e8:


    "There was somebody else in the room who warranted my attention."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_4013e313:


    "I looked past Polina's shoulder and froze in horror."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_98dcbcf2:


    "A kid, as if grounded, stood in the corner with their back to us."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_c9f5ddbc:


    "The hood covered their entire head. The petite silhouette was almost indistinguishable in the darkness."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_561688da:


    "She had already appeared before me. In the garage and during Lilia Pavlovna's class."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_a7fce58e:


    "Olya?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_c7148695:


    "Yet the kid that always mysteriously vanished looked like a ghost, and my Olya was alive and well... "


translate english event_m_polina_followup_485ffd1c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/136 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "What's wrong?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_47d4c133:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/181 T.ogg"
    Ant "There's someone there."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_bd1543a5:


    "Polina didn't even peer into the shadows that the candlelight couldn't reach."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_7e1cf89b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/137 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "That's probably just Joanna."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_2dc5ae0d:


    "I brought the candle closer to chase away the illusion..."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_01ba9288:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/138 Vi.ogg" 
    Pol "See? I told you."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_89714e34:


    "A Thai cat stared at me in the light of the dancing flame."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_bd970f4d:


    "But as soon as I moved the light, I saw a kid's silhouette writhe in the darkness."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3d87d885:


    "I forced myself to look away from the annoying shadow in the corner."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_44308bef:


    "It was scary to talk to her, knowing that an uninvited guest was with us."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_610feae7:


    "It was time for me to confess."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_af1c0394:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/182 P.ogg"
    Ant "Polina, I have hallucinations."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_beb60e86:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/139 S.ogg" 
    Pol "Right now?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_65ed6ba1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/183 E.ogg"
    Ant "Right now, and just in general..."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_056ce4b9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/184 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I see strange things."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_b3122984:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/140 Ho.ogg"
    Pol "So you're saying you're crazy?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_6324424e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/185 D.ogg"
    Ant "The doctor said it was a puberty thing and it'll pass. I just need to take these meds."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_b2f0566d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/141 oni.ogg"
    Pol "Do you have them on you?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_a7f3e202:


    "I nodded as I took out a package of pills."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_1cc2e8ab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/142 Tak.ogg" 
    Pol "Then what are you waiting for?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_809f5e1a:


    "What {i}was{/i} I waiting for, really?"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_3dd9223c:


    "I looked into the corner again."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_7659a008:


    "The silhouette didn't change its pose, but now I was sure... "


translate english event_m_polina_followup_19e7e1e3:


    "It was Olya."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_2716498a:


    "A whisper, barely audible in the howling wind."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_f35acfc9:


    "It broke through the thick layers of snow, from under the frozen soil, as if my sister was calling me from the grave."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_20df7807:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/09 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "Anton! Come back, Anton!"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_c136fba1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/10 Ver.ogg"
    Oly "Come back to me, please!"


translate english event_m_polina_followup_1ed4e7a2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/143 T.ogg" 
    Pol "You're scaring me."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_c7e48941:


    "In the other world, Olya cried and called out my name, over and over."


translate english event_m_polina_followup_afterdev_1ec41d1d:


    "My gaze stuck to the package of pills again."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e4ddbfd2:


    "I was ready to believe in ghosts, but Olya didn't die. Just half an hour ago, I talked to Mom over the phone."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_89ceda25:


    "That made no sense."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_5e846205:


    "I threw the pills onto my tongue. A hand, holding a glass of water, appeared in front of my face."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_3072fed9:


    "Polina gave me a sympathetic look, and my heart was filled with gratitude."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e44aa4b7:


    "I drank the water."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_cf5ff89c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/144 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "Well?"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_7e6e0055:


    "I darted a glance at the corner."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_20b21db0:


    "The crying subsided."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_87c7e74d:


    "The hallucinations left me alone."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e6990908:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/186 Y.ogg"
    Ant "I am crazy, after all."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e467a3f0:


    "Polina replied with a relaxed smile."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_09c40bdb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/145 Sl.ogg" 
    Pol "Can't argue with that."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_7a22cd95:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/146 No.ogg" 
    Pol "But you're definitely the coolest crazy person I've ever met."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_57c7ead2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/147 ps.ogg"
    Pol "You're a handsome psycho."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_f24ac718:


    "Polina suddenly sat on my lap and gave me a very adult stare."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_a8a52eb8:


    "My heart almost stopped, its rhythm broken, as if it didn't know what to do next."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_4ba459db:


    "And then it pumped hot blood through all my veins."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_b6e1b023:


    "I remembered my dad."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_a98baca0:


    "Did he go through something like this in his youth, before he met Mom?"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_ad544772:


    "Was there a girl like Polina in his life, who gave him a look like that?"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e5cd3772:


    "And if yes, how did he not burn out from all the emotions?"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_714a6986:


    "Polina touched my shoulder, brushed off an invisible strand, and asked me in a whisper:"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_e5d583fb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/148 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "You won't run away, right?"


translate english event_m_polina_accept_ad78aa99:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/187 N.ogg"
    Ant "Of course."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_8e9f45af:


    "A kiss."


translate english event_m_polina_accept_31b53116:


    "The candles went out."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_638c1245:


    "But what if it's not an illusion?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_3e17de76:


    "I squeezed the pills in my hand."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a513747f:


    "What if Olya needs my help or wants to warn me about something?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_60746dd4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/149 A.ogg" 
    Pol "Come on, Anton."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_7f3d000c:


    "I frowned after seeing fear that flashed in Polina's eyes. No, not even fear, a growing panic."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_41ecbc33:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/188 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "What's going on?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_6d9632d8:


    "The crying grew louder. It filled the entire room."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_823805aa:


    "Did Polina wince? Did she just look at the corner? Can she hear it too?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_cf59fa5d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/189 T.ogg"
    Ant "So those weren't hallucinations..."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_b0a1f12b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg" 
    "Polina shrieked when somebody pounded the door with their fist."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e6c3c442:


    "The cat rushed toward the ceiling, tearing down the curtains, and disappeared into the darkness."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ae31da7a:


    "We both shrank."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_9845a920:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/150 net.ogg" 
    Pol "No, no, no..."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_0e234806:


    "She shook her head while her whole body trembled."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ef7d68f6:


    "Olya's cries and the dreary song of the blizzard mixed into a single chorus. The door was getting pounded, with hands and feet."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fadfa638:


    "The flames flickered, and the darkness around us grew thicker."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ddd716c5:



    voice "voice/Hariton/02 Po.ogg"
    Noname "Polina! Polina, are you home?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_9b4dc826:


    "It's her grandpa... It's just her grandpa who got discharged from the hospital... But why in the middle of the night?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e0453c58:


    "And why does his voice sound like his mouth is full of fangs?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_2daf902a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/151 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "What have you done, Anton? Why didn't you take your meds?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ad94395a:


    "Tears burst out of her wide-open eyes."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ec243db8:



    voice "voice/Hariton/03 Vi.ogg"
    Noname "Come out, my dear child!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_70e39d26:



    voice "voice/Hariton/42.C2.ogg"
    Noname "If you won't come out in one piece, at least give me a slice!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a97740e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 Vs.ogg"
    "Polina cried hysterically."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a58a1c32:


    "The porch creaked."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_aa05296e:


    "Khariton... Did he learn how to walk? Walk in the blizzard, walk in the darkness..."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_d7fa5639:


    "A monstrous figure flashed in the window."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_d2851100:


    "The hot breath made the rime thaw, and a bulging eye flashed in the resulting clean spot."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_95577ecf:


    "Somebody huge peered into the room to make sure it was full of fresh meat."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a0fc178d:


    "Its claws broke the icy crust and scratched at the glass."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_d9df5bbf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg"
    "The window popped, washing us with the freezing cold. Glass fragments scattered across the floor. Bony sickles grabbed at the window's frame."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fe55777d:


    "The wind broke into the room and put out most of the candles, but just a single one continued to burn after falling over."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_0a1f832d:


    "Probably so that I could see how the creatures of the night came to visit the screaming Polina. They had a leader."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_69c180a3:


    "I covered my face with my hands from horror, looking at the giant creature that appeared in the window through my fingers."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_7b41d586:


    "Its hungry eyes glowed in the semi-dark like silver Moons."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_80ab17aa:


    "The creature reached out its hand and pointed at us with a dagger-like finger."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_b5785174:


    "A pack of mad wolves rushed into the room, like a current that washed away everything in its path."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fa216c52:


    "The giant got in after them."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a92b98a7:


    "It straightened out toward the ceiling, with all of its horrifying height."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_0e9bd6c8:


    "Its long ears trembled above its bulky head."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_c49ab2fc:


    "Shadows of the creatures rampaged on the walls."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e7b9ebc1:


    "The candlefire spread to the tablecloth, and it crackled as it burned."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_2099557c:


    "The smoke scorched the insides of my nose. Hungry demons smirked in the red-hot Hell."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_af68d1d4:


    "Paralyzed with fear, I watched Polina jump up from the sofa, trying to escape."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_30966af4:


    "When she reached the center of the room, she started shaking and fell to her knees in front of the eldritch abomination."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_5a48efd3:


    "The monster that came from the fores, from the chilly graves."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_bfebd071:


    "The bunny reached out with his left paw and clutched Polina's hair."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_98e873cd:


    "The fingers on his right hand he turned like a fan, reveling in the helplessness of his victim."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_61cd7538:


    "His claw slowly traced the outline of the girl's face."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fdc682a8:


    "Across the jawbone, under her chin, and up again."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_2704620a:


    "Polina screamed."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_45218330:


    "Her skin buckled under the claw's pressure. Tears flowed along her bloodless cheeks."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_a706a7f1:


    "Burning slices of cloth floated down to the chair and burnt its stuffing."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_dd89c83d:


    "And then, the monster sliced off Polina's entire face with one movement and threw it away like a useless rag."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_539b61d6:


    "In the place where her face just was, I could see a wet, glittering, red mush with threads of sinew and beads of fat."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_71f6805c:


    "The flayed Polina squealed at the top of her lungs."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_efea7482:


    "The flames reflected in the red bog that filled her facial bones."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_300b256d:


    "Her scream turned into a shrill squeal and then into some sort of cackling."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_60e70491:


    "Was she... laughing?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_74979806:


    "Polina turned what was left of her face toward me."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_282cd1fe:


    "Nasty laughter emerged from a hole in the glossy meat."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_204260cc:


    "Her eyes, now devoid of eyelids, perfectly round, spun in their sockets."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_6a7a5e5c:


    "I wanted to die to stop watching that. I was paralyzed with fear."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e8747031:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/156 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "You couldn't do anything, coward!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_376bbebd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/157 ni.ogg" 
    Pol "You're useless! You couldn't even protect me!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_f49c5cfa:


    "I plugged my ears with my fingers, but I could still hear her."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_d4c740ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/158 ro.ogg" 
    Pol "Romka was a thousand times better."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_4d6f84c1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/159 zn.ogg" 
    Pol "Remember, loser..."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_11abd073:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/160 ni.ogg"
    Pol "There is no world where you can save me, Anton!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_f2eda78b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/161ni.ogg" 
    Pol "There is not a single universe where I'll be yours!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e61ef0f4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/162 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "You're doomed!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_576113a2:


    "The fire raged on behind us. When the smoke reached Polina, she screamed again."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_7f327d70:


    "She probably realized what was about to happen."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fdaf63a4:


    "A claw sliced open her stomach with a disgusting sound of ripping cloth."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_7356e36d:


    "A paw entered the resulting cavity and pulled out her entrails."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_aab86555:


    "Magenta-colored intestines of a schoolgirl."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_bec05b1a:


    "The creature licked its lips and threw the stinking garland around Polina's neck. Just like a rope. And then it threw its paw up."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_f0ce1530:


    "Polina flew up, hung on her own intestines on top of the chandelier, and then started swinging like a bell."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_2872334b:


    "Her legs banged against the walls with a monotonous, hollow sound. Her weakening fingers scratched at the disgusting noose."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_433e946b:


    "The monster turned to its maws toward me. Sticky strands of saliva dripped from it."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_8f00ee4e:


    "Polina's arms relaxed, but her dead body continued to sway in the wind."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_ff603f56:


    "The wolves got ready to pounce, waiting for their signal."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_e042c9ec:


    "Their muscles bulged under the dirty fur that stood on end."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_c4f707ec:


    "Their scab-covered tails trembled in anticipation of a feast."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_38273307:


    "The monster slowly raised its hand and poked me with its claw."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_0fa3eb2c:



    voice "voice/bunny/13 Ez.ogg"
    Bunny "We're outcasts because of the likes of you!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_11f6ad30:



    voice "voice/bunny/14 Vs.ogg"
    Bunny "The whole pack had already bitten the moon..."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_7f3458cb:



    voice "voice/bunny/15 As.ogg"
    Bunny "But you had to be special!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_1837a01b:



    voice "voice/bunny/16Tv .ogg"
    Bunny "Your meat will dissolve in stomach acid."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_dc3e1303:



    voice "voice/bunny/17Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "Your soul will be claimed by the forest."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_f23bc9d5:



    voice "voice/bunny/18 Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "Your name will be forgotten."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_51430495:


    "The wolves howled."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_73b38b0b:


    "The beast closest to me jumped, its jaws locking on my throat, its teeth sinking into my larynx."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_9c7745b6:


    "Polina's shadow swayed on the wall."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_5b641b60:


    "I clung to the sticky wolf scalp with my fingers, channeling the last of my strength to push away the predator."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_4312a689:


    "He chewed on and tore apart my larynx."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_bc729829:



    voice "voice/bunny/19 Nu.ogg"
    Bunny "Well? Is it scary to die?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_2e6f3731:


    Oly "AAAAAAAAAAAA!"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_c119b180:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/sluni.ogg"
    "I gargled on my own saliva, thinking that it was blood, and opened my eyes."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_4e72f538:


    "Olya's screaming stopped, but its echo still resounded inside my skull."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_8b7ec864:


    "The pain was gone."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_41e3163d:


    "The wolves, the monsters, the dead Polina... All of it was gone."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_fe6567f3:


    "I was transported from the burning bedroom in Khariton's house to my own hallway. Was all that just a dream?"


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_29fb91a9:


    "I felt around my intact neck."


translate english event_m_polina_refuse_95a875db:


    "Not only the night at Polina's place, but the entire last month, the wounded Katya, and our escape from the garage, too..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c6fc05a3:


    "I looked at Polina."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_596994e6:


    "Her innocent smile didn't convince me."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_915f9f40:


    "And even though the snowy veil enveloped more and more of the school yard, I could see things much more clearly."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3b9f0535:


    "I still couldn't trust Polina."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_786f9a45:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/192 P.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, Polina, but Katya needs my help more."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d67c4943:


    "Polina looked like she got slapped in the face."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ebc07830:


    "Her eyes narrowed, and the smile withered on her quivering lips."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4b944c3c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/62 Es.ogg"
    Kate "If you don't mind, of course. You don't, right, Polina?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4e190ed8:


    "Romka's appearance broke the awkward silence."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4d66e3df:


    "He walked out from around the corner, his head hanging low."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bd9f4fde:


    "It seemed like losing his friend put a great weight on his shoulders, literally."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3536de2b:


    "Katya grabbed me by the elbow, but I paid that no mind."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_0fdf0024:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/165 R.ogg" 
    Pol "Roma!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6a3a5cdd:


    "Polina rushed toward Romka and hugged him."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_46d51701:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/166 ro.ogg" 
    Pol "Romochka, I felt so terrible without you."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4ebc8af6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/167 nu.ogg" 
    Pol "Where have you been?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3c699788:


    "After a brief pause, Romka circled his back around Polina's trembling back."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_58f5d7fb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/63 b.ogg"
    Kate "Well, that was fast. Doesn't it upset you, Anton?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b1549d79:


    "I shook my head."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_68f91cbb:


    "Romka raised his head. The usual triumphant smirk flashed on his face, but the next moment it was gone."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bf673c64:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/41 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Come on, stop crying, I don't like that."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_cdeca368:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/42 Na.ogg"
    Rom "Did you go to school?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_1f849953:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/168 bi.ogg" 
    Pol "I did..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_10c91e3c:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/43 B.ogg"
    Rom "Have you seen Byasha?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b5e4dda1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/168 ne.ogg" 
    Pol "No."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d452472c:


    "Roma spat in the snow. And only then he turned his eyes toward Katya and me."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b656f847:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/45 A.ogg"
    Rom "Have you two seen Byasha?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ba2f83fb:


    "I shook my head, surprised."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3b02b3bb:


    "We both saw that sneaker. Romka confirmed it was his friend's."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_10ef62ad:


    "It was unlikely that Byasha gifted his shoes to the serial killer of his own accord and was now wandering the village barefoot."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a704b0c7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/193 R.ogg"
    Ant "Roma, Byasha was in the garage."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_19455efe:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/46 B.ogg"
    Rom "So what? We were there, too. And we're safe and sound."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9230fad2:


    "He didn't look of sound mind to me at all."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e24f277f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/47 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I won't rest until I find out what happened to Byasha."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ad483a0a:


    "Roma pulled out a pack of posters from his coat, counted out several of them, and handed them to me."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3726f5da:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/48 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "Put them up along the road."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8908565d:


    "I couldn't even take a good look at them before Katya pulled me to the side."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d22d448e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/64 K.ogg"
    Kate "Right, right! Any posh for your dosh."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d35347c2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/65 A.ogg"
    Kate "And if you're broke—tough luck, good bloke."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_58bc9ee2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/66 Ch.ogg"
    Kate "Ciao-cacao!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_57eff479:


    "Roma turned a deaf ear to Katya's comments. He just rubbed Polina's shoulder."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7ca5f718:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/49 Ed.ogg"
    Rom "Let's go, baby."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d9ba62e6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/49 od.ogg"
    Rom "Can't walk alone around here these days."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3a3f6b24:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/169 ed.ogg" 
    Pol "Let's go, Romochka. I have so many things I want to tell you."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_310a8da4:


    "As they left, Romka locked his eyes with mine one last time and nodded, as if we shared some sort of secret."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a5366a6a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/67 E.ogg"
    Kate "And they lived happily ever after..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3d518b5d:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/18 Kat.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Katya, dear!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c0d5b245:


    "We looked up at a second-floor window."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a2c9071b:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/19 Ver.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Get back to class. You'll have to wait for me."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7d0fbb93:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/20 Ra.ogg"
    Lilia_P "I'm swamped with work!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_2ce8c1a3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/194 L.ogg"
    Ant "Lilia Pavlovna, I can walk Katya home."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_acd18702:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/21 Pr.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Really? That would be wonderful!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4866d949:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/22 No.ogg"
    Lilia_P "It's just... We don't even have anything to eat at home."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a416bb45:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/68 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "Don't worry, Mom, I'll make something myself. We'll be fine."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d89e6860:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/23 Mo.ogg"
    Lilia_P "Ah, you two are such a blessing! Just be careful out there."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7be81fba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/195 K.ogg"
    Ant "Of course!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_16386849:


    "We went down the road."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_720b1696:


    "Ashen clouds covered the sky, hid the sun, painted the world around us in mold-gray hues."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_22ab6680:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/69 Esh.ogg"
    Kate "Again, I'm sorry. For today and before."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_139891da:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/70 T.ogg"
    Kate "You probably thought I'm a nasty person, huh?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_54c08a09:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/196 Che.ogg"
    Ant "Honestly? I had similar thoughts, yes."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_78bdab93:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/71 Nu.ogg"
    Kate "Idiot!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ae4cefd3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/197 H.ogg"
    Ant "You wanted me to be truthful."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e501a76f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/72 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "Then I'll also tell you the truth."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_5e6e4613:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/73 Dum.ogg"
    Kate "Thought I bullied you because I'm a sadist or something?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_603a8991:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/74 Da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes! Yeah, right!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c5c12d67:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/75 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I just didn't know how to get your attention."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ffde1c1c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/77 kh.ogg"
    "I gave Katya a surprised look."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_be255b32:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/76 V.ogg"
    Kate "You boys can't read hints at all."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_48e236b9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/79 ai.ogg"
    "Katya furrowed her brow, and we stopped for a moment."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_161cf97d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/78V.ogg"
    Kate "I'm fine. Let's move."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_0b4a88e1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/198 Na.ogg"
    Ant "Walking with crutches must be so uncomfortable..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_f1350c3d:


    "Mundane talk like that saved me from the embarrassment caused by Katya's candid words."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_dadf120d:


    "I still had the image of us holding hands at the back of a police car in my mind."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_5aee8c65:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/79 p.ogg"
    Kate "You get used to them."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e6047c70:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/80 m.ogg"
    Kate "And Mom helps a lot."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b8e87d2b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/81 E.ogg"
    Kate "She already has it rough, and now I'm a cripple as well."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b1b2fa2f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/199 Y.ogg"
    Ant "Can I ask you something?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_16c422c3:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/82 ri.ogg"
    Kate "Take your shot."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_526ad992:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/200 T.ogg"
    Ant "Your dad..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_5ebd1e6a:


    "Katya curled her lips."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_0d790fb1:


    "I entered dangerous territory. But she relaxed after a moment and replied."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_1ab7f2ff:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/83 Pa.ogg"
    Kate "Dad used to work in a psych ward."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_2e32a0de:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/84 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I've learned so much about our wonderful neighbors from him."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_4ea5f39a:


    "She was trying to avoid the subject."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_457169c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/85 V.ogg"
    Kate "Take Polina. One hell of a family..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3436eb98:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/86 E.ogg"
    Kate "Her grandpa was the one who sent Byasha's mom to the loony house."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7ab20c78:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/201 Ha.ogg"
    Ant "Khariton?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c63ad7c1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/87 on.ogg"
    Kate "The man, the legend. Although he had reason to do so."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a2f7d389:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/88 Ma.ogg"
    Kate "Byasha's mom spread these rumors... they weren't even rumors, just straight up delusions."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_84b6253b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/89 G.ogg"
    Kate "She said that people in the village are possessed, that old Khariton was a demon."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9809f959:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/90 Na.ogg"
    Kate "She'd always be drunk early in the morning, and that's how she saw demons, I guess."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b1036640:


    "I remembered the old man in a wheelchair and his foreboding tales."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d0db524c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/91 Ko.ogg"
    Kate "When she got locked up, Khariton started looking after Byasha."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_246bd159:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/92 E.ogg"
    Kate "Dad also told me about Romka's deadbeat father."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_70c9a703:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/93 Z.ogg"
    Kate "Did you know that she was in a drug addiction recovery program?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8a039476:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/94 da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_cebc3120:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/95  Ez.ogg"
    Kate "That's why he beats his son all the time."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8d284522:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/96 N.ogg"
    Kate "I won't be surprised if Romka walks the same road."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_2b8751e8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/97 S.ogg"
    Kate "With the kind of life he's leading right now."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_66e2d353:


    "I didn't enjoy listening to other people's dark secrets."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_24507e87:


    "Drug addict, mentally ill women... "


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ecf834b9:


    "It reminded me that darkness didn't only reside in the forest or the cobweb-ridden corners of old houses."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8186442f:


    "It's often stored in people's heads, too."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a043b7c5:


    "Awakening something dangerous... like demons... or dormant monsters..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_f5231065:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/202 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "We've been talking about people for a while. Why don't you tell me about yourself?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_36ed3a5a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/98a.ogg"
    Kate "What is there to tell? You already know everything."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b7da548f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/203 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "I feel like I know nothing."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a605cbc8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/204 T.ogg"
    Ant "You said your dad used to work."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_468652cf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/205 On.ogg"
    Ant "Did he quit?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8c204392:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/99t.ogg"
    Kate "Well, stuff happened..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9cb28513:


    "Katya's gaze turned toward the mist floating in front of us."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e70c74df:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/100e.ogg"
    Kate "When you deal with crazies for long enough, you go mad yourself."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_975e6023:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/101p.ogg"
    Kate "My daddy met a young nurse and fled, the horndog."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_f1c0bbc4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/102ma.ogg"
    Kate "Mom had to work really hard so I could have a nice childhood. Both as a teacher and as a parent."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_cc76e077:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/103z.ogg"
    Kate "Do you know how much she loves me?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_f48ed394:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/104e.ogg"
    Kate "If I were gone, I think she'd kill herself."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_25e10570:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/105t.ogg"
    Kate "So you actually saved two lives there."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_46ced24c:


    "My mind drew a distinct scene."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_71219415:


    "The kids are waiting for class to start, but instead of their teacher, the principal enters the classroom."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_160664ba:


    "He says that today's literature class was canceled."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_540576c0:


    "Lilia Pavlovna is dead. She hanged herself."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e1ac50ef:


    "That imaginary scene scalded my heart and returned me to that tragic day."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_953e3684:


    "Katya in the meat grinder's bowl... and her mutilated toes."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_cdb45ff6:


    "I blinked to fight that delusion. And then asked cautiously:"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6411ec2d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/206 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "Do you remember the moment you were kidnapped?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_908568cd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/106 gl.ogg"
    "Katya gulped."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_82d23636:


    "I chastised myself for talking too much. That was the worst possible question!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c1e02ba9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/107 V.ogg"
    Kate "More or less."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_74200eb0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/108on.ogg"
    Kate "He... c-came up from behind, grabbed me and I... I... probably lost consciousness."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_09fb756f:


    "That story sounded so familiar..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_f845bc7f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/01 p.ogg"
    Kate "Because what other explanation could there be?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8b68d84b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/02 u.ogg"
    Kate "He had your face, Anton! And then he just soared into the sky. Yes, yes, yes."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9ec37373:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/03 e.ogg"
    Kate "And then something really weird started happening… Brrr!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_da2167d0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/04 y.ogg"
    Kate "I realized it was all just a nightmare. T-then, when I woke up..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_40080c9a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/05 s.ogg"
    Kate "I saw him dragging me through the snow."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6f04faa8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/110 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I grabbed my purse... and threw it to the road. I hoped that somebody would find it and..."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_87f86ddd:


    "Katya stopped near the only two apartment buildings in the village and turned away from me."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b1e515ba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/207 K.ogg"
    Ant "Katya?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_af10dc2b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/111 hn.ogg"
    "She was crying."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c0e94151:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/112 ch.ogg"
    Kate "What?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_df8db7f7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/113 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I've been Katya for twelve years!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6b69349d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/208 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Stop it. Let's leave all that behind."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bf334cda:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/114 At.ogg"
    Kate "Wanna know what was the scariest about that meat grinder?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bddbd490:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/115ch.ogg"
    Kate "That I would day before confessing to you."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_81cfdf00:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/209 V.ogg"
    Ant "Confessing what?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7180703a:


    "Katya suddenly turned around, and I saw how red her face was."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6568b2ca:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/116 k.ogg"
    Kate "You're such a moron, Anton Petrov!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a47ce4f2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/117v.ogg"
    Kate "Confessing that I like you!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8f0584ec:


    "I was taken aback."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_92fe9c12:


    "But then heard my own words as if they were spoken from some faraway place."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3e66440d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/210 T.ogg"
    Ant "I like you, too."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_0bb3fc39:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/118 Ch.ogg"
    Kate "Honest?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_14b7ed21:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/211 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "Honest."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_3c4b67d0:


    "I wiped the tears off her brightening face."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_dabc5dab:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/212 K.ogg"
    Ant "Of course I like you. I thought it was obvious."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_29f555ce:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/119 V.ogg"
    Kate "Everything is always obvious to you guys."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_82482566:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/120 a.ogg"
    Kate "But the girls want to hear those things. We love with our ears, didn't you know?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_13168ae4:


    "I didn't know a lot of things."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c39d3b68:


    "Katya's tears glistened, the snow showered the crossroads that presented me with meaningful choices, with different lives."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7e203eac:


    "I felt like that moment was special and that I needed to engrave it in our memories."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_098c264f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/213 r.ogg"
    Ant "Can I draw you?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a26beed4:


    "Katya smiled and wiped away her tears."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_40ba10ac:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/121 t.ogg"
    Kate "Just not this messy version."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_907de230:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/214 po.ogg"
    Ant "Deal!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a9072e72:


    "She looked at the concrete building."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bc4a9a7d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/122 z.ogg"
    Kate "This is where I live."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_687e5aa4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/215 Kr.ogg"
    Ant "Cool. You were special even in this sense."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7d8f4033:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/123 r.ogg"
    Kate "My parents were given an apartment. A teacher and a doctor—the most important people in a village."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7875aa0e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/124 k.ogg"
    Kate "Comfort with a trash heap view."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d757fab0:


    "I'd choose a trash heap over the forest surrounding our house any day."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a83a3d9d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/125 za.ogg"
    Kate "Too bad we don't have an elevator. The crutches are a hassle."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8b2b9213:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/126ne.ogg"
    Kate "Getting to the third floor is a challenge."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_92e1171c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/216 T.ogg"
    Ant "Can I?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_50053941:


    "Mom told me how, one day, during a date with her future husband—my dad—she twisted her ankle."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_03e3e7e7:


    "And dad carried her through two blocks in his hands."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e314e09f:


    "That was the moment when she decided to be together with that man."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_782d61f0:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/127ah.ogg"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9a1d3dd5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/128 ok.ogg"
    Kate "Are you mad?! I'm heavy, you idiot."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_c9b3523c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/218 K.ogg"
    Ant "Light as a feather."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_b3aa199e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/129 oi.ogg"
    Kate "Ow! Look where you put your hands."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_d6487ce5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/130 at.ogg"
    Kate "Or I'll tell Mom."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ac5f4ec9:


    "I took her in my hands and carried her toward her apartment."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_336acf64:


    "A female caretaker, munching on a {u}gozinaki{/u} walked toward us. Her floury face melted in a smile."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_e68d48ac:



    voice "voice/episod/06 Vot.ogg"
    Janitor "Well, well, well! Hah! What a sight! Just like in a Brazilian drama!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_5b57f254:



    voice "voice/episod/07 N.ogg" 
    Janitor "Atta boy! Good job carrying her!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6da57047:



    voice "voice/episod/08 L.ogg" 
    Janitor "Will you look at that?"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9e56044f:



    voice "voice/episod/09 A.ogg" 
    Janitor "And they say those American movies corrupted our youth! There are still decent men out there!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_45985722:


    "I mumbled something awkwardly. Katya turned red as a beet."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_61dbd069:


    "She was light, but I started staggering from side to side on the stairs."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_6f720360:


    "The crutches she held would hit the railings from time to time with a clanging sound."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_48c1b9bd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hi.ogg"
    "Katya giggled, embarrassed."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_49ab9134:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hihi.ogg"
    "She looked like she was trying to carve every little moment of that ascent into her memory."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_0fdb4d27:


    "And I tried my best to keep myself from hudding and keep my back straight."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_bfad3207:


    "Encouraging shouts pushed me in the back."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_9e1844b9:



    voice "voice/episod/10 Na.ogg" 
    Janitor "A true gentleman! Marry him when you grow up, Katya!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_85e77347:


    "Katya burst out laughing."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_99c6a83a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/132 ob.ogg"
    Kate "Of course!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_94ac0a7f:


    "I carefully placed Kkatya on the concrete floor near her apartment's door."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_7c20d642:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hihihi.ogg"
    "She opened it, glancing at me over her shoulder and biting her lower lip."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_8dd138e6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/133 s.ogg"
    Kate "Thank you, Mr. Strongman!"


translate english event_m_katya_devend_a9fc7484:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/134 pr.ogg"
    Kate "Come on in, and I'll bandage my foot in the meantime. Had to learn how to do it myself."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_14544133:


    "She disappeared behind the bathroom door, and I entered her tidy room."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_cf193516:


    "The blizzard that whistled its tune outside made the warm bedroom feel even comfier."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_ada0e2d1:


    "I remembered the apartment we used to live in back in the city. It always had the smell of pastry and the music of my parents' laughter."


translate english event_m_katya_devend_1a4e38af:


    "Still, I felt equally safe here."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_aqua_1c2eb46a:


    "A big aquarium."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_8cbe77ec:


    "Fish are pretty low-maintenance pets. An ideal variant for those who don't spend much time at home."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_b5bed4cd:


    "And Katya missed classes from time to time, and nobody saw her in the village for multiple days."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_5cb1a491:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/220 M.ogg"
    Ant "Can I feed your fish?"


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_30584a6b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/135 T.ogg"
    Kate "Just don't overdo it."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_239c9ea7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/136 E.ogg"
    Kate "If their feed goes bad, it might kill them."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_a85e78f2:


    "A shelf full of awards."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_6e531818:


    "All sorts of participation medals for kids and youth rhythmic gymnastics competitions."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_ac7e81a6:


    "I had no idea she was into sports."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_844b831b:


    "Katya had accomplished a lot before she ended up in the Black Garage."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_1887a83a:


    "A Barbie dollhouse."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_30de6a4e:


    "I'm not good with dolls, but this thing must be expensive. Lilia Pavlovna spoiled her only daughter."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_3830cf03:


    "Still, why were the plastic ladies drinking tea, and why was Ken's head removed?"


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_mirror_3d8c065a:


    "A dressing table."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_mirror_2a5fd420:


    "Katya probably does make up and admires herself here. She has more makeup than my mom."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_754856f5:


    "A cassette player."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_43265b63:


    "An authentic Japanese cassette player."


translate english event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_ce125c3b:


    "And some sports inventory nearby. I can imagine her practicing to music here."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_cc0ce762:


    "Katya stood on tiptoes, with her other hand gracefully pulled back and stripes wavering above her head."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_9091769b:


    "Her movements look so graceful and smooth!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_99c021f3:


    "Why do I feel so sad looking at this photo?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_d98f11da:


    "I got so lost in thought that I didn't even hear the rubber tips of the crutches tumping on the floor."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_f6973a12:


    "I saw Katya reflected in the frame and turned around."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_e3e9e2c1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/137 vz.ogg"
    "She gave the room's interior a look over and sighed."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c119a55c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/138 do.ogg"
    Kate "I still can't believe all of that is in the past now."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_5ff89c68:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/139 mam.ogg"
    Kate "Mom always had dreams about a sports career, so she convinced herself I must make that dream a reality."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_0592d942:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/221 M.ogg"
    Ant "I'm so sorry."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_a6669f6f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/222 V.ogg"
    Ant "All these medals, photos... how will you leave without the gymnastics?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_78230607:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/140 Us.ogg"
    Kate "I'm definitely not becoming a paralympian."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_b75313c5:


    "Katya smiled all of a sudden."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_cca7cbb2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/141 A.ogg"
    Kate "I was always sick of gymnastics."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_532cd4cb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/142 Vs.ogg"
    Kate "Stand like this, stand like that. What's up with that bullshit?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_ff93fb38:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/143 ed.ogg"
    Kate "So this is the only good thing to come out of the latest events..."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_2cd64dd8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/144 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "I no longer need to go to all the competitions."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_91e8ca92:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/145 Da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_9a6d10c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/146 te.ogg"
    Kate "Now I just do whatever I want!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_1f4ee2ae:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/147 kto.ogg"
    Kate "Who's on top of the world? Katya is on top of the world!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_35c8631b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/148 ha.ogg"
    "She burst out laughing, as if to show it was all a joke, but there's always a grain of truth in any joke..."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_680e36b9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/223 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "I wouldn't have thought you were limited in any way, looking at you."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_ca6b4de2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/149 et.ogg"
    Kate "Are you criticizing me? Do you think I'm spoiled?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_7b4bb55b:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/150 h.ogg"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_6eae585f:


    "Katya playfully raised her crutch."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_a96c4ac5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/151p.ogg"
    Kate "Know your place, Petrov!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c7036bc6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/152 e.ogg"
    Kate "And stop being a lazybones. Will you help me with the dinner or not?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_bc7d947c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/224 P.ogg"
    Ant "I'll try!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_eb84bdb7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/153 oh.ogg"
    "Katya led me to the kitchen, opened the drawer, and froze in place, peering inside with caution."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_deec41a6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/225 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "What, do you have mice there?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_198d95c9:


    "She shook her head, anxious."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_2f26b7de:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/154 d.ogg"
    Kate "Take it out, please."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c33f1a32:


    "I approached her and looked into the drawer... "


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c9dfa9d8:


    "At the meat grinder, lurking among the kitchen wares."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c7d6b439:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/226 K.ogg"
    Ant "Right…"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_aab01929:


    "I took it out, feeling as if a cube of ice was lodged under my heart."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c2934919:


    "I squirmed when I saw the blade screwed to the rollers inside its bowl."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_30bf7df7:


    "I told myself that the old cast iron thing had nothing in common with the industrial behemoth from the garage."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_354ef7a9:


    "Katya went all silent, watching me, pale as a ghost."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_06cdbdc1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/155 ne.ogg"
    Kate "I can't handle mincing the meat."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_41d262fd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/156pl.ogg"
    Kate "I immediately feel sick."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_970ec169:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/227 P.ogg"        
    Ant "Leave that to me!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_152b25df:


    "While I was mounting the meat grinder to the table, Katya jingled with the dishes and slammed the refrigerator doors."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_1d025f3c:


    "She put out meat, onions, and breadcrumbs. Reanimated, she cut the vegetables for the salad."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_8e8ea047:


    "I threw the ingredients into the meat grinder and got to work."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_bca8271b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/157b.ogg"
    Kate "Careful with your fingers."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c3993aa9:


    "The grooved rod spun, following the handle, pushing the bits of pork into the blades."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_bd8174b3:


    "The finished mincemeat squeezed through the grate."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_a2ceb183:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/158tc.ogg"
    Kate "Grind it more meticulously!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_0a9e457b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/159 ne.ogg"
    Kate "Don't worry, this meat grinder will never break!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_b22a0b41:


    "I winced after remembering the blades, covered in human blood. I remembered Katya's toe, swinging on a piece of skin."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_086d8d39:


    "I sneaked a pill onto my tongue and chewed on it."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_b72a52a3:


    "The medication calmed me down, the fear retreated to its dark lair."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_7c540197:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/160mi.ogg"
    Kate "We're like a crazy family."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_0df4ac4b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/161do.ogg"
    Kate "Darling, what's for dinner?"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_8ac8e261:


    "I played along."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_d2a9ff30:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/228 K.ogg"
    Ant "Cutlets, honey."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_f63048ac:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/162Ah.ogg"
    Kate "Ah, I could eat them three times a day, darling."


translate english event_m_katya_followup_7751245b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/229 U.ogg"
    Ant "I have good news for you. We have enough cutlets to last until next winter!"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_c06ffd4d:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/163hah.ogg"


translate english event_m_katya_followup_99deeed4:


    "As we fooled around, our anxiousness faded along with nauseating delusions."


translate english event_m_katya_stove_lose1_22acb9c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/168 ne.ogg"
    Kate "I don't think they are supposed to be this black."


translate english event_m_katya_stove_lose2_91837881:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/169ot.ogg"
    Kate "Open the window, or we'll suffocate from this stink."


translate english event_m_katya_stove_lose3_9062e70e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/170 m.ogg"
    Kate "Sigh... Well, they say coal can help with indigestion."


translate english event_m_katya_round1_win_08333f2a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/230 T.ogg"
    Ant "Look at this rosy crust!"


translate english event_m_katya_round2_win_d2d632fe:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/164 z.ogg"
    Kate "This smells so good it may even attract our neighbors."


translate english event_m_katya_round3_win_81fbdcf8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/231 Pe.ogg"
    Ant "It's the first time they turned out this good."


translate english event_m_katya_round4_win_7df1ce54:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/165 p.ogg"
    Kate "Just like in a restaurant, right?"


translate english event_m_katya_round5_win_44baa39a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/166v.ogg"
    Kate "It's on par with my mom's cooking!"


translate english event_m_katya_round6_win_7eaabc17:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/167e.ogg"
    Kate "If they taste as good as they like, I'll have to actually marry you."


translate english event_m_katya_skip_game_eaa3d43e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/232 Y.ogg"
    Ant "I'm somewhat of a cook, yeah..."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_4af02666:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/233 P.ogg"
    Ant "Just tell me where your waste bin is."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_a16236f1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/173p.ogg"
    Kate "It's under the sink. And make sure to check if there's a spare gas mask lying around there."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_8e85176d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/174 fu.ogg"
    "Katya sniffed the air and wrinkled her nose."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_efff4772:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/175nu.ogg"
    Kate "Yeah, Petrov, you won't cut it to feature in {u}\"Smak\"{/u}."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_d1bf306d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/176dai.ogg"
    Kate "Let me do it…"


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_22c0adcd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/177v.ogg"
    "She swayed toward the stove. I caught her by the waist to stop her from falling."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_7403cf6f:


    "My face reddened the next moment, when I realized how bold that move was."


translate english event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_fbd3a385:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/178de.ogg"
    Kate "Hold me tighter."


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_0db0735e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/179vd.ogg"
    "Katya took in the appetizing aroma."


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_6e4ca434:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/180s.ogg"
    Kate "Mouth-watering!"


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_849513da:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/181da.ogg"
    Kate "Many would kill to have a groom like you."


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_ec129c3a:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/182oh.ogg"


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_b84e566b:


    "Katya stumbled and swayed over the stove. I had to hold her by the waist to keep her balance."


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_1b8fc18d:


    "My face reddened the next moment, when I realized how bold that move was."


translate english event_m_katya_good_game_14758b05:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/183 ne.ogg"
    Kate "No, I'd rather you don't get killed. I'll need you to hold me like that all the time."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_52656f70:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/184 na.ogg"
    Kate "Finally, the life I dreamed of when I was killing myself with all the training!"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_1a0f999f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/185mo.ogg"
    Kate "I can eat tasty stuff without thinking of stupid diets."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_63ed6b57:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/186m.ogg"
    Kate "Mmm! Fried potatoes with cutlets, made with natural oil..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_b4f35df4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/187h.ogg"
    Kate "Want a bite?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_8e948e77:


    "Katya held out a cutlet stuck on a fork and flashed me an alluring smile."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_578f66ae:


    "Before I could even notice, I was already eating off her hands, smiling like a fool."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_d57be047:


    "The cutlets were wonderful, fluffy and soft."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_34fee4e8:


    "When the dishes were empty, I asked:"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_9e107ae9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/235 D.ogg"
    Ant "Seconds?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_25323e8a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/236 K.ogg"
    Ant "Is everything alright, Katya?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_2697f4ac:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/189m.ogg"
    "She was silent, her fingers massaging her temple."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_a8545aec:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/237 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "You shouldn't have overexerted yourself like that!"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_50543a18:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/190p.ogg"
    Kate "I'm just..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_86a14ebd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/189st.ogg"
    "She breathed in through clenched teeth."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_8f040bf0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/191g.ogg"
    Kate "...a little dizzy."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_3d356733:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/192 m.ogg"
    Kate "Can you check if I have a fever?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_3e038c37:


    "I reached out with my hands."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_16715220:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/193ne.ogg"
    Kate "No. Touch my forehead with your lips. Mom always does that."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_bcd935cc:


    "I had the unpleasant feeling that Katya was toying with me again."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_52f13b6b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/238 A.ogg"
    Ant "Don't you have a thermometer?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_a4e33af9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/239 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Ah, whatever..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_f325af14:


    "I leaned in and gave Katya's forehead a quick peck."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_4090cd59:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/240 Vr.ogg"
    Ant "It's not hot."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_3f7d9c54:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/194do.ogg"
    Kate "Please lead me to my bed."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_454e7dc8:


    "I helped Katya get to the bedroom, and she quickly crawled under the blanket."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_3c1a21d9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/195po.ogg"
    Kate "Lie down with me."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_422494aa:


    "I was embarrassed beyond what I could handle."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_8c0478da:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/241 E.ogg"
    Ant "This is... a little too much..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_22c5c306:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/196ch.ogg"
    Kate "Keeping your friend company is too much for you?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_d07a1f2b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/197m.ogg"
    Kate "Mom will come soon and take your place. Lie with me until I fall asleep."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_0b74f271:


    "She looked at me with pleading eyes. I nodded and joined her."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_2e6231b7:


    "Katya stretched and turned off the night lamp."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_763d68f8:


    "We lay in the darkness, listening to the howling wind."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_7b815e93:


    "Katya's finger slid across my hand. Our pinkies intertwined."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_f18d4b13:


    "We didn't need words, but Katya still opened her mouth."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_1fd310d8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/199t.ogg"
    Kate "I really, really like you."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_7e1cc2ff:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/200s.ogg"
    Kate "If it's mutual, tell me."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_d6209e36:


    "I licked my parched lips."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_e012e6c6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/15 Anto.ogg"
    Oly "Anton..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_2d1a4e56:


    "I heard a voice coming from the corner."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_4d02d425:


    "I turned around, incredulous."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_6744b33d:


    "There was a kid's silhouette lurking in the darkness, a tiny ghost that came for my soul."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_d58dae10:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/242 K.ogg"
    Ant "Katya..."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_35003d86:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/201da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_eacdd63d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/243 T.ogg"
    Ant "There's someone there."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_6d7b867f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/202eto.ogg"
    Kate "That's just a shadow from my awards, silly."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_ca3477ee:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/16 An.ogg"
    Oly "Anton, please, wake up."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_34a4b3d8:


    "I turned away from the silhouette, and my pinkie finger squeezed Katya's even harder."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_22c18bf4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/244 K.ogg"
    Ant "Katya, I have something to confess."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_d6ca3063:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/203ya.ogg"
    Kate "You don't like me?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_b8de2148:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/245 De.ogg"
    Ant "No, not that. I sometimes have hallucinations."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_a4ad14f1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/246 D.ogg"
    Ant "Doctor says that they will pass when I grow up. I'm taking medication."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_28b55925:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/204ti.ogg"
    Kate "That won't scare me. Have you forgotten?"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_b42997a4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/205m.ogg"
    Kate "My so-called father is a psychiatrist."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_fc4178ab:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/206v.ogg"
    Kate "Just take your meds and everything will be fine."


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_459a277d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/207da.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_ca4b5b4b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/17 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "Anton, please listen to me!"


translate english event_m_katya_after_game_afterdev_e7bca60f:


    "I took the pills out of my pocket."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_4ce077f5:


    "I chewed on the pill and shut my eyes, listening to the noisy blizzard and Katya's breathing..."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_767a3b47:


    "...but not the crying of an imaginary child."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_b45b2a34:


    "I felt hot."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_9b0f0dd1:


    "Katya touched my forehead with her lips and then carefully rubbed my cheek with her hand."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_b11f39f4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/208sp.ogg"
    Kate "Sleep, you'll feel better."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_b8e6e3b0:


    "I let the warm waves carry me."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_31495008:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/209z.ogg"
    Kate "Just sleep, Mom will call your parents."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_5f000982:


    "I fell into the void..."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_566df08a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/210s.ogg"
    Kate "Sleep, I'm here, with you..."


translate english event_m_katya_accept_2bad8766:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/210 sp.ogg"
    Kate "Sleep..."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_2ddcf4ae:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/247 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I've taken too many already."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_464d296c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/248 H.ogg"
    Ant "Enough is enough. I don't want to die from an overdose."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_2e5af574:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/249 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "Katya?"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_4b7c2d9e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/211hn.ogg"
    "I heard stifled cries coming from my side."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_8e37a14b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/250 K.ogg"
    Ant "Katya, dear, what happened?"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_d1c18d5e:


    "Something smacked silently in the pitch-dark room."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_d0e91a19:


    "The sound of a band-aid being torn off."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_e2755dbd:


    "I felt one of my socks quickly soaking in some sticky liquid."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_2a7c2b73:


    "My shaking hand felt around, searching for the light switch."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_ba2621d8:


    "The night lamp flared up. Red spots were spreading across the blanket."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_3c25a380:


    "I backed away to the wall."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_c7c9c516:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/251 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "Katya, your wound has reopened!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_72c18cf2:


    "In a panic, I threw off the blanket."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_43db9a03:


    "I was ready to see bandages soaked with blood. But I wasn't ready to see what was really happening."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_318412cc:


    "Katya's leg was missing up to her knee."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_41b3a2f7:


    "Fat, dirty rats writhed in the scarlet pool."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_7c511a23:


    "They devoured Katya, their greedy mugs burrowed in the bubbling meat of the leg stump."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_3036fd95:


    "The biggest rat was trying to suck out the marrow from a white shard among the mess."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_3b769688:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/212A.ogg"
    "Katya squealed."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_b8a9f644:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/212 A.ogg"
    "Katya suddenly sat up, her pale face directed at me. Veins bulged under her skin, her eyes rolled over."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_0509b520:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/213 ti.ogg"
    Kate "You!!!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_36fd4860:


    "She growled as she crumpled the bedsheets."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_8d0b31df:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/214et.ogg"
    Kate "It's all your fault!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_715a3a14:


    "Katya twitched, and I realized what was happening."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_a29fe50e:


    "Her body was sinking between the sofa's two halves."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_7d27515f:


    "I heard a roaring motor whirring somewhere in the sheets compartment, deep inside the sofa."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_6a929d2f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/215ku.ogg"
    Kate "Going somewhere?!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_a06b2d3d:


    "Hatred and pain disfigured Katya's face, made it unrecognizable."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_4fcd5d2d:


    "Sofa's flaps lifted, its legs tore off the floor."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_7d6888f3:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/216ni.ogg"
    Kate "Nobody is waiting for you!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_be0fd65c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/217 ti.ogg"
    Kate "You're weak and nasty, nobody wants you!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_13f56563:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/220ou.ogg"
    "Thick black blood flowed out of Katya's mouth along with words."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_1eac2aa5:


    "Katya was descending into the meat grinder, dangling like a cloth doll."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_d4bbc5d1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/220ou2.ogg"
    "I heard the cracking of the bones and the stifled cries of a child."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_cbf6de13:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/18 Pr.ogg"
    Oly "Come to your senses! Wake up!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_bf09f1d6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/220ou3.ogg"
    "The sofa devoured Katya up to her waist. She floundered, spewing blood and curses."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_60c0556b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/221ne.ogg"
    Kate "Don't you dare turn around! Look at what you've done, weakling!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_be576032:


    voice "voice/Anton/5day/252 Vzz.ogg"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_ebed5c77:


    "A fountain of blood hit the ceiling and my face."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_9dc99ac1:


    "The furniture melted, upholstering peeled off the sofa, baring its cast iron sides."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_781fbe9d:


    "Melat walls peeked from under the wallpaper. The bedroom was turning into the Black Garage."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_c31dfcc6:


    "I didn't escape it. I will never be able to leave it."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_805edf10:


    "The meat grinder completely devoured Katya. Minced meat flooded the tray underneath it."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_4a996bb6:


    "A torn-off face floated up from the bloody soup."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_58df46a0:


    "Its white lips twitched. Katya's remains talked to me."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_d403f961:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/222 t.ogg"
    Kate "You're doomed! There's no timeline where you'll be able to save me, loser!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_43fa3cab:


    "I screamed and ran from that nightmare."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_8846a894:


    "The wind howled into the open doors."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_6d6547df:


    "The giant with a huge head, adorned with long ears, awaited me at the doorstep."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_4aa60575:


    "His scowl reminded me of a pus-oozing scar."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_0fa3eb2c:



    voice "voice/bunny/13 Ez.ogg"
    Bunny "We're outcasts because of the likes of you!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_11f6ad30:



    voice "voice/bunny/14 Vs.ogg"
    Bunny "The whole pack had already bitten the moon..."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_7f3458cb:



    voice "voice/bunny/15 As.ogg"
    Bunny "But you had to be special!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_1837a01b:



    voice "voice/bunny/16Tv .ogg"
    Bunny "Your meat will dissolve in stomach acid."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_dc3e1303:



    voice "voice/bunny/17Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "Your soul will be claimed by the forest."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_f23bc9d5:



    voice "voice/bunny/18 Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "Your name will be forgotten."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_a1d80300:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/252 Vz.ogg"
    "The monster's cold hands fell on my shoulders. Its claws pierced my muscles."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_104a02dd:


    "The giant tore me off the ground and shoved me head-first into the funnel."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_38822dcb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/223tc.ogg"
    Kate "Grind it more meticulously!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_da88a3d8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/224 ne.ogg"
    Kate "Don't worry, this meat grinder will never break!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_36d3d831:


    "My hands were outstretched, so they ended up between the blades first."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_5e6cb425:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/225be.ogg"
    Kate "Careful with your fingers!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_86dfc461:


    "My wrists fell into the tray."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_ec4f694a:


    "The next moment, the blades cut off my arms up to the elbows. Blood gushed out of the stumps."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_0b5d75ed:


    "The blades drew closer."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_34b87ee6:


    "I felt the steel eating into my face."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_d4180be1:


    "The last sounds I heard were Olya's deafening scream."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_05692390:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/12 A.ogg"
    Oly "Aaaaaaaaaa!"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_47da6755:


    "I whizzed and opened my eyes."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_f4e85280:


    "Olya's scream stopped, but it still echoed inside my skull."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_8b7ec864:


    "The pain was gone."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_08ec73c6:


    "The disgusting bunny, the blades, the blood... all of that disappeared."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_dbcb81ab:


    "I was transported from the Black Garage to my hallway. Was all that just a dream?"


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_1fc6e354:


    "Then moved my intact hands."


translate english event_m_katya_refuse_24a4e53f:


    "Not only the garage, but also the last month, and the wounded Katya, and the escape from the serial killer..."


translate english event_m_end_ba286577:


    "...was all of that a product of my delusional brain?"


translate english event_m_end_0f6e05aa:


    "Olya was still with me on the floor, but not where I left her. She was now lying on my chest."


translate english event_m_end_a7182061:


    "As if while I was out of it, she woke up and tried to save me..."


translate english event_m_end_592c496a:


    "By calling out to me..."


translate english event_m_end_ca909110:


    "By getting me out of the clutches of horror with her scream."


translate english event_m_end_e57e28e6:


    "And then she lost consciousness again."


translate english event_m_end_aa49c34e:


    "I leaned in and slid my fingers across her warm cheek."


translate english event_m_end_4818aff1:


    "The blizzard crashed at the windows. The clocks ticked loudly."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_7be28c5a:


    "Black figures moved toward the house, shrouded by darkness."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_888691b0:


    "They were hungry."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_dffffb8f:


    "They still waited for their treat."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_4f2041b1:


    "I needed help, so I ran into the hallway, slipping and sliding."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_0aab65f6:


    "I clutched the phone."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_4586c98a:


    "The speaker was silent at first. Then, barely audible beeps came through."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_cd4bf15e:


    "I imagined the posts swaying in the wind, the wires ringing as they were about to be snapped in half by hungry jaws."


translate english phase2_phonecall_devend_5bd1f972:


    "My fingers spun the dial."


translate english phone_roma_3c64434e:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/282 Allo.ogg" 
    Rom "Hello?"


translate english phone_roma_867bd62f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/056.R.ogg"
    Ant "Roma! Roma! It's meя!"


translate english phone_roma_dbb49840:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/282 Allo2.ogg" 
    Rom "Hello!"


translate english phone_roma_61d1855b:


    "He couldn't hear me. I shouted in desperation."


translate english phone_roma_5348684a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/057.Ro.ogg"
    Ant "Roma!"


translate english phone_roma_c49e01cd:


    "I got frequent beeps in reply."


translate english phone_roma_c16134f1:


    "An anxious rustle arose, as if the house was thrown into the forest, and its piny paws аfelt around the interior, trying to find a way to open the meat lockbox."


translate english phone_polina_5e0d0647:


    "I dialed Polina's number. The phone vibrated with beeps as short as my breath."


translate english phonecall_fail_78089a6f:


    "Finally, I called the police, but the dry female voice on the other end just kept on repeating the same words over and over:"


translate english phonecall_fail_eb21477d:



    voice "voice/episod/DANNOE.ogg" 
    Operator "The line is busy. The line is busy. The line is..."


translate english phonecall_fail_039641a0:


    "I dropped the phone."


translate english phonecall_ok_7285e22b:


    "The note with Tikhonov's number that I hid earlier came in handy. The dial creaked, measuring the numbers."


translate english phonecall_ok_818df189:


    "I twirled the chord around my hand and prayed that the policeman was at his station."


translate english phonecall_ok_13f0337a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/107 St.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Senior lieutenant Tikhonov on the phone."


translate english phonecall_ok_16b17f83:


    "His voice battled its way to me through nature's wrath. It flowed down the icy wires."


translate english phonecall_ok_f0a26cf2:



