translate english event_monsters_came_devend_7b8d58c3:


    "The rumbling noise stopped as suddenly as it started. The black crucifix flew off the nail and crashed into the floor at my feet."


translate english event_monsters_came_devend_1b4c3765:


    "A chain of anxious memories rushed through my mind."


translate english event_monsters_came_devend_25afe502:


    "Ringing bells from the small abandoned church at the edge of the village, the dusty icons on the far shelves in my parents' bedroom, my grandma's warding chant…"


translate english event_monsters_came_devend_1dc4f7a1:


    "I wanted to believe that the cross could protect us from the horror of the things that came from the frosty forest."


translate english event_monsters_came_devend_36fbe9df:


