translate english event_monsters_faith_87d2d3eb:


    "I was about to grab the ancient relic when something pricked me under my shirt."


translate english event_monsters_faith_a59ef579:


    "The shamanic amulet in the shape of a claw that Polina gifted me."


translate english event_monsters_faith_b4ebb610:


    "Grim taiga magic resisted the divine force that my grandma and Dad believed in so much."


translate english event_monsters_faith_88655c1f:


    "I froze in hesitation, ruminating on whose protection to ask for. Can any of those trinkets really save our lives?"


translate english event_monsters_faith_e44b634e:


    "The house was deathly silent. It felt like the man-eating monsters hid behind the door, smirking, waiting for me to make my choice."


translate english event_monsters_faith_amulet_a4cd83a0:


    "I kicked the cross into the far corner of the room and covered the amulet under my clothes with my palm."


translate english event_monsters_faith_amulet_a6e6f770:


    "The dwellers of the ancient taiga could only be beaten by the religion as ancient, devoid of justice and mercy."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_roma_23b844ca:


    "I grabbed the cross without thinking."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_roma_e319fa54:


    "I was ready to ask God for help, especially when a horned shadow that wanted to confine us to hellish torture walked around outside."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_23b844ca:


    "I grabbed the cross without thinking."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_e319fa54:


    "I was ready to ask God for help, especially when a horned shadow that wanted to confine us to hellish torture walked around outside."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_e211dbc2:


