translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_e4a9b4a8:


    "This beast claw spawned from the dark superstitions of an ancient tribe. The same way those accursed beasts did."


translate english event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_5ab81840:


    "And that means we should part ways."


