    "I needed to buy time. I needed to save not only my little sister, but also my friend."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_98882bf2:


    "I needed to buy time. I needed to save my little sister."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_cedcc0ba:


    "I flung open the freezer and dug out a frosty, bloodstained sack."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_9951f806:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/298 Toh.ogg"
    Rom "Where are you going, Toha?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_1c79d564:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/164.Net.ogg"
    Ant "Stay away!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_142ea2c7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/164.Ber.ogg"
    Ant "Guard Polina and Olya."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_02d8cafd:


    "My tone of voice—commanding, firm—surprised me."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_71d13c36:


    "I guess I was more like my father than I expected."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_bfddb155:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/166.Ume.ogg"
    Ant "I have a treat for you!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_45a4411a:


    "I screamed, clutching the remains of a parasite that made its home inside Zhulka."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_c8739a3c:


    "The house wobbled like a bad tooth. The base of the house screeched."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_3e608250:


    "The draft hit my face."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_a0c44d00:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/168.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'll feed you, I promise, just leave us alone!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_35fbe184:


    "The blizzard purred like a cat that was tired of playing with the mouse."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_b21375e4:


    voice "voice/Bear/5day/13 Dai.ogg"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_26ee065b:


    Animals "GIVE! GIVE! GIVE!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_99a9c1ef:


    "Before Romka could realize what was going on, I opened the front door."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_d31c1bf5:


    "Before Polina could realize what was going on, I opened the front door."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_6364bae4:


    "I couldn't see anything because of the blizzard, but I knew..."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_7c3ca6c6:


    "Black, barely discernible silhouettes stood in the snowy field a couple of steps away from me."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_593b65b9:


    "They stood there, patiently waiting for me to throw them the promised treat."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_f16dcd7b:


    "I threw the dog meat into the wind, shut the door, and ran toward the window."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_e8f8e5f0:


    "Carnivorous shadows lunged at the remains of their own kin, tore the cloth, and bit into the meat."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_ca9f845f:


    "They tore and swallowed, raising their heads toward the dark sky."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_1fbf1639:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/169.Na.ogg"
    Ant "Feast all you want!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_b36f29be:


    "But it wasn't enough for them."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_fb523410:


    "The bear was the first to jump away from the feast."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_9275a83c:


    "He fell on one side and started dangling his legs."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_216d368d:


    "It would've looked funny if his movements weren't as scary."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_cc801e75:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/15 Dr.ogg"
    Bear "Nasty!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_7c307c41:


    "Chewed-up sludge dripped from his maw."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_d067802f:



    voice "voice/Owl/36 Tu.ogg" 
    Owl "Roootten, hoot!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_ca8493c5:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/17 Ne.ogg"
    Bear "Not tasty! Not tasty at all!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_801e237f:


    "They pleaded and howled, dragging their bellies on the snow around the carcass."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_4715890d:


    "The bear, standing on all fours, started burying meat in the snow."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_a47a880b:


    "I almost screamed when multiple pairs of burning eyes turned toward me."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_9d797b08:


    "The beasts rushed to the barricades, and I jumped back to my friends."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_c322b7b6:


    "Claws slashed at the wood, pulled on the planks. But the pieces of broken furniture held firm."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_843d9fb1:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/299 Ch.ogg" 
    Rom "What do they want?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_0b19b5a8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/171.Em.ogg"
    Ant "Me. Olya. All of us."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_38a3b600:


    "Paws invaded the house and slapped on the walls."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_db935395:


    "Saliva splashed everywhere. The jaws clicked."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_86a2d977:


    "The boards held firm, making the monsters let out frenzied roars."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_4613f79a:



    voice "voice/Owl/37 Pu.ogg" 
    Owl "Let us in, hoot! We want to eat!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_1e58b361:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/19 S.ogg"
    Bear "If you don't give us some raw meat, we'll eat it roasted."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_6e253a20:



    voice "voice/Owl/38 Bu.ogg"
    Owl "We'll peel the crust off of you, sweeties!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_e94e3964:


    "A tiny light flashed behind the boards."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_1c982a8b:


    "The hunch of what was about to happen pinned me to the floor, but Polina was the first to voice it."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_addc98dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/33 oni.ogg"
    Pol "They'll burn us alive!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_861a4dd1:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/20 Gor.ogg"
    Animals "Burn bright, burn clear!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_0e91ea4c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/260 P.ogg"
    Ant "We'll have to escape through the back door. Wait here, I'll be right back!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_b7138923:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/172.Sto.ogg"
    Ant "Stay here!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_fd7d24d6:


    "I acted as quickly as I could."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_24a42209:


    "It felt like someone more determined and agile was dormant in me all this time."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_e13d0852:


    "I put the axe down and retrieved Olya from the blanket cocoon."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_52b89914:


    "She squinted, still half-asleep."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_b3f24aad:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/53Eto.ogg"
    Oly "Is it them? Those bad animals?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_ed83dee4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/173.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Don't worry, everything's fine."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_82a4820f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/173.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "They won't lay a finger on us."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_f88d136b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/54 Es.ogg"
    Oly "They will!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_f123bba6:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/174.Po.ogg"
    Ant "Please, don't think about it."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_277f25a1:


    "When I covered Olya with a coat, the air became hot, almost scorching."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_a1989df5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/55 A.ogg"
    Oly "What should I think about, then?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_4ddfdced:


    "The burning wood crackled. The smell of ashes scorched my lungs."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_8cc8a864:


    "I wiped away the sweat from my face with my shoulder."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_f07a1afe:


    "The smoke was already snaking its way toward our feet on the floor."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_a32bed07:


    "We needed to hurry! But I couldn't succumb to panic in front of my little sister."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_30f604fc:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/176. Pom.ogg"
    Ant "Remember how we hung out at the dacha?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_9a12ac56:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/176. Pomn.ogg"
    Ant "Remember what the gooseberries were like?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_74a117f2:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/56 Kis.ogg"
    Oly "Sour!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_c4cb0dc7:


    "Her face shrank."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_62639673:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/177.Avoda.ogg"
    Ant "And the water in the well?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_3a6a2076:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/57 Hol.ogg"
    Oly "Cold! But they didn't let me drink it."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_7249aaf9:


    "Something cracked and fell with a thud on the other side of the wall."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_2f76251b:


    "Shadows flashed in the gaps, the beasts were dancing in a burial roundelay."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_ee1f8bc0:


    "My fingers clutched the axe's handle. A pitiful defense against those who came from below."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_2920ee4f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/50 b.ogg"
    Rom "Hurry up!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_2643a7d7:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/50 Kr.ogg"
    Rom "The ceiling is about to collapse!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_f4166699:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/178.Ama.ogg"
    Ant "Do you remember the raspberries?"


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_0e9719d3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/58 Pom.ogg"
    Oly "I do..."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_58b29c15:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/59 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I'll think about them, then."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_fe0ad535:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/179.Dum.ogg"
    Ant "Think about it and don't look around."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_bf830973:


    "I held the weakened Olya to my chest. While clutching the axe in my right hand."


translate english event_monsters_dog_refuse_07f517d5:


    "The smoke assaulted my eyes. It eddied on the first floor, rancid and stinky."


translate english event_dref_var0_1461d6fe:


    "I kicked the door open and swung with the axe at the empty air, just in case."


translate english event_dref_var1_4b653560:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/199 mne.ogg" 
    Pol "Cough, cough! I can't breathe. We're going to suffocate!"


translate english event_dref_var1_99bde1f3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/34 ska.ogg"
    Pol "Say, do you have a back door here?"


translate english event_dref_var1_5a57fc5d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/181.Est.ogg"
    Ant "We do! Follow me!"


translate english event_dref_var1_1461d6fe:


    "I kicked the door open and swung with the axe at the empty air, just in case."


translate english event_dref_var2_c2eb6de8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/199 mne.ogg"
    Pol "Cough, cough! I can't breathe. We're going to suffocate!"


translate english event_dref_var2_ee13065e:


    "Olya went into a coughing fit and looked at Polian and Romka."


translate english event_dref_var2_5f612eb9:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/61 Vi.ogg"
    Oly "Are you Tosha's friends?"


translate english event_dref_var2_433293f9:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/61 A.ogg"
    Oly "Where are your masks?"


translate english event_dref_var2_99bde1f3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/34 ska.ogg"
    Pol "Say, do you have a back door here?"


translate english event_dref_var2_5a57fc5d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/181.Est.ogg"
    Ant "We do! Follow me!"


translate english event_dref_var2_1461d6fe:


    "I kicked the door open and swung with the axe at the empty air, just in case."


translate english event_dref_common_69a47a5f:


    "The porch was empty."


translate english event_dref_common_b7cd928f:


    "Still, we could only see some twenty feet in front of us—the wall of snow blocked out everything past that point."


translate english event_dref_common_2017336b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/182.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Keep up!"


translate english event_dref_common_55bc3f35:


    "And we ran like never before."


translate english event_dref_common_4f065d37:


    "A yellow glow illuminated the road. The flames snuck into the empty house."


translate english event_dref_common_b89670db:


    "The sooty glass cracked and sprayed from the windows."


translate english event_dref_common_a0b2d292:


    "Olya could barely move her legs."


translate english event_dref_common_9cd15f3f:


    "Sometimes I picked her up and carried her in my arms, with her boots dangling in the air."


translate english event_dref_common_049e900e:


    "But even despite that, Polina still couldn't catch up to us."


translate english event_dref_common_e8810810:


    "It was even lighter outside now."


translate english event_dref_common_2348e00c:


    "I didn't look back, but I had a good idea of how our house turned into a huge pyre."


translate english event_dref_common_6f0fe923:


    "How the fire devoured my paintings, my VHS tapes, the furniture, and our clothes."


translate english event_dref_common_fcb2223e:


    "The flames roared in a choir with the freezing wind. Sparks flew into the sky."


translate english event_dref_common_d2d022d8:


    "Something huge flew past us in the blizzard."


translate english event_dref_common_873a90c5:


    "A sudden gust of wind tore the hat off Olya's head and carried it into the hungry darkness, but I didn't dare look back."


translate english event_dref_common_c00e503b:


    "We jumped over a fallen post."


translate english event_dref_common_5565a5e4:


    "It felt like dozens of hornets stung my cheeks. The frost ravaged my skin."


translate english event_dref_common_d65fa917:


    "My lungs were on the verge of bursting."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_d291f5aa:


    "I slowed down to catch my breath, and in that moment, Olya fell to the ground."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_add07e5f:


    "Her hand slipped out of mine."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_b8a57655:


    "Then, Polina shrieked."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_bf28beeb:


    "The girls were floundering in the snow like it was a mire."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_010e9a21:


    "The field was on the side of the monsters."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_1937b2eb:


    "Polina sank up to her waist, Olya—up to her shoulders."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_005c161c:


    "With every new push, they were only sinking more."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_beca98f8:


    "I froze in place, devoured by fear, watching the ugly, horrific figures turn around in sync."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_22cfd1fa:


    "And then immediately rush at us with all their might, all their limbs digging into the snow."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_af78b7a1:


    "I saw their hungry maws devour crooked stumps, molehills, and the prints we left in the snow."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_61ada222:


    "One moment of weakness and the endless night would lock us in its deadly embrace forever."


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_2bfcc4f6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/64 Tos.ogg"
    Oly "Tosha, help meee!"


translate english event_monsters_dog_roma_c6de30e5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/37 An.ogg"
    Pol "Anton, please, don't leave me behind!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_6477ff1c:


    "The heart-rending howl was getting closer and closer."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_c04fc727:


    "Suddenly, my leg got stuck in the roots."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_01cd0c73:


    "Sharp pain pierced my foot."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_449c348e:


    "I knew we were doomed, but I acted cool."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_0e3fb822:


    "One step, then another."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_de030d5a:


    "My twisted ankle sent rockets of pain into my brain."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_177a3267:


    "Olya turned around, after all, and moaned from horror."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_f288df8e:


    "I didn't want to know what she saw."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_31a11251:


    "The trees stepped out of the darkness."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_86d92175:


    "The thin country road snaked between the snags and roots."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_85e059b0:


    "This is where we'll die."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_f728d07e:


    "My sister felt incredibly heavy all of a sudden."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_03d39039:


    "My lungs resisted the torture."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_07c36276:


    "We couldn't run anymore, we waddled."


translate english event_monsters_polina_special_bc471dce:


    "Polina was mumbling something in desperation."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_1f55c296:


    "The trees flashed past us, turning into a jumble of icy spikes."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_bd86dec0:


    "Branches twisted like the paws of evil owls, and tried to blind us with their crooked fangs."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_20dc5149:


    "Olya's hand was slipping out of mine like it was oiled up."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_c0eca2dc:


    "The forest trail soon ended. We were among the towering piles of snow."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_43fbcc40:


    "Our soles kept on breaking the crusty shell and sinking in the snow. We had to raise our knees super high."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_9e555d32:


    "My muscles spasmed. We were out of breath."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_43bd14fd:


    "But the thing chasing us didn't know fatigue."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_1050abb3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/20 ya.ogg"
    Oly "I can't do this anymore."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_22708c63:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/261 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "We must!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_9b41e2d0:


    "As soon as I said that, I fell face-first from exhaustion myself."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_20748dee:


    "The eternal cold of the thicket scalded my face."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_1b787926:


    "The pain and the horror made tears spray from my eyes, immediately freezing on my cheeks."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_a4270a68:


    "Olya sat beside me, her breathing ragged, and stared intently into the darkness."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2a01394b:


    "I wanted to protect her, but all I could muster was holding out my weakening hand toward her."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_8b6a39e6:


    "Clinging in desperation to an idea that popped up in my head, I took out the black cross I salvaged from home."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_5b11a86c:


    "It was old and looked boring, but I forced myself to imagine that it was a weapon against evil, just like in the movie \"Exorcist\"."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_9aa8191f:


    "Polina, who was trailing behind us the entire time, rushed past me."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_4016fccf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/200 B.ogg"
    Pol "Stop it! They're here."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_a644cd49:


    "The shadows closed in on us, taking the form of animals, of the disgusting carnival in the dark forest."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_8c5b5582:


    "Polina, who was clearly out of breath, stopped and gave me a surprised look."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_d7ae154a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/201 Et.ogg"
    Pol "This won't help. We're just going to die here..."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2fa7d829:


    "I remembered Grandma's funeral. Her fairy tales. The cross that guarded our dwelling from intruders."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_ae0ea94c:


    "No wolf ever entered my home. It was just a dream."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_d7da1bcf:


    "Or maybe..."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_3cedca58:


    "I cast aside the axe and shoved Grandma's cross toward the darkness."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_0cf9a487:


    "Polina stared at me in horror and confusion."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_ecdc8931:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/263 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Begone!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_dee30937:


    "Darkness hooted mockingly. The shadows crept closer."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_56413235:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/264 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I order you!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_a480f8b6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/202 bro.ogg" 
    Pol "Leave it! We need to get out of here!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_4266a95f:


    "Polina sounded desperate and annoyed."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_16fe1f12:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/203 os.ogg" 
    Pol "Can't you see? It's no use! I don't want to die…"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_1837f05c:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/21 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "Me tooo.."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_2_b808d942:


    "Olya touched me, pleading for me to run with her."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_b2c13ac2:


    "We can't run... There's no time..."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_d95123e8:


    "I needed help, some supernatural power against the monsters."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f13eee66:


    "I squeezed my eyes shut and imagined my grandma, standing in the corner under the icons, with her back turned to me."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_3a39c49f:


    "The chant! She taught her grand kid how to defend from those who lurk in the night."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_68194437:


    "My parched lips parted."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f98103c1:


    "It was stupid, but…"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_5d923444:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/265 Na.ogg"
    Ant "On the island of Buyan, underneath the blemished sun, in the sea of color blue, stands a cabin made of wood…"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_b957b4af:


    "What was next?"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_621cacdb:


    "Polina stared at me in disbelief."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_d2db0968:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/266 V.ogg"
    Ant "There lay lard and ashen hair."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f41e3be4:


    "With every word, I lifted off the frozen ground and raised my head higher and higher."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_080bdde5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/267 V.ogg"
    Ant "For the spawn of devil's lair to feast and always leave alone God's faithful servant named Anton."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_155538fa:


    "I paid no mind to my stunned friend and finished the chant, almost screaming."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_85c85d52:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/268 B.ogg"
    Ant "Evil, leave this house must!"


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_4fb9fd81:


    "Olya also screamed at that moment."


translate english event_monsters_polina_cross_3_61454c61:


