translate english event_battle_devend_3e3f22c4:


    "A lower jaw with a patch of white skin."


translate english event_battle_devend_e83a4ecd:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Sk.ogg"
    Bear "So much chocolate!"


translate english event_battle_devend_ca92cea2:



    voice "voice/Owl/03 N.ogg"
    Owl "I hope none of you guys are allergic to sweets!"


translate english event_battle_devend_89401bfc:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ut.ogg"
    Bear "I'm so done with you! Allergies don't exist!"


translate english event_battle_devend_ea124b23:


    "The adults lowered to their knees, touching human remains with their hands in a trance."


translate english event_battle_devend_bbcd099d:


    "The owl shouted in surprise as she surveyed the broken skulls and the \"tails\" of vertebrae."


translate english event_battle_devend_1c199145:



    voice "voice/Owl/04 Or.ogg" 
    Owl "Nuts! Caramel! Icing!"


translate english event_battle_devend_7a49e235:


    "Tikhonov could barely tear himself away from the dead meat."


translate english event_battle_devend_6dc941f8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/62 Mn.ogg"
    Tikhonov "I really have to go… "


translate english event_battle_devend_d09df938:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/43 ui.ogg" 
    Master "Leave without learning why you were found in the thicket, and where did your memories go?"


translate english event_battle_devend_5897e439:


    "A yellow claw poked into the treats."


translate english event_battle_devend_c21c2e8f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/44 vs.ogg"
    Master "It's all here."


translate english event_battle_devend_65f193c6:


    "The bones devoured Tikhonov's attention."


translate english event_battle_devend_d8bc7f0e:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/45 ne.ogg" 
    Master "Don't just stuff yourself with dry food, you gluttons."


translate english event_battle_devend_e57ab90f:


    "The leader of the pack bent down once more and took a rusty vacuum flask out of a snow pile."


translate english event_battle_devend_a1200f7c:


    "Cups appeared in the hands of the woman and the policeman. Steam rose."


translate english event_battle_devend_275af721:


    "I, on the other hand, started at Teddy. Insatiable hunger smoldered in the slits of his mask."


translate english event_battle_devend_2479baf2:


    "His limbs bent, and from his mouth, leaked an uninterrupted streak of saliva."


translate english event_battle_devend_76f62842:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/46 na.ogg"
    Master "Enjoy yourself! Feast to the fullest!"


translate english event_battle_devend_0a299645:


    "The woman giggled."


translate english event_battle_devend_5bd7016e:


    "Tikhonov took a sip of the drink, and then, after a moment of hesitation, reached for the meat."


translate english event_battle_devend_abdbd020:


    "It was as if those two really had no idea what the monster was feeding to them."


translate english event_battle_devend_edaa1163:


    "The feast among the graves was a bloodcurdling spectacle."


translate english event_battle_devend_751a79a9:


    "I backtracked. A shadow whizzed behind my back."


translate english event_battle_devend_aeb43bfa:


    "Romka? No, he was still hugging Polina, glancing around in a panic."


translate english event_battle_devend_448f8c51:


    "I opened my mouth to call out to Tikhonov once again. The shadow glided a few feet away from me."


translate english event_battle_devend_f49a4cdd:


    "The owl bent her neck, snapping her beak."


translate english event_battle_devend_5e5119d0:


    "I recoiled. The foreboding silhouette dissolved in the mist only to appear again behind Romka."


translate english event_battle_devend_6e1ef0f3:


    "The owl walked in circles, preventing our escape."


translate english event_battle_devend_6eb71156:


    "Every time air entered my lungs, she emerged in front of me, hooting and snapping, swaying her furry face."


translate english event_battle_devend_675d7745:


    "While I was distracted with the leader's lackey, Tikhonov shoved a bone under his mask and chewed tendon knots off of it."


translate english event_battle_devend_d0dcc411:


    "The woman feasted on bone marrow, as if she was sucking custard through a straw."


translate english event_battle_devend_6ec4c981:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/13 Za.ogg"
    "Polina and I groaned in unison."


translate english event_battle_devend_a1d84df9:


    "Tikhonov took out something red, metallic, out of his mouth."


translate english event_battle_devend_a7204ac1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/239 et.ogg" 
    Pol "That's Katya's hairpin! For sure!"


translate english event_battle_devend_dfac5dd1:


    "As if starting the third act of a concert, the Goat tilted his head backward and blew another portion of acoustic chaos out of his flute."


translate english event_battle_devend_0bc5972a:


    "The cannibal wearing a police uniform bent in half. The woman beside him did the same."


translate english event_battle_devend_3801427b:


    "They looked like they were being electrocuted. The melody ran charges of electric current through their bodies."


translate english event_battle_devend_6c0f464e:


    "Something was happening to them… their masks warped, no longer just an element of a carnival."


translate english event_battle_devend_7f499598:


    "They turned into animal faces. Real maws opened, with rough, beastly tongues toching yellowed teeth."


translate english event_battle_devend_10f9c2cf:


    "A woman with the head of a bunny… A man with the head of a wolf… "


translate english event_battle_devend_55f60c96:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/64 da.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Yes… that's it… I'm starting to remember…"


translate english event_battle_devend_0a034c97:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/65 mne.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "I was… twelve then."


translate english event_battle_devend_4d2ef59c:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/49 Mne.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "I… I was six."


translate english event_battle_devend_f156985e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/66 m.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "We danced and jumped. I remember it clearly now."


translate english event_battle_devend_7d611b4d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/67 no.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "But the ritual failed. A fire broke out."


translate english event_battle_devend_1809e7e5:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/50 Vse.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "All of the children died."


translate english event_battle_devend_331b8763:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/68 kr.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Apart from us. And then the horned dad took our masks."


translate english event_battle_devend_09905558:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/69 on.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "He burned them, along with our memories."


translate english event_battle_devend_7214b6a2:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/47 nec.ogg" 
    Master "Nothing can burn without a traaace."


translate english event_battle_devend_c6855e44:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/48 v.ogg" 
    Master "You've returned, my children."


translate english event_battle_devend_d00fb453:


    "Hooty opened her beak, a streak of thick saliva dripping out of it."


translate english event_battle_devend_43f306b9:


    "Teddy threw his paws up in the air and swayed like a roly-poly toy."


translate english event_battle_devend_68bae45a:


    "Tikhonov tilted his head backward and let out a short, lonely howl. The wind echoed him."


translate english event_battle_devend_e1bc2059:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/49 t.ogg" 
    Master "Taiga can feel the pack returning. We're almost complete."


translate english event_battle_devend_500cf748:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/50 ne.ogg"
    Master "We only need a fox now."


translate english event_battle_devend_77e8bf8f:


    "My gaze darted around, looking for Alisa. He's talking about my mysterious foxy friend, right?"


translate english event_battle_devend_f9fcebe4:


    "Alisa will come and save us. Only she can stand her ground against the bleating devil."


translate english event_battle_devend_e7aa0c87:


    "The graveyard was getting snowed in more and more."


translate english event_battle_devend_d0540fb3:


    "Roma shielded Polina. But he didn't look like a brave hero."


translate english event_battle_devend_8dd62f4a:


    "Polina looked from behind his back, her eyes glistening with tears."


translate english event_battle_devend_aefa1b41:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/51 bu.ogg" 
    Master "Be a cunning little beast, girl. Join the winning side."


translate english event_battle_devend_c059c080:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/52 E.ogg" 
    Master "And then we will complete the ritual."


translate english event_battle_devend_2a72431f:


    "I looked around once again, yet I still couldn't find Alisa."


translate english event_battle_devend_c7e2c93d:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ri.ogg"
    Bear "Ritual, ritual, ritual."


translate english event_battle_devend_74987cd4:



    voice "voice/Owl/05 Prig.ogg" 
    Owl "Hippity-hop, hippity-hop."


translate english event_battle_devend_65850172:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/71 sz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "He burned our masks…"


translate english event_battle_devend_229dbe22:


    "Tikhonov lowered his horrifyingly long face."


translate english event_battle_devend_a768d8e1:


    "Teeth scraped inside a wolf's maw."


translate english event_battle_devend_c11f6d51:


    "Then he spun toward the leader. I was amazed to hear laughter, distorted by the ancient mask."


translate english event_battle_devend_60d70bb3:


    "Yes, Tikhonov was laughing in the face of the nightmarish Goat."


translate english event_battle_devend_31b2e63c:


    "And the next thing the vocal cords of the former policeman produced was a blood-chilling growl."


translate english event_battle_devend_e68a96ae:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/74 t.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "You'grrr out of you-grrr mind, ho-grrr-ned one! "


translate english event_battle_devend_b5fd81fe:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/75 ti.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "You were already old and decrepit when I learned to howl at the moon, and now you're completely insane."


translate english event_battle_devend_fffb0292:


    "The owl and the bear were stupefied by that kind of disrespect."


translate english event_battle_devend_da76e3b5:


    "The Goat clicked his teeth, having no comeback for the rebel."


translate english event_battle_devend_f9d62c4b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/76 tv.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "You-grrr time is gone. The pack needs a new Master."


translate english event_battle_devend_85121f08:


    "The Goat bleated, shaking his horns. Words finally returned to him. But his voice was shaky."


translate english event_battle_devend_f6225e01:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/54 mo.ogg" 
    Master "My most loyal dog! How dare you?"


translate english event_battle_devend_43e6e022:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/55 sa.ogg" 
    Master "Most faithful of my cubs, don't you get it?"


translate english event_battle_devend_e8c91063:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/56 Ya.ogg"
    Master "I had to get rid of you!"


translate english event_battle_devend_db667b44:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/77 t.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "You killed my brother-grrr-s and siste-grrr-s. You disbanded the old pack."


translate english event_battle_devend_bc00a822:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/57 Ver.ogg" 
    Master "That's right. I killed my own flesh and blood, but who helped me do it?"


translate english event_battle_devend_8f353aa9:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/58 Ti.ogg" 
    Master "You, Kostya."


translate english event_battle_devend_9e89f190:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/59 En.ogg" 
    Master "Or they would've eaten me to jump up to the moon. You chose the right side."


translate english event_battle_devend_fee50207:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/60 Za.ogg"
    Master "For that, I gave you freedom."


translate english event_battle_devend_650df1dc:


    "The Goat traced his hand around Tikhonov and the silent woman."


translate english event_battle_devend_ed5f842a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/78 os.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "F-ggr-eedom? No, you bet-grrr-ayed us."


translate english event_battle_devend_3f9553db:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/79 s.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "I've suffered inside this meat cage for all these years…"


translate english event_battle_devend_7d770544:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/61 Ko.ogg" 
    Master "Kostya… "


translate english event_battle_devend_030aab55:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/80 za.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Shut up, old man. I'm talking."


translate english event_battle_devend_03db074d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/86 men.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Let's swap. Take my mask, and I'll take yours."


translate english event_battle_devend_e91d6108:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/87 Sim.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "The symbol of power. I will be the horned master of the hungry beasts."


translate english event_battle_devend_3dfef865:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/62 Mo.ogg"
    Master "Mine!!!"


translate english event_battle_devend_a8793bf6:


    "The leader's long fingers covered the goat mask, protecting it."


translate english event_battle_devend_b5f2c261:


    "The owl and the bear rushed to the Master's feet, ready to defend him with their lives."


translate english event_battle_devend_416de411:


    "The Bunny's hair bristled up, she bent down to the soil, and hissed threateningly at Tikhonov."


translate english event_battle_devend_40e45a68:


    "But he wasn't worried about the number of his enemies."


translate english event_battle_devend_1309cc35:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/88 Eto.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "We'll see about that, horned fool."


translate english event_battle_devend_406a9770:


    "Tikhonov, as if being controlled by his mask, moved toward the Goat."


translate english event_battle_devend_7576ddec:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/01 Sl.ogg"
    Master "What a lovely treat!"


translate english event_battle_devend_11a2ca8b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/82 derz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Fat chance, you freak!"


translate english event_battle_devend_8bd2df67:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/83 nehoce.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "If you don't want to do it the easy way…"


translate english event_battle_devend_bd0979bb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/84 naka.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Here! Eat this!"


translate english event_battle_devend_f36655a3:


    "The AK barked."


translate english event_battle_devend_2998538d:


    "A burst of bullets riddled the three in front of us with holes."


translate english event_battle_devend_ae7f05b4:


    "All of the bullets hit, but the beasts didn't even flinch."


translate english event_battle_devend_157c61c6:


    "Only feathers and shreds of fur swirled in the freezing air, joining the snowflakes."


translate english event_battle_devend_11b7457f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/02 Za.ogg"
    Master "Pathetic! Clinging to human toys like that!"


translate english event_battle_devend_29539fe6:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/03 M.ogg"
    Master "You were always meat, and you'll die like meat."


translate english event_battle_devend_e28185a6:



    voice "voice/Owl/39 Vi.ogg" 
    Owl "We'll peck out your entrails!"


translate english event_battle_devend_1d46d938:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/21 Bu.ogg"
    Bear "We'll chew without breaks!"


translate english event_battle_devend_a5be3341:


    "The goat clutched the flute with his fangs and started playing."


translate english event_battle_devend_bd2f2c1b:


    "He moved his long fingers over the holes, blowing out a sad, lonely tune."


translate english event_battle_devend_d3fd838f:


    "Answering its call, the brushes moved, and the stripes on burial wreaths shuddered."


translate english event_battle_devend_2caeeea0:


    "Snowflakes started floating upward."


translate english event_battle_devend_6a410fb9:


    "Ghostly phantoms were perched on the line of the grim burial grounds."


translate english event_battle_devend_1fd00a57:


    "Saliva dripped from the beasts' maws."


translate english event_battle_devend_33e85458:


    "Holes appeared in their hides, their jaws, full of crooked fangs, opened."


translate english event_battle_devend_cae75937:


    "Balls of maggots writhed deep inside their masks."


translate english event_battle_devend_d5d2602b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/85 tvo.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Your pack got thinned out, old man."


translate english event_battle_devend_9356bf95:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/86 chtoz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "Now! Let's see whose call the others will heed."


translate english event_battle_devend_1bc27e15:


    "He fell to his knees, and I backed toward the car when the lieutenant arched his back like a beast."


translate english event_battle_devend_0d7578c9:


    "Tikhonov raised his head toward the ashen skies and howled."


translate english event_battle_devend_555cb2f6:


    "A wave of sound crushed the trio in front of him."


translate english event_battle_devend_48a6f257:


    "The snowflakes sped up. A couple of crosses tilted."


translate english event_battle_devend_8ce288f6:


    "The flute's melody and the howl imitating it clashed like two spears."


translate english event_battle_devend_da80b7d0:


    "My hair stood on end, my skin tingled."


translate english event_battle_devend_fb55d16e:


    "The metal body of the UAZ bent under the horrifying force. Sparks flew from its hood."


translate english event_battle_devend_7f8ba105:


    "Two figures flew out from the darkness."


translate english event_battle_devend_1a1af40a:


    "For a second, I thought those were my friends, but then I made out the masks."


translate english event_battle_devend_94ef0a50:


    "Alisa and Wolfy."


translate english event_battle_devend_b2c941b1:


    "Instead of pouncing at me from behind and devouring me, those two rushed the Goat."


translate english event_battle_devend_4101c4b7:


    "I dove into the car and shut the door."


translate english event_battle_devend_9f7b9428:


    "Olya was crying, so I hugged her."


translate english event_battle_devend_1682cb92:


    "Her wet face pressed into my collarbone."


translate english event_battle_devend_6c17668b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/70 Tosh.ogg"
    Oly "Tosha, what will happen to us?"


translate english event_battle_devend_9b623352:


    "Judging by the loud sounds, a bloodbath was underway outside."


translate english event_battle_devend_1c8b16c4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/240.Nesm.ogg"
    Ant "Don't look! Close your eyes."


translate english event_battle_devend_e564d2d2:


    "She obeyed, but still shuddered in my embrace."


translate english event_battle_devend_89e0e8ab:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/72 Nes.ogg"
    Oly "I'm not looking! I'm not looking! I'm not looking!"


translate english event_battle_devend_1b515965:


    "The windows fogged up."


translate english event_battle_devend_813c2e21:


    "I could only see the shadows writhing outside."


translate english event_battle_devend_ed6a435b:


    "The night, and the massacre happening in it."


translate english event_battle_devend_a44416c1:


    "Scarlet drops sprinkled on the windshield."


translate english event_battle_devend_5016feb2:


    "I squeezed my fists so hard that my fingernails tore into my palms."


translate english event_battle_devend_4158fbc5:


    "Something heavy slammed against the car's hood. Paws flashed."


translate english event_battle_devend_08fc28b5:


    "I didn't want to look, but I also couldn't close my eyes."


translate english event_battle_devend_58dec55a:


    "And if I only saw bits and pieces of the fight, the sounds of it reached my ears in full—a few feet away from the UAZ hides cracked, and muscles tore."


translate english event_battle_devend_16b07c22:


    "A fuzzy shadow staggered along the side of the car."


translate english event_battle_devend_6ca42400:


    "An owl?"


translate english event_battle_devend_a49eebff:


    "A fox?"


translate english event_battle_devend_42bcae0f:


    "No, both!"


translate english event_battle_devend_2013f390:


    "They curled into a single ball of fur, a disgusting two-headed abomination that devoured itself."


translate english event_battle_devend_bf8a2447:


    "The fox put her sharp nose into the hole that formed in the owl's chest and was eating her entrails."


translate english event_battle_devend_6715a035:


    "There was some pinkish-white subcutaneous fat under the feathers, its disgusting layers cracking under the pressure from the fangs and oozing streaks of black blood."


translate english event_battle_devend_a709d406:


    "Before disappearing behind the right side of the car, the beasts tore at each other's necks."


translate english event_battle_devend_11fdbc4d:


    "A blueish windpipe wiggled from the owl's neck like a worm."


translate english event_battle_devend_ab8a4c8e:


    "A wet tube covered with fibers of torn-up meat."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_29bfafa5:


    "Olya pressed into me, her entire body trembling."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_bce9a712:


    "It was cold inside the car, but fear was the real reason we both shivered on the back seat."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_633b3ab9:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/37 Chto.ogg"
    Oly "What are they doing?"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_0cf9223e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/38 Gde.ogg"
    Oly "Where's Mommy?"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_c27c3868:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/282 m.ogg"
    Ant "Mommy will return soon."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_8af49310:


    "I hugged my sister and covered her eyes with my hand. Olya's trembling eyelashes tickled my palm."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_046fbc08:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/283 n.ogg"
    Ant "Don't look."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_b62883f2:


    "Windows of the police car were frosted over. I could only see blurry spots jumping around in the blizzard."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_ecfd09c0:


    "Somebody jumped over the engine compartment. Crawled under the car. Ran to the right of it."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_89ef4265:


    "One spot chasing another."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_e5450def:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/39 Dya.ogg"
    Oly "Will Mr. Officer save us?"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_7b6b14a2:


    "Actually, I wasn't sure."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_94cef492:


    "Part of me that was strangely composed and cunning knew that we couldn't rely on the adults."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_15dcbf8b:


    "I needed to act."


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_efbab70e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/05 tih.ogg"
    "{i}\"Tikhonov will lose,\"{/i} I thought. {i}\"He's weak.\"{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_db930af9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/06 kol.ogg"
    "{i}Magic can't be defeated by bullets. It can only be defeated by other magic.{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_7b4dfd6a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/07 mm.ogg"
    "{i}I had the mask under my vest since the moment I took it out of the monsters' paws.{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_c4a6dde4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/08 oni.ogg"
    "{i}They wanted me to become part of their pack, but that didn't matter right now.{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_efcb1ce2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/09 t.ogg"
    "{i}Only I can help my friends.{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_c0795bed:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/10 na.ogg"
    "{i}I need to hurry, before they become a pile of bones inside the treats sack…{/i}"


translate english event_final_battle_olyayes_70c7ca25:



