translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_d51b76ed:


    "Garlands of intestines dragged after him on the icy crust."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_44a1dea8:


    "They left a sticky trail, like a slime-oozing snail. Stomach acid sizzled on the snow."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b2aa532e:


