translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_5c9a0bf0:


    "In reply, Wolfy only flashed his fangs menacingly."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b748b657:


    "The bear poked the snow with his hind leg, pretending not to hear him."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0799fd97:


