translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0540f516:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/19 V.ogg"
    Master "Eternal hu—"


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_c3af88fd:


    "Tikhonov stuck his fingers in the Goat's back, interrupting his angry tirade."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_60116fc6:


    "He then picked up his shoulder blades from both sides and pulled them up, crushing them."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_1b97c599:


