translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b3f7f55d:


    Master "Ahhhh!"


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_f1451982:


    "The dying cry of the goat flew high above the graveyard."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_ce0ee61c:


    "Tikhonov yanked the vertebrae out of his back in one swoop."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_21418745:


    "It arched like a bridge braided with sticky stripes."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_3afd9189:


    "Goat's huge eyes faded. He perished among the ash and the snow."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e0c72ca7:


    "It was over."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0f04d7fd:


    "Were we finally saved?"


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e77e0279:


    "Contrary to everything that had happened to me before that moment, I was jubilant."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_24cd804f:


    "The evil was defeated."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_518b9b85:


    "Tikhonov ran his fingers over the bloodied face of his enemy."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_21abc6df:


    "He took the goat mask off the corpse and lifted it up toward the moon, as if presenting it to the beasts, to the forest, to darkness itself."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_9cc589d0:


    "Darkness replied with a choir of howls."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_cb3c881f:


    "The tears of joy stopped on my eyelashes."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_63b0bf58:


    "Tikhonov put on the mask."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_518c326d:


    "He pushed it into his face and spread his arms wide. It looked so natural on him now."


translate english event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e5310e55:


    "Horror pierced me like a bayonet."


