    voice "voice/Anton/5day/09 El.ogg"
    Ant_m "Or even later... Yes, much later."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_764334a4:


    "I was ready to run away, wherever my legs would take me."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_c9e16874:


    "So these horrifying images drawn by my feverish imagination would blur and be eventually erased from my memory."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_0a557a48:


    "But I also knew that I couldn't hide from this voice."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_9a7bf498:


    "Not in the thick taiga forest, chock full of ancient monsters."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_9bebae1d:


    "Not in the forest hut with barred-up windows."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_d0b297ad:


    "Not on the moon, where the endless midnight trail could lead me."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_e2f8b9bd:


    "The voice that pretended to be me oozed from the gaping hole of the bunny mask and escaped my lips at the same time."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_51992a0e:


