translate english event_slaughter_devend_a2f094e5:


    "I looked at the accursed mask once again, a realization of much I had to lose were I to stop being human slowly creeping up on me."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_cf304b54:


    "Olya, Mom, Dad."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_ef24d025:


    "Icy wind cut my skin, sending painful pulsing all over my body."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_7b28bda1:


