translate english event_slaughter_devend_f37f4aca:


    "A blob of darkness that enveloped the nearby treetops started crunching and shrinking to the size of a teenager."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_ed3f9c8a:


    "And in its writhing silhouette I started recognizing the image of a fox girl I knew."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_c077a46e:


    "At least that's how I remembered her on the day when we first met."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_fc97ab19:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Os.ogg" 
    Alis "And it's especially good when you don't need to dance to anyone's tune."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_2233aeb9:


    "I shifted my gaze from the blade of the axe in my hand to the sliced-up goat mask."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_609f9b43:


    "I stared at the stiffened body of the horned giant, and I couldn't tell if he was alive or dead."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_fa5f45b3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 Unas.ogg" 
    Alis "We don't have masters anymore!"


translate english event_slaughter_devend_2783d31d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/13 Azna.ogg" 
    Alis "And that means nobody will force us to bully someone..."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_0d8a1782:


    "Alisa hesitated, rolling the word on her tongue, as if trying to taste it."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_b5e90e42:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/14 Bez.ogg" 
    Alis "...defenslesess."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_5892de7e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/15 poroi.ogg" 
    Alis "Sometimes, people who deserve to become our prey come into our forest."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_d5ad9400:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/16 Chto.ogg" 
    Alis "After all, there are plenty of true monsters hiding among people."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_c1db79d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Hah.ogg"
    "She peeked out playfully from behind the mast of a century-old pine."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_88ec49e2:


    "The slits of a cunning mask sought me out in the darkness."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_69df29f1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/17 Mi.ogg" 
    Alis "We're the last from the pack, Bunny. You and me."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_b5a10812:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/18 Nam.ogg"
    Alis "We need to take care of each other."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_82bef09a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/19 Raz.ogg"
    Alis "Can't you see that?"


translate english event_slaughter_devend_fa4ebbbf:


    "Alisa took a step toward me and revealed the deep cuts on her hands that dripped with blood in the moonlight."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_77e6624c:


    "Scarlet blood bubbled up in the wounds left by sharp fangs and claws."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_441f3142:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/20 Poz.ogg" 
    Alis "Please, I need you!"


translate english event_slaughter_devend_cd243439:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/21 Mi.ogg" 
