translate english event_slaughter_devend_95d68d75:


    "My gaze turned toward the bunny mask again, which at this point looked like it was smiling."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_7cce07ce:


    "Then, as if on autopilot, I got a better grip of the axe under the intent gaze of the cunning fox."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_dcc2cd53:


    "I remembered Bunny's threats. Then Alisa's sweet promises, believing in which was total madness."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_c353c642:


    "I remembered Olya's warm light."


translate english event_slaughter_devend_e152dc0f:


    "And made my choice."


translate english event_final_break_1654edd1:


    "I proclaimed."


translate english event_final_break_58507004:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/255.Ti.ogg"
    Ant "You're not me!"


translate english event_final_break_3429ab0f:


    "Threw up the axe."


translate english event_final_break_63437bd6:


