translate english event_final_break_68eb7e1f:


    "The axe was left lodged between the halves of a horned skull."


translate english event_final_break_5fd4c01e:


    "The fox girl let out a heart-rending scream, like a banshee from Irish folk tales that foretold the oncoming death of their close ones."


translate english event_final_break_9fb0ba85:


    "And then, in one fell swoop, she leaped over the snow field and disappeared among the dead trees, bawling."


translate english event_final_break_37010e0b:


    "Her cries were forever engraved in my memory."


translate english event_final_break_cf18397c:


    "There was no way I'd forget something that scared me so much but also elicited genuine empathy at the same time."


translate english event_final_break_6927e9b5:


