translate english event_final_break_8e875bd2:


    "I thought about my dead friend under the grave cross."


translate english event_final_break_f4626c41:


    "A single tear rolled down my cheek and landed on top of Olya's head."


translate english event_final_break_a35e5ab0:


    "A pair of lights cut through the night."


translate english event_final_break_392694cf:


    "I walked forward, with no idea what was waiting for me there."


