translate english event_final_break_68eccccb:


    "I looked at my own reflection in the mirror while we rushed into the unknown."


translate english event_final_break_60364772:


    "The forest creaked, whispered, shared the news of the demise of its masters."


translate english event_final_break_dfb34bba:


    "The house disappeared around the corner."


translate english event_final_break_417e0aa1:


    "I wiped my sooty face."


translate english event_final_break_b6f6f3f9:


    "A pink line drew the horizon in front of us."


translate english event_final_break_3a9ac673:


    "I hoped for an imminent sunrise."


translate english event_final_break_a112f77e:


    "I wanted to believe in it."


translate english event_final_break_f7c18f84:


