translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_12f9221b:


    "It felt like I was looking at the horrific feast of beast cubs through the gaps between the boards."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_24391435:


    "My parents told me that Anton was at fault there. He didn't listen to them, went outside, and got lost in the snowstorm."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_53472422:


    "But I knew."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_616c9a6f:


    "Somewhere far away, in the village, a certain house squeaked in sorrow."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1da706c9:


    "It didn't change even after all those years."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_72f8f291:


    "The web of shadows in the corners, the rustling attic, and an eternal palisade of the taiga outside."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_502b728c:


    "Internet connection and cellphone coverage were both unstable there, unlike the fog."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_b64f4b0d:


    "I stepped into the kids' room."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_ccc7aa18:


    "Little Anton, named after his late uncle, moaned in his crib."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_f17f136e:


    "I felt milk rush to my nipples."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_d6aec267:


    "Followed by a feeling of oppressive anxiousness."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_10af9b57:


    "Hungry beasts were dancing in a circle in front of my eyes."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6a826683:


