translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_d81f09c7:


    "I got close to the crib and looked inside."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1ca1433c:


    "My son waved his tiny fists in the air. There was an old, mole-eaten mask on his chest."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a9291031:


    "I gazed into the empty cavities of its eyeholes."


translate english d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_0ff7df0b:


    "Darkness itself stared back at me."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_7e7eea8b:


