translate english d5_ending_home_violence_ab807a4b:


    "The wooden box at the edge of the forest stopped pretending to be a house, a place of shelter."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_cd3ac5ff:


    "It became a trap with barred windows."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_e1b23567:


