translate english d5_ending_home_violence_439dd406:


    "Crooked fingers appeared from the crevices."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_086226ec:


    "Olya squealed, but I couldn't help her."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_6bb6dbdd:


    "Our embrace felt unbearable now."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_b675c57a:


    "I looked up, blinked away the tears of desperation."


translate english d5_ending_home_violence_5788e734:


