translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_039e84b3:


    "They broke in to devour Olya's flesh."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9a78b265:


    "I turned around to face the monstrocities of the ancient forest, and then yelled at the figures that appeared in the doorway."


