translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3f743e78:


    "I dropped the axe and slid my hand across my face, smearing Polina's blood all over it."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_660b2709:


    "I dropped the axe and slid my hand across my face, smearing my buddy's blood all over it."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b8ccc8d6:


    "I dropped the axe and slid my hand across my face, smearing my sister's blood all over it."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e9ceeede:



