translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e239d5d0:


    "Snow drifted outside, forming the silhouettes of horrific giants."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fe9a14ad:


    "I didn't resist as they took me away."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b620978a:


    "I vaguely remember how the handcuffs wouldn't stay on my wrists since my hands were too small. The cold bracelets kept slipping off."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e08b4341:


    "Why go through the hassle anyway?"


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_cbe8b301:


    "It's not like I would've tried to escape into the thickets, into the paws of those cannibals."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ffc9e8a2:


    "They stuffed me into the back seat of a police car."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_db2d2eb5:


    "I threw one last glance at my house."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_dd3ea42a:


    "The blizzard embraced it with giant wings of a polar owl."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_398d2f24:


    "Polina stood in the doorway, unmoving, staring at me with wet eyes as the police dragged me away."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c4424fd4:


    "How can't she understand I just saved her life?!"


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_075917aa:


    "Polina and Romka stood in the doorway, unmoving, staring at me as the police dragged me away."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_dab225ea:


    "How can't they understand I just saved their lives?!"


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_13688e1d:


    "Romka stood in the doorway, unmoving, staring at me with angry eyes as the police dragged me away."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7ece7aed:


    "The officer carried Olya, wrapped in the blanket, outside."


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_4768735e:


    "How can't they understand I just saved their lives?!"


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b88e77bb:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/133.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "Where are my parents?"


translate english d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_f7c27643:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/06 ob.ogg"
