translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4dcd2b2f:


    "We held Byasha by the elbows and escorted him to the back seat."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_28566fa4:


    "Spastic smiles twisted our faces, reflected in the windows."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d10a8930:


    "Defenseless Byasha snuck glances at the hospital where he had spent most of his life."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fc7b8195:


    "His childhood was over, but not the nightmare that dominated the taiga village. People still went missing here."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_86bb78f5:


