    Bya "I'm j-j-just a…"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0422df14:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/60r.ogg"
    Bya "Kid…"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_125f7dfe:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/44 Zn.ogg"
    Ant "Well, then you gotta go there."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf2c7be7:


    "I pointed at the thickening darkness."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d13ff8f2:


    "The Black Garage was nestled among the trees. A disgusting black coffin. A meat grinder that traveled the realms."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27d5d072:


    "It wandered the area blindly all this time, looking for Byasha, the little boy who ruined the ritual, the boy who didn't knock on its door."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_07885443:


    "How else did it end up in the middle of a thick forest? Could someone abandon him there during the {u}\"Wild nineties\"{/u}?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4cedd191:


    "Could they just forget about its existence, incidentally turning him into a village legend…"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_754710d5:


    "For a second, that thought seemed scarily plausible. Nasty doubts gripped me once again. Thankfully, a scream distracted me."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a6ca1069:


    "Byasha squealed."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a8c28cd:


    "I slapped him across the face with the back of my hand to keep him down."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3c320a20:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/46 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Polina, fuel!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_10c1ab01:


    "She took a canister out of the trunk."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_42618da4:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/47 Pot.ogg"
    Ant "Hurry!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd44b951:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/269 b.ogg" 
    Pol "Is this really necessary?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e1624288:


    "She stared at the helpless Byasha, distressed."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_80c82bdc:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/48 M.ogg"
    Ant "We've been over this so many times."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e5d79d2d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/270 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "I know… But… "


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1533e9aa:


    "I could almost read her mind. \"Are we making a mistake?\". That was the question that consumed her."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f5dc20d5:


    "\"Did we come to the forest, obsessed with nonsense, to kill an innocent man?\""


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27cbce18:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/49 Me.ogg"
    Ant "We're oathbound."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_69a64a03:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/50 Vih.ogg"
    Ant "There's no other way."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c4c553b7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/51 Po.ogg"
    Ant "Look there."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2090a44d:


    "I pointed at the thicket."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_05c63c9c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/52 On.ogg"
    Ant "He's watching us."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_dcadb559:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/53 Onp.ogg"
    Ant "He's beautiful and unbearable at the same time."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_94c56bd8:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/54 On.ogg"
    Ant "He's the most unnatural thing you've ever seen."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3eb119a5:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/55 Es.ogg"
    Ant "Warped space, darkness of the infinitely distant planets, and the light of dying suns."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_99145aad:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/56 Pe.ogg"
    Ant "The ashes of universes!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3bdb50f4:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/57 On.ogg"
    Ant "He's everything and nothing."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_72d1ebe2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/271 V.ogg"
    Pol "Everything and nothing…"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b3216024:


    "My partner was talking as if she were in a trance."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4fbd69b8:


    "I continued, full of raging joy, as I waved my hands frantically toward the squeaky trees."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b9b871d1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/58 Uz.ogg"
    Ant "Termbe in fear as you gaze upon its grandiose and horrifying figure!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8c5578e5:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/59 Z.ogg"
    Ant "Golden light envelopes it!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_74ffd3ed:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/60 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "But don't look too long or you'll go blind!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_edf35063:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/61 On.ogg"
    Ant "It has the form of a woman, but it has nothing to do with women or men."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a2e54f46:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/62 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "Neither with good, nor with evil."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32071982:


    "I waved the cross around, tracing chaotic figures in the air."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_00694a36:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/63 St.ogg"
    Ant "It's as foreign to all the living as taiga or the stars in the icy darkness."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7479bbaf:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/64 E.ogg"
    Ant "And this destructive power is on our side!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_584a1947:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/272 A.ogg"
    Pol "And the gasoline is… our holy water."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1ad03a4e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/65 Bl.ogg"
    Ant "That is blessed by it."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cd8316f3:


    "I wiped the drool from my chin."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8a75ecf8:


    "Polina nodded slowly and unscrewed the cap."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_23495902:


    "I took the canister from her and poured its contents on Byasha's head."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1e8f4b9e:


    "He screamed as he scratched his own cheeks."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_be9a3cd8:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/65bee.ogg"
    Bya "Baaaaa…"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_55e1fe63:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/66ber.ogg"
    Bya "Be-be-beware of the b-b-black ga-ga-garage!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e6c2cfa3:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/67ya.ogg"
    Bya "I w-w-was inside, eh!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e6efb36:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/68ta.ogg"
    Bya "There are n-n-no demons there!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd7427fc:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/69tam.ogg"
    Bya "It's a serial k-k-killer's lair with d-d-dead children, eh!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e573bec0:


    "I showed him a sad smile."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d609acae:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/66 te.ogg"
    Ant "You are the serial killer now."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_59787da7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/66 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "You became what you feared."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d1497ab7:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/70m.ogg"
    Bya "A k-k-killer?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32210654:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/71a.ogg"
    Bya "Who are you, then?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b74a64d3:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/72ne.ogg"
    Bya "Didn't you k-k-kidnap and brough another p-p-person to the forest?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b8604c93:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/68 T.ogg"
    Ant "You can't fool me, demon!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2e6e5b19:


    "Byasha tried to escape, but I grabbed him and dragged him toward the black cottage."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5756d07c:


    "The door opened without my help. Or the wind simply threw the rusty metal leaf open."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_51274783:


    "I don't care. We'll do what our fate dictates."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_92a980ff:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/75ma.ogg"
    Bya "M-m-mommy! S-s-save me!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1746e730:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/76ya.ogg"
    Bya "I want to go to M-m-mommy!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e1f7824d:


    "Polina, who took the second canister out of the trunk, squeezed her eyes shut. Her hands were shaking."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_96ce63bf:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/77v.ogg"
    Bya "T-t-take me -b-b-back to the hospital, eh!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ca1a9bfd:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/78ne.ogg"
    Bya "No! I w-w-want to go home!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8d224019:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/70 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "I will fear no evil!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_026e868e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/79s.ogg"
    Bya "I'm scared, Mommy!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cca5be34:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/71 T.ogg"
    Ant "For thou art with me; thy rod and thy staff they comfort me!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf813931:


    "Polina burst out crying as she watched me drag the heart-rendingly bleating and wriggling Byasha."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_de44464e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/80b.ogg"
    Bya "G-g-god help me!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e3c129f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/72 K.ogg"
    Ant "What god are you praying to, demon?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_59ba6332:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/121 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Watch, Polina! "


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c49ffbbc:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/122 Smotry.ogg"
    Ant "Don't cry, watch the demon perish!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b49d1a79:


    "She regained her composure."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a74b873:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/274 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Yes. Right, I'm with you."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d782fbd0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/74 M.ogg"
    Ant "Pusillanimity is a path to Hell."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf5dc4fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/275 V.ogg" 
    Pol "To eternal torment."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8443d4c7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/75 Am.ogg"
    Ant "Amen."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_807bb854:


    "I threw Byasha into the garage."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_840d3777:


    "The flute and the scattered masks were left in the snow—faces of the new generation of beasts."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8cf9170a:


    "Polina picked them up and threw them into the dark doorway."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa0ea41b:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/82 po.ogg"
    Bya "Spare me, eh!!!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7d651c54:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/83e.ogg"
    Bya "It's me, Byaaaasha!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9d104228:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/84ya.ogg"
    Bya "I'm very s-s-sick, eh!"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f80792ee:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/77 E.ogg"
    Ant "O Lord, bring salvation upon him."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fa157c60:


    "I took the second canister from Polina and poured gasoline all over the garage."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0eaa1052:


    "With every cell of my body, I felt the protection of the celestial being. Polina felt it, too."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_62c19461:


    "We threw our burning matches into the puddle at the same time."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5bb77728:


    "Flames engulfed the garage in seconds. The Protector, with our hands, was turning our mortal enemy into ash."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa5359f4:


    "Byasha screamed in agony among the fire."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_68dc08b1:


    "Polina shuddered from his desperate scream, and her hand reached instinctively toward the red-hot metal of the door."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_684582ea:


    "I grabbed her arm and reminded her with a direct look in her eyes."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_97329f96:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/78 B.ogg"
    Ant "Byasha is long dead. He can't be saved. He doesn't want to."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_43d59857:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/79 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "You know what those shapeshifting animals can do."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3253651d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/277 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "Yes, I know."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_85d2a54a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/278 Du.ogg" 
    Pol "Do you really think Byasha...?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0af05e2a:


    "Her voice trailed off."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_45e50e21:


    "Byasha started bleating in the oven that the garage became."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f3c91bba:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/80 e.ogg"
    Ant "A devil is dying there."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5fde9973:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/81 Ag.ogg"
    Ant "Can you hear the agony?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6f527339:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/279 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Yes. He's clinging to life."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c6205ea0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/82 No.ogg"
    Ant "The Protector won't let him get out."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0ca4d735:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/280 A.ogg" 
    Pol "The Angel behind our backs."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aba10499:


    "Determination returned to my partner. I was also filled with the devil-crushing faith."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9b07250e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/83 Li.ogg"
    Ant "His face is inscrutable and proud. The light of his eyes is even stronger."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_378b3ea8:


    "I felt Polina's hand grab my own, so I clutched my fingers as hard as I could."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_447226db:


    "We stood in front of a huge fire, our shadows melting the snow."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1592cc02:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/281 Mir.ogg"
    Pol "The world is saved. The devourers are no more."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6292c63c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/84 M.ogg"
    Ant "We did the right thing."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ba4311d9:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/85 X.ogg"
    Ant "The Protector promised us oblivion."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd24965e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/282 A.ogg" 
    Pol "So will we..."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3bc56b09:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/283 M.ogg" 
    Pol "Will we forget… everything? Will we forget each other, too?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2225a88f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/86 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm not losing you."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b0e65639:


    "The garage's doorway deformed as it belched out flames, ash, and screams that were becoming weaker and weaker."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a771660f:


    "Its walls and roof were folding."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3156b4f5:


    "When I dared to turn around, the giant figure among the trees disappeared."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4b59b99b:


    "Just like the kids from the cursed village."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_400bc189:


    "Just like the goat that pretended to be Byasha."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bb9caa40:


    "Just like our memories of what happened were about to disappear."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cca847e6:


    "The screaming stopped."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d8c5ff4c:


    "I looked into the fire and bit my lower lip so hard it bled. Because a question popped up in my head among the ringing silence."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b293166e:


    "Could it be that I'm so deranged that I infected Polina with my own madness?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_505768b8:


    "Was there ever an Angel?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_547a2985:


    "Or was there only a boy with a scary illness that stopped taking his meds?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7a581459:


    "And that's when the beast started talking to him."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_467cd620:


    "Not a forest one. One from the depths of his agonized mind."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e17131b5:


    "Am I a schizo? I'm mentally ill… where are my angels?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32b97c80:


    "What have we done?"


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2e61c4da:


    "It felt like a localized explosion in my head or something similar. When I opened my eyes, I realized I lay on the snow a couple of feet away from a woman I didn't know."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_007fd5b5:


    "The pines towered over us, reaching toward the blue sky. We were surrounded by the thicket, but it didn't look scary."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b618e9f6:


    "The fact that I didn't know how I got here didn't cause me any distress."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_11508d0b:


    "The only thing that concerned me was whether the woman was alive. But then she moved and opened her eyes."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e1a5a34:


    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 pr1.ogg" 


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c9268efb:


    "I've never seen such magical eyes. Such a beautiful face."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_37274059:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 pr3.ogg" 
    "She stared at me in surprise."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5d9e05a8:


    "Following a sudden impulse, I outstretched my hand, and the woman, even though she hesitated for a moment, did the same."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d8663afe:


    "Our fingers touched. I smiled at the warmth that spread through my body."


translate english d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6ccc6a6d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 p4.ogg" 
    "The woman smiled back at me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_dfabe4aa:


    "The axe traced an arch through the air and slammed into the ground near the mask."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_36a15e2f:


    "That strike slashed the backbone of my past."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c42c1f00:


    "I fooled myself for too long."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7d2daaaa:


    "I ran from my own shadow."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6d03e973:


    "My stubbornness almost killed Olya and probably killed my parents."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_f9ead611:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 A.ogg"
    Ant_m "Alisa was right—among humans, there are beasts that deserve the worst possible fate..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_14b3fd52:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 U.ogg"
    Ant_m "And that fate is meeting someone like us in the forest..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_cbbf40e8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/13 E.ogg"
    Ant_m "No stupid chants from hags in coffins will protect them."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_eb3b5749:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/14 Eh.ogg"
    Ant_m "My Dad's god won't save them, either."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ac056344:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/15 Z.ogg"
    Ant_m "The only god here is the pack."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_cd01e4d8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/16 E.ogg"
    Ant_m "And I'm a part of it."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_b85773ce:


    "I reached for the mask with my numbing fingers."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_0ac8eea9:


    "That's right..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_3dd006f2:


    "My fingers touched the immeasurably ancient shell."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_abd9f451:


    "It was more ancient than the pines that grew from the ashes of worlds."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_3ca3e569:


    "It was more ancient than the creatures that writhed in the burial ravines."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_5588ee3f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/46 ho.ogg"
    Ant_m "Good..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_12b30aed:


    "Through the slits in the long-eared face, I saw two blurry Alisas, and I didn't even have time to say goodbye to my previous life."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_be1e83c9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 poc A.ogg" 
    Alis "Feel it."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c1b57016:


    "The mask touched my skin."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_57bc45bd:


    "It felt like I submerged my face in boiling water, but it felt pleasant somehow..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6d310c73:


    Ant_m "The smell of soil filled my entire being."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c7b23af7:


    Ant_m "I saw a trail of bunny footprints in the snowy field: a dotted line that led toward the forest."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7995d572:


    Ant_m "I saw the roots that constantly moved, intertwined, growing out of my trembling heart."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_136119c5:


    Ant_m "I saw the black branches that reminded me of a ladder that led to the moon that hung up in the raging skies."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9545e3f8:


    Ant_m "Snowflakes melted on my hide."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9ecd0492:


    Ant_m "My undercoat was full of fleas, and I wanted to scratch myself with my hind leg."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a0fa9aea:


    "I forced myself to think about my sister."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_165f1b0d:


    Ant_m "About the wind that wandered inside the tree hollows."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ffa20d50:


    Ant_m "About the eventual linting when the old me will peel off with the patches of dirty fur."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7532c8b5:


    Ant_m "About the sweet berries in the dark, that I could grab from the branches with my lips."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_2c1b58eb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/02 Ya.ogg" 
    Alis "I knew you'd look good in it. You put it off for so long, Antosha."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c09db700:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/18 A.ogg"
    Ant_m "Antosha..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_4caf6cef:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Ch.ogg"
