translate english d5_ending_recipe_30dd403c:


    "I answered that call with every muscle in my body."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_4da91bcb:


    "I was a Tetris piece that couldn't be stopped, only rotated and guided into a pile of previously placed pieces."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c829e7f0:


