translate english d5_ending_recipe_1194cc08:


    "Orange car lights that looked like owl eyes, floated out from the darkness."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_06443d6f:


    "Alisa and I stood shoulder-to-shoulder in the rousing twilight and watched as Dad's BMW took a sudden turn toward the side of the road and screeched to a halt before the little girl on the asphalt."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ca58569f:


    "Joy and grief mixed inside me when I saw Dad jumping out of the car."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_1e67fb69:


    "He was alive, but forever lost for me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_39a44278:


