translate english d5_ending_recipe_c60cdb48:


    "As Dad picked Olya up, his anxious gaze stopped on the wall of pines on our side of the road."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_39f4d888:


    "Right on me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_cd9f294c:


    "I could smell his desperation, his stupefaction."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_175f6658:


    "I knew he couldn't see me."


