translate english d5_ending_recipe_743665f3:


    "The fire feasted on the past, and its flames licked the low skies with their giant red tongues."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_58db7d27:


    "I looked at Alisa, intercepted her intense stare."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6f61bd34:


