translate english d5_ending_recipe_bed82e8d:


    "I saw the fire in her and sensed molten geysers rise inside of me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_69aecfb0:


    "I had never seen anything more beautiful than this masked girl."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d6bb4e2f:


    "\"This is absolute freedom,\" I thought. \"This entire forest is only for the two of us. Everything else burned down\"."


