    "His Adam's apple moved up and down."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_f84ec65d:


    "I wiped off my chin after I realized saliva was dripping down from it."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7e6cf931:



    voice "voice/killer/08 Sh.ogg"
    Killer "I tailed him, Count. Multiple times, from school to home, but all of his tracks would be gone, almost as if beasts covered them. You hear me?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_22a3c076:


    "I hear you..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_1c7f458b:



    voice "voice/killer/09 T.ogg"
    Killer "You there?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_137d89a8:


    "I'm here, my edible, my cornered, my meatball."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_178e3761:


    "Your heart is pounding, pumping your blood inside your arteries."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c08f2a80:


    "I imagined that ball, beating in his chest, and I wanted to press my lips against its ventricles, atria, and whatever else it consisted of, that red heart, just like in biology books."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8c1d1845:


    "Like in cooking books, written for monsters."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c179ff76:


    "Harelip guy was within reach. I would jump and tear into his clothes."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c7dbc10e:


    "His skin."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_14e9853e:


    "His muscles."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_f94e05b3:


    "But I tamed my emotions and slowly walked into the clearing."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_df9f3b8d:


    "Darkness had completely enveloped us, but he saw me thanks to the moon shining in the sky over the glade."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_aac64b79:


    "Monsters have sharp eyes, and he was a monster, but not because of his harelip."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_fab78b4f:



    voice "voice/killer/10 Po.ogg"
    Killer "Wait a minute, Count. Something came up. I'll call you back."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_59aa45cc:


    "His surprised gaze stuck to me, and he slid the phone in his pocket."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c66cd1a2:


    "Then slowly bent down toward the bag and fished in its innards."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_bf5247be:


    "He acted like I was some sort of forest critter he didn't want to scare off."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_b492240d:



    voice "voice/killer/11 Nu.ogg"
    Killer "Well, hello there. What's up with this masquerade, huh?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_df6ca9b3:


    "His hand slipped out of the bag and quickly hid behind his back."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6f61e9f3:


    "That big, stupid human thought that his weapon would scare me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_35b64420:


    "I just stood there, my eyes downcast, all innocent, and looked up at him as he got closer."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d3bc80c6:



    voice "voice/killer/12 Ch.ogg"
    Killer "What are you doing in the forest at this hour? Are you alone? Do I know you?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7192d9b9:


    "A red tail flashed in the brushes behind his bulky figure."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_808eb978:


    "I bit on my cheeks from the inside to stop myself from laughing."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a94cd036:


    "There was a tinge of worry in the killer's voice."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d7fb2772:



    voice "voice/killer/13 Za.ogg"
    Killer "Why do you need this mask? You're Petrov's son, right? No?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d04f385a:


    "His free hand reached out toward me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_aa2dc2c7:


    "Froze in the air."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_73c07467:


    "Continued on its path toward my screeching jaws."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_f60e6491:


    "I let his fingers touch my true face."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_b63b1dac:


    "I wasn't afraid anymore."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_3a74759b:



    voice "voice/killer/14Ya.ogg"
    Killer "Let me take a..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9d0f16db:


    "\"Look\" drowned in the crunching of his bones."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_cc83b311:


    "The killer yanked his hand back and held it up to his eyes."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9de66cc6:


    "His wrist was painted scarlet, with the blood that quickly drenched his sleeve."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8593e971:


    "Harelip guy was stunned as he stared at the stumps left in place of his fingers."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_59a0be1b:


    "I chewed in a hurry, enjoying the delicacy I've never tried before."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_662ab957:


    "Monster meat... And even though it wasn't tender, my strong molars made quick work of the skin, the bones, and the gristle."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_dc8c855e:



    voice "voice/killer/17 Su.ogg"
    Killer "Fuuuuuuuuck!!!"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6022519f:


    "I was amazed at how tasty he was for being such a nasty guy."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_18540635:


    "I didn't even notice how he aimed the gun at my forehead with his intact hand."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8254b299:


    "Alisa jumped out of the shadows and hung on to the screaming man."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c329c1f0:


    "His legs gave way."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d3e7e640:


    "I watched from the sidelines as two masked creatures, two beautiful hungry beasts, rushed toward the fumbling body and started tearing it apart with their snow-white fangs."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_4c743f97:


    "Like piranhas, they peeled off the muscles from his bones, chewed down on his sinews."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_4e4d492b:


    "The killer hit them with his intact fist, but they didn't feel pain."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_dd2102d5:


    "He tried to run, but his foot in an untied boot got left in the clearing."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a0fe64b9:


    "Threads of skin stretched from his foot to his leg."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_08f3f6bc:


    "The killer fell face-first into the bloody mush, turned to his back, and stared at the crimson masks of the predators with crazy eyes."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_718cdb9a:


    "He mumbled something, but it took me some time to make out the words."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_31934797:



    voice "voice/killer/21 Go.ogg"
    Killer "Rescue me, Lord, from evil people."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8a339b87:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/28 kak.ogg" 
    Alis "Will he rescue him?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_dbe4763a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/30 Se.ogg"
    Ant "We're about to find out."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9e56dc91:


    "We raised our faces toward the sky, as if waiting for a lightning that would come down on us as the divine punishment for our sins, but there was no god in the sky, just a pernicious pagan moon."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_eb412f18:


    "The killer wept, covering himself with what was left of his wrists."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_777f19ae:



    voice "voice/killer/22 Si.ogg"
    Killer "By the power of Thy grace, turn away and re-re-remove all evils acting at the instigation of the devil."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_0da5aa0f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/29 Ant.ogg" 
    Alis "Are you acting at the instigation of the devil, Anton?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8b0d22b7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/31Vr.ogg"
    Ant "I don't think so. You?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ed8180ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/30 Ne.ogg" 
    Alis "Not really."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_4534dbd3:



    voice "voice/killer/23 Go.ogg"
    Killer "God, hear my prayers..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c495cb55:


    "I leaned in to engrave in my mind the grimace of fear on his magled face."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_501920e6:


    "That was cooler than Disneyland."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8c542927:


    "This was our own Disneyland of pain, here, in the hungering darkness."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_353646a0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/307 Nikto.ogg"
    Ant "Nobody will hear you. But you will listen to me. I'm the god here. This is our forest, and we're its orderlies."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d0ecfe88:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/308 Teo.ogg"
    Ant "You can stop praying now. Just keep on screaming."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_e1f93379:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/Rik.ogg"
    "And scream he did, until he no longer had his vocal cords."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c1e0e132:


    "Snow melted from the bounteous amounts of hot nectar."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_36ba114c:


    "Masked beasts ate human flesh, scooped out innards, and played with their food before shoving the juicy bits into their open maws."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a306d257:


    "And then I completely merged with one of the feasting creatures."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_74fd91ce:


    "Yes, it was I who pulled out a muscly heart from the mess of broken ribs and communed with its sweetness in the name of the pack, in the name of the dark, in the name of the intoxicating freedom."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_aa9da346:


    "Alisa squealed from happiness, and we danced in blood, in the patches of skin, under the moon, full like a belly stuffed with meat."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_2f1fe2af:


    "We danced on the bones and jumped up to the sky."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_2c6fd955:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/34 Alis.ogg"
    Ant "Alisa..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_c8c405cd:


    "She stopped and looked at me with her bottomless eyes in which I loved to drown so much."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_989d08d2:


    "I wanted to draw her— wild, unstoppable, perfect, but I couldn't remember how to hold a pen."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_5abf2789:


    "I struggled with my vocal apparatus, too. I had to cough up a ball of fur first and switch my attention to my side and bite it a couple of times to chase away the annoying fleas."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_53c318ab:


    "My mind was like outer space, in which names would flash from time to time."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ba4df2c2:


    "I could still remember Olya, but who were Vova, Senechka, Katya, and Roma?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d745fa72:


    "Did I have a friend called Semyon?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7affe669:


    "Or was that the name of my dad?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a467d2cf:


    "I traced my animal face with my paw."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_5e159e4c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/32 Chto.ogg" 
    Alis "Is there something gnawing at you, darling?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d0861d3a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/35 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm scared I'll forget..."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_be4e7b6d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/33 Zab.ogg" 
    Alis "You'll forget?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_32870fa3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/36 Yab.ogg"
    Ant "I'm scared that come spring I'll turn into an animal and will no longer be myself."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a3e8bf52:


    "She reached out to me and rubbed my cheek with her fingers."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_e94ac3e2:


    "There was so much compassion in her act that I couldn't stop myself from covering her wrist with mine and pressing it even harder into my flaming hot face."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7e1e21ad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/34 Ra.ogg" 
    Alis "Can that really be forgotten? How could we forget things that happened between us?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_08dc4d13:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/37 Zv.ogg"
    Ant "Do animals remember?"


translate english d5_ending_recipe_2913e35f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/35 Wes.ogg" 
    Alis "Come spring or scorching summer. Come autumn or harsh winter. In their lairs and on the hunt. While drinking water or during linting. I'll be with you."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_e1954b1d:


    "I dreamed for her touch and her gaze to last forever."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6f17e7dc:


    "But she pulled away her hand."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_1d0cb8f2:


    "I knew what to do."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ba498972:


    "That knowledge lived inside me, and the foreign voices, on the other hand, were gone."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_42b734b2:


    "Either my inner bunny went into hibernation, or we did become one, after all, both on the outside and on the inside."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ac39ebf8:


    Narr_color "Many moons have passed before the air was filled with the smells of spring."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8eee68c5:


    Narr_color "A terrifying summer that our changed bodies will have a much harder time enduring was creeping closer."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_487ce10e:


    Narr_color "We needed to shapeshift, to shed our old skin and wait out the heat in the shade of the ancient forest."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_ff32acd0:


    Narr_color "Alisa and I turned our backs toward each other."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d869fba4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/36 Ver.ogg"
    Alis_Color "You need to believe."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_e2197341:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/38 Yave.ogg"
    Bunny_Color "I do."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_6b9c6a70:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/37 Edi.ogg" 
    Alis_Color "Go and be yourself."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_d317dd91:


    Narr_color "We both took a step away from each other, at the same time, toward the nascent light of the unknown day."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_147d77cd:


    Narr_color "Our feet slipped out of our shoes, and our socks slid down—we stepped onto the snow with our bare heels, but it was a pleasant feeling, to rid oneself from the shackles of civilization."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_93c85e7d:


    Narr_color "A beastly shadow fell on the ground in front of me."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_9a8a07c7:


    Narr_color "In its amazing silhouette, I saw black gaps and tenderly green grass, stretching from the soil toward the sun."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_12083adc:


    Narr_color "The shadow moved its ears. I heard the ringing of pitter-patter and the singing of birds, returning from their travels."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_83a6b08d:


    Narr_color "The shadow sniffed around, my nostrils filling with the aroma of fresh berries on the faraway glades, the smell of snowdrops and pine needles."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_fdb67e42:


    Narr_color "I knew that Alisa was studying her own shadow behind me, and her shadow was probably flapping its fluffy tail in anticipation."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_acc9a9fb:


    Narr_color "One more step, and I slipped out of my clothes, shedding them like old skin."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_41d591f7:


    Narr_color "I fell to all fours."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_bab0f5c9:


    Narr_color "I ran toward the light that beckoned me, but stopped at the edge of the clearing and turned around."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_60a033f3:


    Narr_color "Alisa also looked at me over her shoulder."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_43cd0f27:


    Narr_color "Our eyes met under the permanently changing skies in the endless forest."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_a3cabe49:


    Narr_color "Before running off into the thicket, I asked her in my mind."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_7868d68b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/Smogu.ogg"
    Narr_color "\"Will I know it's you if I see you again?\""


translate english d5_ending_recipe_48574272:


    Narr_color "And then I realized there was no force in the world that could make us forget."


translate english d5_ending_recipe_8b46dcef:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/38 E.ogg" 
    Alis_Color "And remember: you're safe as long as you're with me."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_30cbf838:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/309 m.ogg"
    Ant "Ashes to ashes, dust to dust!"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_d17072eb:


    "A ringing silence fell on our surroundings."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_b3bdca93:


    "I looked at the cross in my numb fingers. It seemed like the metal became even blacker."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_aa5b4d0d:


    "Blackness streamed from it as thick smoke. It enveloped my wrist, scalding it with coldness, and ran up my arm."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_a9927c05:


    "Darkness invaded me. Or, on the contrary, I was teleported into the cosmic abyss."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_5615f159:


    "Then, disrupting the absolute darkness, stars started flashing around me."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1a0bb70b:


    "It felt like they kept me afloat, weightless at the edge of reality."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_19fd7bc9:


    "Suppressing and slowly eating away at my mind and willpower with unearthly fear, the luminaries bunched up."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f43f7f31:


    "I then realized those were eyes."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_a6bcdebf:


    "The Maker of universes looked at me through the thin veil between the worlds."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_ddfee57f:


    "It was so huge my brain refused to register its size."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_255bf620:


    "Loneliness and desperation incarnate, the one who works in mysterious ways in the never-ending night."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_7c508b6e:


    "I gasped as I returned to my body, to the forest, to the scared Polina."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_34eb30de:


    "My heart was thumping. The feeling of desperation made my blood run cold."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f0264f94:


    "I turned my gaze toward the pinetops."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_44b90f25:


    "And then something gigantic fell from the sky, breaking trees and forming a smoking crater in the middle of the forest."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1d799bf5:


    "The snow, the frozen soil, branches, and blocks of ice flew all over the place, covering us."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_ac8533ca:


    "The branches that lay on top were burning."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c5413234:


    "They rained down ash on the hole that was littered with fallen trees."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_5f3bdacd:


    "Polina broke out of the snow with great difficulty and crawled toward me. Our fingers interlocked."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_eb88cc92:


    "Heat emanated from the creature that started wriggling in the crater. Along with blinding light."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_8dc246c4:


    "The unearthly creature was indescribable and unspeakable."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c1053451:


    "Millennia ago, it might have driven mad bare-footed apostles and fanatics wandering the deserts alike."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f3d51ff6:


    "I couldn't help but shudder looking at it."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_4d8e78e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/207 ch.ogg" 
    Pol "W-what's going on?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_432716e7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/310 t.ogg"
    Ant "You see it too? Say, I'm not mad, am I?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_06cf6a08:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/208 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "This is so wrong… "


translate english d5_ending_still_water_3031071d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/209 tak.ogg" 
    Pol "This is impossible!"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_cd2cf3b7:


    "The creature straightened out, its form ever-changing, made out of brimstone and a bubbling substance, solid, liquid, and gaseous at the same time."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_bc5ec226:


    "It buzzed and talked to us in an unknown language."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_12a75e39:


    "Inside the assemblage of rotating rings, white wings and bulging eyes, mouths opened up like wounds."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_781af3d6:


    "They chanted monotonous speeches that resembled prayers."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_10c11abe:


    "Flames burst out of crimson holes like they were forges and slid on top of the sizzling substance without harming the creature."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_70dcffab:


    "It was so unnatural and wrong, so scary and incomprehensible that I wanted to go blind just to unsee that thing born by the universe."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_a5d474d2:


    "To unhear the mumblings of the thing that was the fire and the wings, the eyes and the rings."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1ca322b5:


    "As my body turned to stone, I didn't even turn around at the sound of my pursuers."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_6ea1f39d:


    "Who was that giant? Why did it answer my call? What will happen to us?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_49226c2b:


    "Questions got swept out of my head."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_b0c59bd5:


    "The celestial guest rose up over the crater and produced a rumbling hum, making the entire area around us vibrate."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c297b068:


    "The wings rubbed against the swirling circles. The creature glided toward the pack."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_5171cbaa:


    "The trees that the giant wings touched burst into flames like matches. Flames painted the darkness red."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_4637cdcc:


    "Black soil was unveiled after the absurd figure, as if somebody traced a line with a marker on pristinely white paper."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_fa40921b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/210 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "Wha— What is that thing?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_81bbd4ad:


    "Somebody screamed amid the smoke."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f540ad90:


    "A howl, full of otherworldly suffering, rolled across the taiga. The pack met the celestial horror face to face."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c61a9b9a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/311 z.ogg"
    Ant "My grandma knew…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_afe87178:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/211 oc.ogg" 
    Pol "About what?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_41930bd9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/312o.ogg"
    Ant "About the cross. That it can summon…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_0858427a:


    "I didn't know what name to give to the thing that descended from the heavens. It looked nothing like an angel."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_41493570:


    "From all the shock I endured, I didn't even notice how the cross that I'd been clutching all this time grew red hot."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1147254e:


    "I yelped out of pain and dropped it. The cross disappeared in the snow pile."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_2a2f5f75:


    "It dissolved in the snow as if it accomplished its mission, leaving only a stream of white steam and snake-like hissing."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_26244c02:


    "Who would've thought that the words of an ancient chant, along with an inconspicuous-looking cross that was a family heirloom, could lead to this?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1345c4aa:


    "The realization that my grandma could be somehow connected to the cosmic guest left me speechless."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f9d8d8ea:


    "The thing that could barely be called an angel was as horrific as the demons that chased us."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_d2a46a71:


    "The pines fell, filling the night with heart-rending screeching. Our pursuers screamed at the top of their lungs."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1c1b1922:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/313 b.ogg"
    Ant "Run!"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c2566613:


    "We rushed in the opposite direction."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_a049fdec:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/212 beg.ogg"
    "A ball of fire grew behind our backs. The fire raged, its flames licking the tree trunks, eating away at the coniferous needles."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_e82d8fde:


    "The sap sizzled as it boiled. A pine fell, kicking up bundles of sparks."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1a494981:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/213 tam.ogg" 
    Pol "Look, a car!"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_6da42468:


    "I could also see the low beam of a car, slowly driving toward us."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_aa039b0d:


    "We jumped out onto the road and started waving our hands. The car swerved to the side of the road."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_1a34c736:


    "I almost suffocated from joy and relief when I saw my father."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_7ec23283:



    voice "voice/father/day5/31 Gd.ogg"
    Pap "Where have you been? What's going on?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_32c37418:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/315 v.ogg"
