translate english d5_ending_still_water_1a86604b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/21 Nen.ogg"
    Mam "I hate you..."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_51706151:


    "Scared Polina pressed her back into the seat and turned toward the window, probably in the hopes of catching a glimpse of the morning through the dark clouds."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_43e60129:


    "I don't want to go to a place where my parents will kill each other or get divorced. I don't want to go to that grim future."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_36ed8016:


