translate english d5_ending_still_water_f32a48c0:


    "My inner voice darted in my head, it whispered, choking on fear:"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_8be65b38:


    "{i}\"We need to run on the snowy trail, get out true face, save the pack... save my sister.\"{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_18fb0022:


