translate english d5_ending_still_water_fe0951a9:


    "My parents just shrugged in reply, leaving the decision in my hands."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_cc85437a:


    "Polina's smile was so tender I couldn't turn her down."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_6a54ff17:


    "I closed my eyes. Felt the surface of the mask with my skin. For some reason, it was warm and damp."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c111f822:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/03 ha.ogg" 
    "I looked at my family. Polina burst out laughing, relieved. Mom looked away."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_b2b41307:



    voice "voice/bunny/04 Ti.ogg"
    Noname "{i}You've returned, little exile.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_3df8dd6c:


    "Dad looked at me with sad eyes, but his voice was cheerful."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_890a2972:



    voice "voice/father/day5/52 Ta.ogg"
    Pap "So what about our cake? Come on, master of the house."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_2cabde5f:



    voice "voice/bunny/05 Ho.ogg" 
    "{i}\"Master...\"{/i} echoed the voice only I could hear."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_9e1afddb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/305 On.ogg"
    Pol "He's so pensive today."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_f9d0d998:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/59 Vse.ogg"
    Mam "Always have been."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_b1e8ecea:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/60 Si.ogg" 
    Mam "Sonny, there's just a couple of hours left until New Year's, and we desire sweets."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_e14a4a77:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/103 Ko.ogg"
    Ant "Right…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_562eb96f:


    "We went to the table. Dad filled our glasses, laughing."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_4bbf428d:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/61 Nu.ogg" 
    Mam "What are you doing? They don't drink."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_96f57b8f:



    voice "voice/father/day5/54 Ta.ogg"
    Pap "Well, I'll drink for them… It's a holiday, after all…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_704aa06c:


    "I took the knife and held it over the tasty treat."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_8fed7728:


    "{i}A holiday.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_869712a7:


    "{i}\"The day of screaming meat\".{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_8470cb94:


    "{i}\"For the fox, and for the bear...\"{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_7b5e3eff:


    "Whispers were born behind my frontal bone. My face went numb under the mask. My hand shook."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_09466545:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/62 Po.ogg" 
    Mam "Polina, can you perform a little concert for us?"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_957aa6c6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/306 Es.ogg" 
    Pol "If you wish…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_6863bfdc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/55 Vs.ogg"
    Pap "It's much better than all those {u}\"Little blue lights\"{/u}…"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_83113d5f:


    "Saliva filled my mouth. I turned the knife so I could see my parents and the pregnant Polina reflected in its blade."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_bf3925dc:


    "{i}Treats for the ancient forest. For the old, hungry Bunny.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_d156ae73:


    "{i}What did the priest say, again? Bread is flesh?{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_71e470a7:


    "I gulped."


translate english d5_ending_still_water_60637164:


    "{i}Thank you, o Lord, for my food and my den, and all these tasty humans around me.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_c9e8ba61:


    "{i}It was time to gather the pack once more.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_d1370818:


    "{i}In the name of cold, darkness, and the forest.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_still_water_4e2b113f:


    "{i}Amen.{/i}"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_de3dbd46:


    "The amulet had already saved me from certain death once. I hoped it would do the same again."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_dff838a0:


    "I ripped off the claw, and gray snow started falling from the top of the treetop, covered in pitch-black darkness."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_c4db67ff:


    "A slim chance for salvation made its way from my numb hands to Olya's neck."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_bc256d25:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/27 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "I want to go to Mommy!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d44a40c5:


    "This was the right thing to do. As the older brother, I needed to protect her..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_cd9d70c2:


    "In the end, out of the two of us, she's the only one who retained her light."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9674f759:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/328 B.ogg"
    Ant "Let's run, Olya!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_20b84b4c:


    "We rushed through the forest that despised us. Everything that's alive and warm-blooded was foreign to it."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_b844acf9:


    "The forest wanted us to become like its treasures—cold, lying obediently under the icy crust."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_2924a32d:


    "The moon that looked like a ball of yellowed worms would occasionally peek out from the naked treetops."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8184fbfe:


    "The moon and I both knew. Nobody would help us."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_1cb94f90:


    "The adults didn't believe us, and Tikhonov brushed us off because I couldn't prove my words."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_af33fe50:


    "It was all over. The thicket would become our grave. It was great at burying kids."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_faecfeb5:


    "Something hooted and howled behind me. Polina's coat flashed in front of me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_6bf3dc27:


    "And then that bright spot suddenly disappeared."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_884749be:


    "I came to an abrupt stop. Olya crashed into me and hugged me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d47fe997:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/28 gde.ogg"
    Oly "Where's Polina?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e36eeac8:


    "There was a ravine in front of us, enmeshed with black vein-like roots."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_75614b4e:


    "Polina lay squirming at the bottom of it. She ran right off the edge after failing to notice it."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_4187c7c4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/329 P.ogg"
    Ant "Polina!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_37a6fb2b:


    "The ravine replied with a moan."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_644eac24:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/330 Y.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, stay here. I'll be right back."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8c40f37e:


    "My sister stepped away, although reluctantly. I stared at the thicket, and after making sure there was nobody there, started my descent into the ravine."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_71d94003:


    "They came from the darkness without warning, befitting for nightly creatures."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_613469f6:


    "A winged shadow flapped its wings, and the Owl's silhouette appeared on the lunar disc."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_a1675bbc:


    "Olya shrieked at the sight of the horrific bird and ran deeper into the woods."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_074eab71:


    "The winged creature swooped down, but her prey slipped from her tenacious claws. My sister managed to escape."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8737e674:


    "The beast soared into the sky, letting out a disappointed cry."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_c4121009:


    "Did the amulet really work?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ea99e099:


    "I needed to run after her. I needed to catch up with Olya, calm her down, tell her all of this is just a bad dream..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9eb2ff06:


    "I tried to get out of the ravine, but my feet started sliding down the slope."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e817c35a:


    "I scraped at the frozen soil with my boots, but still tumbled down. To the place where a new horror awaited me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ced9afb1:


    "Teddy crawled at the bottom of the ravine, shaking his creepy head."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9ba055b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 Vs_wood.ogg" 
    "Polina, who stood on her knees, squealed at the sight of his maggot-infested eye."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_f9e78f4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/232 Dih.ogg" 
    "The beast that looked more like a rotting taxidermy bear rather than a real one, locked her in the clutches of its ugly paws and pulled her toward itself."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_931eec69:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Se.ogg"
    Bear "You're about to learn what happens to traitors."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_0bdc98c7:


    "Both Polina's body and mine turned to stone from horror."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ed692f22:


    "I lamented that my vision didn't give out along with my limbs. On the contrary, it only sharpened."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_0747c0fa:


    "Wolfy also left the shadows, twisted like a broken toy. Bits and pieces of phrases came out of his drooling maw."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e7815ae6:



    voice "voice/Wolf/126 Z.ogg"
    Wolf "Eaaat! Tea-grrr apart! Kill yoooou!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_a42d66c9:


    "Polina balanced on the edge of losing consciousness, completely limp in Teddy's paws."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_dd5e9a8a:


    "The Owl landed on a snowpile, snapping her beak. Its feathers were soaked in blood."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_f890d14f:



    voice "voice/Owl/41 Dev.ogg"
    Owl "I was promised the girl!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_83cc05fc:



    voice "voice/Owl/42 Ga.ogg" 
    Owl "The nasty brat doomed me to starve, hoot!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_f4c4b5a4:


    "The Owl, still shaking in frustration, spread out her giant wings that had parasites writhing inside them."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_5a463a8e:


    "And moved toward me, clearly angry."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_20badb86:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/279 N.ogg"
    Ant "Don't!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_cf25022d:


    "The shadows grew thicker, as if inching closer to hear me plead for my pitiful life."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_747d3310:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/335 N.ogg"
    Ant "Don't kill us… I…"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e816d2ec:


    "And then I had an epiphany."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_bc51cfa4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/336 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I'm the Bunny."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_b979d4cb:



    voice "voice/Owl/43 Kto.ogg" 
    Owl "Who-who-hoot?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_50a1f796:


    "Wolfy choked on saliva that was dripping from his fangs."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8ace7ae1:


    "The effigy that barely resembled a bear breathed heavily and then burst out laughing."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc1a9436:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/09 ti.ogg"
    Bear "You?! What a joke!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8b545128:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/10 na.ogg"
    Bear "The true Bunny has already been found and will soon get here."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc89c1dc:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/11 e.ogg"
    Bear "Oh, we will play..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_891a1c0b:


    "Wolfy took a step toward me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_5f8be93f:


    "I was grasping at straws at this point... or the last seconds of my life."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_278182e6:


    "It was so shameful, begging for these moments..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_920814f7:


    "For a second, I even regretted that I gave the amulet to Olya."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_7178ff6b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/337 H.ogg"
    Ant "Stop it! Why do you need us?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_7fe02ec3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/338 T.ogg"
    Ant "You saved me... You said that I'd be fine, remember?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_b2ba1fbd:


    "Wolfy's ears perked up. His stare was hauntingly empty."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9a343358:


    "His faint mumbling formed words."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8b47c6ec:



    voice "voice/Wolf/127 Da.ogg"
    Wolf "Yes... Yes... You agrrr... fine..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_437e2475:



    voice "voice/Wolf/128 No.ogg"
    Wolf "But my old fgrrriend over here..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_12d3c2f6:


    "The flute's sounds reached my ears, mysterious and piercing."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9a3b7dc5:


    "The scowling Wolfy walked toward me, but stopped midway. As if somebody turned him off."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_246ca13d:


    "The wind subsided, and the music grew louder."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_2969592d:


    "The beast shuddered, like the image of a paused VHS tape."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_2b1e10d5:


    "And then bright cracks ran through his silhouette. Edges of those weird scars smoldered."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_bd75a927:


    "My mouth was ajar from astonishment."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d4a842f4:


    "The wolf outfit went up in smoke, and pieces of it started falling off."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_7fcc9109:


    "They were turning into weightless ash and swirled across the ravine as flakes."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_165fbf92:


    "The wolf mask fell off, like a scab from a healing wound."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_a4180300:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/229 R.ogg"
    Pol "Roma!!!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_5558c3ac:


    "Romka's pallid face was twisted by rage. Veins popped on his forehead, his lips were cracked."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_11f19bd3:


    "He raised his upper lip like a beast and pierced me with his stare. There was a mad glint in his eyes."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_0e78f02f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/52 T.ogg"
    Rom "You were at her house, right? You were at my Polina's place, right?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8f93ff96:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/53 Ri.ogg"
    Rom "Did you draw her? Did you touch her?!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_2d455681:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/230 Ro.ogg"
    Pol "Romochka..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_959f3f54:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/54 Za.ogg"
    Rom "Shut up, whore!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_f4dc25c6:


    "Polina started bawling as she went limp in the clutches of her deformed tormentor."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_5acb042f:


    "I went numb from shock. Romka repeated the same words he said when we met near Polina's house."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_560bfecb:


    "\"So that's what happened\" I thought."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_7d8f226b:


    "All this time, the mask was sealing Romka's mind, but now my completely insane classmate was free."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_3bacf6f0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/339 R.ogg"
    Ant "Romka, look around."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8bc52291:


    "I pleaded with him to take a look around, at the horrifying ravine and the sharp branches."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_6a753eff:


    "Instead, Romka pierced me with an unblinking stare and held out his hand... It was clenching a familiar butterfly knife."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_39f65137:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/55 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "Haven't I warned you?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_160801d0:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/56 R.ogg"
    Rom "Didn't I say I'd kill... kill... kill..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d03f717d:


    "I took it as a hint to run. Romka leaped over the ravine and pushed me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_50587292:


    voice "voice/Anton/5day/280 v.ogg"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_c993c1d4:


    "It felt like lightning struck between my shoulder blades. I fell and forgot how to breathe. It took all my strength to turn around."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ec351ee1:


    "The knife's blade was painted with my blood."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_257340d6:


    "I flapped my mouth. Oxygen just wouldn't enter my lungs. In its place, coldness was filling me."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc5f5212:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/57 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "You stabbed me in the back. Now we're even."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d3d93107:


    "Polina was crying her eyes out. But even louder than her cries was the music that floated in the forest like the fog above a swamp."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_8df4dab4:


    "The flute's melody enveloped everything. Romka froze in place with his face twisted."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_1f2247fb:


    "I suddenly lost vision in my right eye, but my left eye still saw the evil moon through the tangle of branches."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_9650c83d:


    "Unable to endure its shine, I looked at the frozen madman..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_095c2769:


    "...and at the Forest Master whose grandiose silhouette towered behind Romka."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_cad48d54:


    "The Goat gave him a fatherly pat on the shoulder."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_324cbb32:


    "Romka drooled white, foamy saliva—his fiery eyes stared into space. The knife fell out of his pale fingers."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_96d3af17:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/65 be.ogg" 
    Master "My poor ba-ba-ba-by doll, totally broken."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e2029afd:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/66 ni.ogg" 
    Master "It's okay, I will fix you, just like everybody else."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ac8ec9ec:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/67 ka.ogg" 
    Master "Every one of you..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_cbcb12b0:


    "Two shorter silhouettes emerged from the darkness."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_7d151ccf:


    "Frowning Hooty licked her beak with a violet tongue. Teddy dragged the crying Polina."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_0b116849:


    "The Goat bent down and picked up the wolf mask from the ashes. He covered Romka's face with it and took out a giant needle from his sleeve."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_568e0f99:


    "Methodically, with a steady hand, he sewed the mask to the wolf's face. The needle pierced so deep that I thought it would scrape against Romka's skull."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_32cbf7cc:


    "When the Master finished his last stitch, Wolfy's eyes opened."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_0f29bbdb:



    voice "voice/Wolf/129 vs.ogg"
    Wolf "Evegrrrything would've ended fastegrrrr if I caught you that mogrrrrning."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_2226a280:



    voice "voice/Wolf/130 po.ogg"
    Wolf "Rrrremember how you found Vova's mitten?"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_423ee718:



    voice "voice/Owl/44 Eto.ogg" 
    Owl "It was us who carefully placed it on a branch near your house..."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_99370b1b:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ti.ogg"
    Bear "You were supposed to die back then."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_47c8008f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Vs.ogg"
    Bear "But that stupid Fox... Our Bunny, our Bunny... Yuck!"


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_d788067f:


    "I couldn't retort or move. Polina was drowning in tears."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_14a83807:


    "Wolfy took a step forward as he opened his mouth, full of sharp teeth."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_e5f3532e:


    "I felt his fangs lock on my neck, tearing out my Adam's apple and throwing up scarlet stripes of blood toward the sky."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_36cbf93b:


    "A moment passed, and the image of a werefolf boy, smeared in blood, changed into a monstrous taiga wolf."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_27dc9f56:


    "All the other monsters also turned into animals."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_fceec073:


    "A tall figure of the Forest Master turned into an old man with a thick beard, holding a flute, but then stretched into a forest giant again."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_83993125:


    "My sick mind thundered with curved mirrors in a kaleidoscope of horrors, mixing reality with delusions."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_b972d724:


    "As I was dying, I was unable to discern what I really saw."


translate english d5_ending_bloody_claw_ae366bcc:


    "The last thing I remembered was the blood spewing toward the moon as the wolf tore another piece out of me."


translate english d5_ending_among_us_2cbc0157:


    "The amulet is just a stupid superstition."


translate english d5_ending_among_us_d465a386:


    "A tall tale from the dark ages when bloodthirsty tribes used their own children as ritual sacrifices."


translate english d5_ending_among_us_75b0d22d:


