translate english d5_ending_hunt_1ac2f205:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/127 Chto.ogg"
    Oly "What's there?"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_3ac53925:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/233.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "Stay away!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_939c1ba4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/128 T.ogg"
    Oly "You're scaring me!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_d064c054:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/234.Sto.ogg"
    Ant "Stay where you are!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_2c655d1e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/129 To.ogg"
    Oly "That mister is scaring me..."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_108738ac:


    "Mister?"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_5217a38c:


    "A shot whizzed past my ear, leaving behind a maddening ringing sound."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_0da2ecd6:


    "The man with a harelip walked from around the granite stone."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_0f3e0500:


    "And before I could compose myself, crying Olya rushed to shield me with her body."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_7871252e:


    "She was horribly scared."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_2d7b6d4c:


    "But her fear of losing me was even greater. And I was the same, my fear maybe even greater than hers."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_e8e52ff1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/131 Cht.ogg"
    Oly "What do you want!? Go away!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_3cb1e5fc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/131 mi.ogg"
    Oly "We're good! Leave us be!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_0032675a:


    "The hulky man was horrifyingly calm, as if it wasn't the first time a child cried, pleaded, and screamed in front of him."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_0277e9e0:


    "He closed the distance between us and aimed straight at my forehead."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_9a8abced:


    "I waited for the shot to ring out in desperation."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_c7235f8c:


    "I waited for the moment where my body would flutter with the snowflakes in the sky and then immediately crash into the hole behind me."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_5dbe35ec:


    "Into the embrace of my dead parents."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_265b2191:


    "Click."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_265b2191_1:


    "Click."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_1ceca1b4:


    "The man with a harelip fiddled with the gun in his hand."


