translate english d5_ending_hunt_aadb8b21:


    "It almost felt like he was waiting for me to sympathize with him."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_b3d738dc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/132 Os.ogg"
    Oly "Leave us alone! Please, go away!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_c30a2512:



    voice "voice/killer/02Vot.ogg"
    Killer "Fuck my life..."


