    "The man with a harelip scowled."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_aea79266:


    "Then squeezed."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_f9e8af79:


    "Olya threw punches at him, trying to save me until the bitter end."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_1dc752cd:


    "She didn't keep her word. She didn't run away."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_461360c2:


    "She couldn't, just like I wouldn't be able to."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_fed4f715:


    "The killer kicked her, a defenseless and fragile girl, into the closest open grave."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_7344b05d:


    "After a moment, a heart-rending shriek came out of there, that immediately changed into hysterical crying."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_7b27a60d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/134 Mam.ogg"
    Oly "Mommy! Mommy!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_5d2cf269:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/134 Mam2.ogg"
    Oly "Mommyyyyy!!!"


translate english d5_ending_hunt_25667c85:


    "The killer started mumbling loudly in an attempt to drown out Olya's wailing."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_3d7133e6:



    voice "voice/killer/08prosty.ogg"
    Killer "According to your unfailing love, according to your great compassion, blot out my transgressions."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_35668412:


    "His fingers clutched my neck, preventing me from breathing. His nails tore into my skin."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_32185cd4:


