translate english d5_ending_hunt_7ea05686:


    "Blue circles that looked like rainbow stains that gasoline left in puddles, spread before my eyes."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_b6ba89d6:



    voice "voice/killer/10e.ogg"
    Killer "And grant your grace to the souls of the departed little ones..."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_68d059c0:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/136 Rud2.ogg"
    "Olya kept on screaming from the bottom of a freshly-dug grave."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_fb0ca14e:


    "And I grew weaker with every new line from the Holy Scripture."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_bdc5ec14:


    "My inner voice whispered: \"Run! Escape!\""


translate english d5_ending_hunt_13076743:


    "And I tried to escape for one last time."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_543e7e50:


    "To the world of my dreams."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_35fa3968:


    "I imagined myself running to save Olya."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_0778b339:


    "I imagined carrying her, enveloped in sunlight, and us dissolving into the whiteness of first morning rays."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_28e05773:


    "A happy and peaceful feeling that was hitherto unknown to me took over my soul."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_c2ba2c8d:


