    "Just a trick my imagination played on me."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_e1cff15a:


    "And then I once again fell into pleasant slumber, happy that none of this was actually happening to me."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_58969e2e:


    "When the morning comes, I'll see my little sister, my parents, Polina, my friends..."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_29bc4a6b:


    "But no matter how much I tried..."


translate english d5_ending_hunt_7f92df59:


    "...I could no longer wake up."


translate english d5_ending_call_7b1c038d:


    "I felt someone's touch on my shoulder."


translate english d5_ending_call_678044ef:


    "Polina jumped out of the darkness, her breath heavy and her hair ruffled."


translate english d5_ending_call_bd75c83b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/12 be.ogg"
    Pol "Run!"


translate english d5_ending_call_4ad05603:


    "I wanted to ask her about Romka, but I was interrupted by Wolfy's howls in the snowy graveyard."


translate english d5_ending_call_4e5cc8c8:


    "We ran from the monsters, hitting the tightly planted gravestones."


translate english d5_ending_call_bf9d7b57:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/105 mi.ogg"
    Master "We'll find you!"


translate english d5_ending_call_e854bb08:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/106 v.ogg"
    Master "In the ravines, in the pits, under the roots! Oh, we will find you!"


translate english d5_ending_call_2199010b:


    "Snowflakes tickled my skin as they glided upward."


translate english d5_ending_call_1774bad5:


    "And a massive leaden cloud swelled above our heads as it devoured the moon."


translate english d5_ending_call_f50e1f49:


    "I saw the abandoned shack of the night guard, granite gravestones with destroyed faces, graves with numbers instead of names, and the crypts from the previous century."


translate english d5_ending_call_8d11f69a:


    "I saw gaping holes in the ground, artificial flowers in vases, hungry eyes in the darkness."


translate english d5_ending_call_41890c80:


    "And then I could only see the forest that grew outside the fence."


translate english d5_ending_call_f75ad509:


    "We squeezed through the bars."


translate english d5_ending_call_712c88a6:


    "If Polina were a violin, she'd be playing at her absolute limit."


translate english d5_ending_call_2f9c97d9:


    "But I also felt like she was a firecracker that explodes in the winter sky."


translate english d5_ending_call_bc6c0825:


    "Our pursuers whistled closer and closer to us."


translate english d5_ending_call_d01deefe:


    "Too hungry to forget about our bones and our sweet meat."


translate english d5_ending_call_5862bb65:


    "We became prey."


translate english d5_ending_call_7ffaf512:


    "No, we were always prey—game for the hunters that will never tire and never stop their chase."


translate english d5_ending_call_9a557374:


    "The road ended."


translate english d5_ending_call_99e10d2b:


    "Ahead of us was only taiga—the kingdom of shadows, writhing in the snow piles."


translate english d5_ending_call_1893e9ed:


    "I stopped near the ancient pines."


translate english d5_ending_call_edd08438:


    "I remembered everything I've lost, everything the forest took away from me: my father, with his wise, calm smile, my beautiful mom, my little sister with the sun halo over her fluffy hair."


translate english d5_ending_call_72c813bb:


    "All my family perished in the taiga."


translate english d5_ending_call_3f31f0b1:


    "But it wasn't only them..."


translate english d5_ending_call_ad6830b1:


    "The forest took away the taste of cotton candy in the faraway Disneyland, all my toys, my unreleased comic book, my first kiss, my future."


translate english d5_ending_call_a2780765:


    "Instead of school, friendship, love–only intertwined branches of coniferous hell."


translate english d5_ending_call_2ebc2c87:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/247.Kakoi.ogg"
    Ant "What's the point in running there?"


translate english d5_ending_call_a1104b14:


