translate english d5_ending_in_dark_d5ca5fe4:


    "Then, the claws the size of butcher knives grabbed me, dragged me outside, and lifted me high in the air, toward the sky."


translate english d5_ending_in_dark_5fba8b35:


    "Teeth and claws, sharp like a blade, ate into my flesh, tore it apart, piece by piece."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_92db42cf:


    "The endless forest at the end of all worlds."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_06c6803b:


    "The wind, singing the songs of eternal hunger to the children of darkness."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_3b4a3631:


    "The pack was anticipating its feast. We were about to dine. The festival of meat and bones was about to start."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_393792d2:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/75 kak.ogg"
    Master "You took your time to bring us the treaaaats, Bunny."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_ba2d94ac:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/76 Do.ogg" 
    Master "Welcome."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_2a85de3f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/77 mi.ogg" 
    Master "We're haaaappy to seee you."


translate english d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_69885241:


    "The axe and the sack, leaking red juice, that I held in my hand. I was finally home."


translate english d5_ending_contract_908f8e6b:


    "Polina's crazed smile scared me."


translate english d5_ending_contract_20de9c27:


    "It felt like she was enjoying herself. And everything that's already happened or was about to happen to us."


translate english d5_ending_contract_3be76222:


    "She always acted like that, the entire time I've known her. As if she was possessed."


translate english d5_ending_contract_f0825b1e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/kak.ogg"
    Ant_m "Just like me."


translate english d5_ending_contract_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english d5_ending_contract_b9a3520d:


    "My thoughts about the devilish companion inside me were also scary."


translate english d5_ending_contract_3c551914:


    "So the last thing I wanted to do was involve myself with someone as bonkers as me."


translate english d5_ending_contract_90f30518:


    "I moved toward the window, further away from Polina, and watched her the entire trip, afraid to fall asleep and fall into delirium again."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c931bdf3:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/105 Sv.ogg"
    Ant "Light."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a6063105:



    voice "voice/Al/01 V.ogg"
    Smart "You didn't say \"Let there be light\", master."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_80a6a522:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/106 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I may be a creative type, but my world is quite dark."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5fd2d35f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/107 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Just turn on the light, smart-ass."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d4d0ee9:



    voice "voice/Al/02 E.ogg"
    Smart "And there was light."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d03c7f5:


    "I squinted, like I do every day, ready on the inside to see something else in place of the interior of a wealthy mansion…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f1d1c229:


    "A wooden, shadow-woven house from my past, that got destroyed in a fire on that frosty night."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a13772e6:


    "But, like always, the bright lamps illuminated white plastic, an easel with an unfinished painting."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3d095496:


    "A brand new mansion, built far away from my grandma's estate."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a890210c:


    "My bachelor den."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1d9c3664:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/108 K.ogg"
    Ant "Coffee."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ad50ddad:



    voice "voice/Al/03 Uze.ogg"
    Smart "Already on it, master."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_12fc1775:


    "If not for my diligent friend over there, created with conductors and sensors, I would've been completely alone in this forest."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2b3bc846:


    "My agent is still in disbelief over the fact that I managed to maintain my sanity in this godforsaken place."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d99fa09:


    "Could I be so shortsighted as to fail to notice the chthonic feel of this land?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_843a5848:


    "In reality, only a place like this, reminiscent of the dark house I used to live in, could help me create."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b2e171f8:


    "I drank the coffee. It was tasteless."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f48726c6:


    "Snowflakes drifted in the air outside the wide windows made of bulletproof glass."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_afe79ca2:


    "It started snowing last night while I was working on my next project. Now the snowfall won't stop for weeks."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2e07fada:


    "No, this world was never good. Not for me, at the very least."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c6b35707:


    "I peered into the thick forest."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b58a24cf:


    "It surrounded the fortress, built using my specifications and under my strict guidance."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ddc284f2:


    "Shadows with mannerisms of lurking predators nestled in between the trees."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_67d626c0:


    "I could almost hear the voices of kids, beckoning me to dance under the full moon."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_116a5ab2:


    "A snow-laden graveyard appeared before my eyes."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_352ff415:


    "I rehearsed in my mind."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_023b2db4:


    "Standing where I was, I extended my hand. A .38 gun was hidden under the ledge."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_575c6d28:


    "My actions were rehearsed, thought out to every small detail."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c4950100:


    "Countless rooms conceptually divided. Three steps to the right and I won't be able to reach the gun."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_45425a2b:


    "There starts the territory of my other good friend. A straight razor that lay in a hidden compartment under the coffee table."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_effdfeef:


    "I have around forty ways to end my life: knives, ropes, strychnine, sulfuric acid, and many more."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1f806b96:


    "I acquired fame I always dreamed about. But what did I spend my royalties on?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_26b38bdf:


    "On a prison for a single inmate."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b60a3519:


    "And on very rare, especially poisonous snakes, that I could let out of the terrarium with a press of a button."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_faf3683d:


    "This sad, lonely end was still better than the horrors that my inner voice promised me."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a178bc5f:


    "I glanced back at the easel. The painting looked like a window into another world in the center of an ultra-modern living room."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_de2de461:


    "And a frosted window was, in fact, pictured on it."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_56a46ea1:


    "With almost the same view that opened from my wide windows in reality."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f125e60:


    "Then again, what is reality?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_55cde3ba:


    "I only paint during the night and fall asleep exhausted in the morning."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b1731245:


    "Leaving my safety concerns to a sophisticated security system."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ce9549a3:


    "One other thing pictured in the painting is the hands of a boy who is touching the glass. Rime thaws under his fingers."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b9ecc535:


    "And makes visible the clearing in front of the house and the tiny creatures prancing in the ghastly moonlight."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_82cae3e2:


    "Or are those just little whirls, ghosts created by the blizzard?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ae25e442:


    "I stood in front of the easel. If I were to strain my eyes, I could discern the reflection in the window."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c014a779:


    "The face of the person who extended his small hands toward the ancient mystery of the forest."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4957d7ce:


    "No, not his face. An old mask with long ears."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96ed9db9:


    "My agent once asked me why I have to paint all this depressing stuff."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_85cc1b2d:


    "Why I put so much despair and primal horror into them."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ee6d570e:


    "I retorted as I shuffled ice inside a glass, full of whiskey: \"Are you unhappy with our earnings?\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9a3ce2bc:


    "Darkness sells."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_008161c3:


    "It's always there with us, even if we stuff every inch of our houses with light bulbs."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dee2ee3a:


    "My childhood was a swamp, emanating noxious fog, and I built my house in the marshes."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4f3797a3:


    "When I start drowning, I'll have dozens of ways to avoid overstaying in this world."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6c753ff9:


    "I look around the paintings on my walls. Animal masks are the leitmotif of my midnight art."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb276a71:


    "Duplicity, double-think, giant childish eyes, snaking trails in an endless forest."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f8355567:


    "Mom among the shadows."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1bf29890:


    "A feast of meat behind the windbreak."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_63389845:


    "A long time ago, voices in the night called out to the scared boy. Now he grew up and is summoning darkness himself with his paintings."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_78831694:


    "Come. from the forest or from the darkest corners inside the sick mind."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3cccf518:


    "I have something for you."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_760e57fb:


    "Things that hurt, the way you love."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6b8a5548:


    "But I have no fear to give. I don't care for my own skin, and my family is far away."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b4ef4ac3:


    "My father is alive, but I had to reduce our interaction to a few phone calls a year, to keep him safe. Maybe… "


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9103708e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/109 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "Maybe it will come today."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e1d72d61:



    voice "voice/Al/04 V.ogg"
    Smart "You say that every day, master."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_540a3e1f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/110 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "You're here to listen. Any news?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_184242af:



    voice "voice/Al/05 S.ogg"
    Smart "There's an article that might interest you."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_cf35e7c3:



    voice "voice/Al/06 G.ogg"
    Smart "A genius of dead spaces. Anton Petrov's Moscow art installation."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_cfc34c3c:



    voice "voice/Al/07 H.ogg"
    Smart "Do you want to listen?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_485214c6:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/111 Va.ogg"
    Ant "Whatever. Just give me the closing lines."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_8d2dcc82:



    voice "voice/Al/08 Te.ogg"
    Smart "…disappointment awaited those who hoped to see the artist in person."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4660b7b3:



    voice "voice/Al/09 ot.ogg"
    Smart "The hermit artist stayed true to his name and stayed in his taiga haven…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d3e45a3:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/112 X.ogg"
    Ant "Enough. Crime reports?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bbbf2b7c:



    voice "voice/Al/10 kak.ogg"
    Smart "Shall I limit them to your area, as usual?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7a084a36:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/113 T.ogg"
    Ant "You know…."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5726989d:



    voice "voice/Al/11 te.ogg"
    Smart "Tags: drunken brawls, domestic violence, looting."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9642d6d0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/114 H.ogg"
    Ant "Good…."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4b107efa:


    "The critics dissecting my paintings always politely leave out the most important thing… "


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0f043a84:


    "…but that verdict can be read between the lines. They think the author is insane."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f07880fe:


    "Oh, they're missing the most important part."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_45875b60:


    "The creator of the \"Cold Hollow Mother\" and the \"Cradle of the Black Garage\" has a basement full of TNT."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5cf96642:


    "The system is programmed to lock it automatically."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb512621:


    "If I were to go downstairs and start losing control, I can just say the password, and the explosives will go off."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_65c3f6b9:


    "Bam! And all my scribbles burn to the ground."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1db70662:


    "Its only purpose is to help me buy even more elaborate ways to violently end my existence."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c5273634:


    "You want to get to my sister, huh, you foul creature inside my head?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c943c35b:


    "I'll feed you her portraits."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_29dc3e6f:


    "\"The little girl that is a recurring character in Petrov's paintings is the only one hundred percent bright spot in…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ec2c4ed8:


    "…his usually soot-black artwork,\" or so said the critics."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c8aa7e6f:


    "\"But the beautiful girl playing a violin that was featured in the \"Snow-laden\" series… "


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_91d33d27:


    "…most likely represents the bitterness toward lost happiness.\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_465b06da:


    "In this case, the critics nailed it."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_19d3c14f:


    "But they also didn't mention what was behind my heroines."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ee2ac862:


    "Behind the canvases, inside the house that I will never share with Polina were… "


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1aed29dc:


    "Securable vaults with deadly weapons for the artist."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9e74c83a:


    "I walked to the window once again, staring at the floating snowflakes and the eternal twilight behind them."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0438ee1d:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/115 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "Is it possible I've still missed a scenario or two?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a1afc4d0:



    voice "voice/Al/12 a.ogg"
    Smart "Analyzing..."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_269a7c0a:



    voice "voice/Al/13 te.ogg"
    Smart "Tags: hermit, suicidal ideation, guns."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f5f3b2d3:



    voice "voice/Al/14 s.ogg"
    Smart "According to the web, your behavior can be a symptom of a very serious mental condition."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4320c2df:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/116 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "All of this is real!"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_fafcf3cd:


    "I poked the canvas with my finger. The Wold stared at me with scorching yellow eyes of a night hunter."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b5db1d9a:



    voice "voice/Al/15 ho.ogg"
    Smart "Do you want me to dial the suicide prevention hotline for you?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a71a288a:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/117 H.ogg"
    Ant "I want you to shut up and make me more coffee."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_07b8a87a:



    voice "voice/Al/16 me.ogg"
    Smart "Grinding the beans..."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96f36837:


    "I looked at the forest, clenching and relaxing my restless fingers, licking my lips, unblinking."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_aca2b782:


    "Then my gaze shifted to the snowflakes."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_80f9f74b:


    "Then closer, to the window."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2349117e:


    "On the person reflected in it."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dcc3cf0a:


    "I tell myself that this scrawny, evil man is normal."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e4ae6fdd:


    "I drink all these medications that the shrinks prescribed to me."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_314c1cf8:


    "I wiped clean many couches at the office of the local Zigmund freaking Freud."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_29f1456a:


    "I know what happened many years ago. I can perceive what's real and what's not."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5feb49f8:


    "I have a journal where I write down all of my thoughts."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_781a3b93:


    "This is all real."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e390c4c7:



    voice "voice/Al/17 Po.ogg"
    Smart "You've got a new message."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e73c6c99:


    "As much as I anticipated death, I also waited on the news from private investigators."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_75042235:


    "I didn't only monitor the events happening in my local area, but I also hired professionals to find my old friends."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_47ab92e4:


    "My gaze slid across the animal masks, painted with oil."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_fccd7bf6:


    "I worked with bloggers, ufologists, cryptozoologists… "


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4d431e05:


    "…all sorts of freaks, specializing in paranormal activities."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_660497f7:


    "All I've got from them so far were just delusional urban legends."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c34259d8:


    "Along with AI-generated pictures and videos."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d7fa89df:


    "I opened my tablet. It was a mail from a faraway place, the dark side of the web."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_74d2fedf:


    "Its author was anonymous. I would've drawn him as a worm writhing in the rotting flesh of the dark web."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3dc6ccf2:


    "The e-mail stated:"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_df5c971c:


    "\"I think this is what you've been looking for.\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d0958231:


    "\"Be careful.\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_06904a54:


    "\"This video was taken by a group of tourists who went missing in the taiga.\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_740c4b27:


    "\"Pay me in crypto, to the usual wallet.\""


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7eace3c4:


    "The anonymous knew that his employer would pay him well."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bccb63f8:


    "But it was too early to celebrate. My prey slipped away from the traps I set so many times before."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_861d8b51:


    "Let's see what the net I cast into the sea brought this time."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a93266cd:


    "I opened the video."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f2bca59f:


    "It showed the ancient taiga forest."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_da2b749f:


    "I peered into the darkness between the pines, my throat parched."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9c808b5b:


    "Into the same spot the people surrounding a tent were looking."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e87e9d66:


    "What made them crawl out of their sleeping bags in the middle of the night?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f24192b:


    "I raised the volume."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2fd72619:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/03 Govo.ogg"
    Girl "I'm telling you, I heard kids laughing."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_94322087:


    "Wind howled from the speaker, chilling my skin."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2d2a5d09:


    "The rays from flashlights crossed, poking the darkness in terror."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_efc2dbea:


    "They illuminated the trees, their gigantic trunks that surrounded the tourists."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_26b017d4:


    "The night howled and crunched with the windbreak. As if something was getting closer to the camp…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb2ec82c:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/07 Tam.ogg"
    Tourist "Someone is standing there!"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b5aa2db0:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/08 Gde.ogg"
    Tourist "Where?"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3fcb03a3:


    "The person filming turned the camera toward the thicket."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9435cb23:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/09 Ktoto.ogg"
    Tourist "Someone huge!"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1be19402:


    "Snow fell between the camera and the encroaching shadows. The pause lasted for an eternity."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bc323633:


    "In the howling wind, in the panting of the scared bunch of people, there was something else mixed in—a gentle, ingratiating sound."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_02d2a416:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/10 Dava.ogg"
    "I breathed in through clenched lips."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5f1c007c:


    "The flute's melody created blutty images in my mind. Shadow carnival under the hungry moon."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e46cbc80:


    "The picture lurched. The trees flashed."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_44bd9bcc:


    "I didn't want to hear the tourists scream and the beasts howl as they crack the branches."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_19a68687:


    "I sent the tablet flying into the wall, and it smashed into plastic pieces."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0f0b13ae:


    "I need to calm down. I need to get that music of the ancient forest out of my head."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6ac4550c:


    "What did I just see? Nothing."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f22f524e:


    "It was a play. A student movie for one viewer, rich and naive enough to pay for such an obvious fake."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3e8ba2d0:


    "They even splurged on some good visual effects."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84422145:


    "Gotta ease my mind… don't panic… forget…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a4119518:


    "I went to the easel and picked up the brush. Dipped it in paint and concentrated on picking the perfect place on the canvas."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f9fa582:


    "Then did a single stroke and looked in the window."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dcc26c12:


    "I saw the room and the easel in the reflection…"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0d4cf159:


    "And the creature standing beside it."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2b32036a:


    "Red paint dripped from the brush in its hand. It was finishing the painting in my place."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_18d35dcf:


    "The creature somewhat resembled a bunny with long ears."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0c7c1c48:


    "It's here. It has come for me!"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_656ad98a:


    "I staggered back, ready to grab the gun, but the room was empty."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_933f2b98:


    "{sc=2}The usual headache was back.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7fc0fdf6:


    "{sc=2}I know who I am. I know who paints my works.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f57992e8:


    "{sc=2}I know why I need the weapons.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_008c6ce9:


    "{sc=2}I…{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bca46c31:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/121 Uni.ogg"
    Ant_glitch5 "{sc=3}Destroy this house!!!{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1a9b9b64:



    voice "voice/Al/20 u.ogg"
    Smart "Please specify the command."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dfa3999d:



    voice "voice/Al/21 na.ogg"
    Smart "Password, please."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ec409a2d:


    "{sc=2}My heart was beating at its limit. The panic attack completely cornered me.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b630cd6d:


    "{sc=2}I need to calm down!{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_38b6032a:



    voice "voice/Al/22 na.ogg"
    Smart "Password, please."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7836dfcd:


    "{sc=2}I pressed my palms against my ears.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1b245734:


    "{sc=2}Snowflakes swirled outside, and I felt like my house was inside one of those glass balls with bits of styrofoam.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_492c4c52:


    "{sc=2}Shake it, and it will snow.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84227d53:


    "{sc=2}I'm not insane.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_27d0f761:


    "{sc=2}I need to pick the right path.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_533c83d7:


    "{sc=2}But what is right?{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4f9baca9:



    voice "voice/Al/22 n.ogg"
    Smart "Password, please."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c84ed15d:


    "{sc=2}I looked up and opened my mouth.{/sc}"


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f30e71e6:


    "But now that I'm sure they've returned, my suicide will have to wait."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_aae42f4b:


    "I'll spend all my wealth on publishing a book, a biographic comic, masked as fiction. It will be the most impressive print run ever."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d3213e59:


    "It will get translated into all known languages, and if needed, the author will also pay for a movie adaptation."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96a5de7e:


    "I'm not alone. Other victims of this darkness exist out there. They need support."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84835386:


    "The comic book will help obsessed people like me to deal with the taiga plague. It will guide the hunters to the tracks of elusive demons in animal masks."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0acf7ebd:


    "I won't be scared into silence. I finally have a goal."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_61d58263:


    "I barely use my drawing tablet, but when it comes to popularizing the demonic masks of the Forest Master, this tool is way more reliable compared to oil paint. Let's leave the brushes to purists."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1eba6b11:


    "The stylus is sliding across the screen. Rectangles and squares get filled with silhouettes, bubbles—with words."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_823fbd9c:


    "This is my story."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_23a8261d:


    "The wind clawed at the window all night long. It wandered the fields and howled like a hungry beast."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5fd73e48:


    "When the clock struck midnight, the boy stood up from his bed and went to the window."


translate english d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d23629f8:


    "The forest, the snow, and the dancing creatures all basked in ghastly moonlight. They froze as soon as they felt somebody else was watching them and turned toward the house."

